rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Damage wears off simultaneously with this effect ending, so it does save an artifact creature from lethal damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "If combat damage is dealt to players by multiple artifact creatures you control (including, perhaps, Sharding Sphinx itself), Sharding Sphinx\'s ability will trigger that many times. You\'ll get that many Thopter tokens. You\'ll get just one token per creature, no matter how much combat damage that creature dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect can reduce only the generic portion of the artifact spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of an artifact spell. Rather, it reduces the total cost of the spell, which is the amount you actually pay while casting it. The total cost takes into account additional or alternative costs."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Steel Hellkite\'s third ability is activated with X equal to 0, it will destroy each nonland permanent with mana value 0 the appropriate players control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a nonland permanent has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a token that\'s not copying of something else, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If a permanent is copying something else, its mana value is the mana value of whatever it\'s copying."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'In all cases, ignore any alternative costs or additional costs (such as kicker) paid when the permanent was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled those permanents at the time Steel Hellkite dealt combat damage, or if those permanents were even on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Steel Hellkite\'s last ability destroys only nonland permanents whose mana value is exactly equal to X, and only those controlled by players who have been dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The mana value of a permanent is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner, unless it\'s copying something else (see below). The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may activate the last ability even if Steel Hellkite hasn\'t dealt combat damage to any players that turn. If you do, the ability won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If, during your declare attackers step, Darksteel Juggernaut is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or is affected by “summoning sickness,” then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having Darksteel Juggernaut attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won\'t cause Darksteel Juggernaut to be put into the graveyard. However, it can be put into the graveyard for a number of other reasons. The most likely reasons are if its toughness is 0 or less or it\'s sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Since Darksteel Juggernaut is itself an artifact, its power and toughness will always be at least 1 while it\'s on the battlefield (unless a spell or ability somehow changes its card type)."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The first ability works in all zones.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "“Protection from all colors” means protection from white, from blue, from black, from red, and from green. (In other words, it doesn\'t just mean “protection from objects that have all five colors.”)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger because a creature was destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until after Phyrexian Rebirth finishes resolving. This means the Horror creature token can be targeted by those abilities, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature regenerates or has indestructible, it won\'t be counted when determining the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the artifact it\'s copying, as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'Each time the ability triggers, you can pay {2} only one time to get one token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If the artifact that caused Mirrorworks\'s ability to trigger has already left the battlefield by the time the ability resolves, you can still pay {2}. If you do, you\'ll still put a token onto the battlefield. That token has the copiable values of the characteristics of that nontoken artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The copiable values of the token\'s characteristics are the same as the copiable values of the characteristics of the artifact it\'s copying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Spine of Ish Sah\'s last ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it. You must find another way to get Spine of Ish Sah into the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Mycosynth Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If the value chosen for X is larger than the number of cards left in your library, you\'ll lose the game the next time state-based actions are performed."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as the ability resolves. If, at that time, you control no artifacts, you won\'t look at any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The last ability will trigger, at most, once per combat damage step per player. However, if at least one artifact creature you control has first strike and others don\'t, or if an artifact creature you control has double strike, the ability could trigger twice per combat: once in each combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Thopter Spy Network\'s first ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless you control an artifact as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you don\'t control an artifact as it resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "If you activate Relic of Progenitus\'s first ability, the targeted player chooses which card to exile. The choice is made as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You can activate Relic of Progenitus\'s second ability even if no players have any cards in their graveyards. You\'ll still draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Artifact tokens that are sacrificed or destroyed are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Marionette Master\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master and an artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Marionette Master\'s ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master\'s power is negative, the target opponent doesn\'t lose (or gain) life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The amount of life lost is determined as Marionette Master\'s last ability resolves. If Marionette Master is no longer on the battlefield, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life is lost."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If the target creature has indestructible, it isn\'t destroyed this way and you won\'t gain life. If it is destroyed but put into a zone other than a graveyard, you\'ll gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'Use the toughness of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life to gain.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the total mana value of noncreature artifacts you control is 11 or greater, Metalwork Colossus costs {0} to cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Metalwork Colossus\'s last ability can be activated only if it is in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Metalwork Colossus, no player may take actions to try to change the number of artifacts its controller controls before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Metalwork Colossus is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three noncreature artifacts each with mana value 2, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Metalwork Colossus is {5}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an artifact with the highest mana value as your upkeep begins, Padeem\'s second ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t cast an instant to destroy an opponent\'s artifact during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you no longer control an artifact with the highest mana value as Padeem\'s triggered ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The artifact you control has to have the highest mana value only among artifacts on the battlefield, not among all permanents on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says “Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.”"}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Servo Schematic\'s ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it whenever you\'d like. You must find another way to get Servo Schematic into the graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "River of Tears produces {B} only after you\'ve played a land, not after you\'ve put a land onto the battlefield (such as with Evolving Wilds)."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The turn you play River of Tears, it will produce {B} when tapped for mana.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the triggered ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves. If the triggered ability asks you to pay a cost (such as that of Frenzied Goblin), you pay that cost for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that triggered ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by the triggered ability and the copy. For example, if Fiend Hunter\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied and two creatures are exiled, they both return when Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the triggered ability divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets (for example, the ability of Bogardan Hellkite), the division and number of targets can\'t be changed. If you choose new targets, you must choose the same number of targets."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability is modal (that is, if it says, "Choose one —" or similar), the mode is copied and can\\\'t be changed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about "the exiled card." When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Elite Arcanist\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Elite Arcanist\\\'s other ability is the sum of the two cards\\\' mana values. As the ability resolves, you create copies of both cards and can cast none, one, or both of the copies in any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Strionic Resonator targets a triggered ability that has triggered and is on the stack and creates another instance of that ability on the stack. It doesn\'t cause any object to gain an ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The source of the copy is the same as the source of the original ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Triggered abilities use the word "when," "whenever," or "at." They\\\'re often written as "[Trigger condition], [effect]."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The controller of each attacking creature still chooses which player or planeswalker that creature attacks.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You may activate Nihil Spellbomb\'s first ability targeting any player, even one whose graveyard has no cards in it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A card, spell, or permanent is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make an object more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—an object either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers “whenever you cast a historic spell” doesn\'t trigger if a historic card is put onto the battlefield without being cast."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Lands are never cast, so abilities that trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell” won\'t trigger if you play a legendary land. They also won\'t trigger if a card on the battlefield transforms into a legendary land, as the Ixalan and Rivals of Ixalan double-faced cards do."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Some abilities trigger “whenever you cast a historic spell.” Such an ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Other than the casting restriction, the legendary supertype on a sorcery carries no additional rules. You may cast any number of legendary sorceries in a turn, and your deck may contain any number of legendary cards (but no more than four of any with the same name).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast a legendary sorcery unless you control a legendary creature or a legendary planeswalker. Once you begin to cast a legendary sorcery, losing control of your legendary creatures and planeswalkers won\'t affect that spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "All creatures your opponents control are affected by Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability, not just those controlled by the player it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Any power- or toughness-modifying effects (those that give +N/+N, for example) and counters will apply to the creature\'s new base power and toughness, even if they started to apply before Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control three artifacts as Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability resolves, it has no effect. If you do, the effect continues to apply even if you lose control of Vedalken Humiliator or your artifacts later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t lose power, toughness, or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Vedalken Humiliator\'s ability overwrites all previous effects that set an affected creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply to a creature after the ability resolves will overwrite this effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "All other tokens you control become a copy of the chosen token, even those that aren\'t of the same type. For example, if you control a Treasure artifact token and choose the Myr token Brudiclad just created, your Treasure will become a copy of the Myr."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Brudiclad copies only the values defined as the original token was created (unless that token is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the chosen token is copying something else (for example, if the chosen token was previously affected by Brudiclad\'s triggered ability), then your tokens become copies of whatever the chosen token copied."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The effect of Brudiclad\'s triggered ability lasts indefinitely. It continues to apply after Brudiclad leaves the game."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The last effect of Brudiclad\'s triggered ability affects all tokens you control other than the chosen token, including the token that was just created if that isn\'t the chosen token."}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'Once a creature token that came under your control this turn has legally attacked, causing it to lose haste by removing Brudiclad from the battlefield won’t cause that token to stop attacking.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Sai\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Addendum abilities of instant spells apply while the spell is resolving, not immediately after casting it. If the spell is countered, you don\'t get the addendum bonus. For example, if you cast Sphinx\'s Insight during your main phase, you gain 2 life during its resolution, after you draw two cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If a spell with an addendum ability is copied, the copy won\'t give you the addendum bonus. This is because the copy wasn\'t cast at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Unbreakable Formation affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain indestructible or vigilance and they won\'t get a +1/+1 counter."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Steel Overseer\'s ability puts a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control, including Steel Overseer."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A spell that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment spell causes Alela\'s last ability to trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Alela\'s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An artifact that becomes a creature due to Workshop Elders can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another effect later causes the artifact to become a creature and sets its power and toughness as it does so, that creature will have that base power and toughness; it won\'t be 0/0. Notably, crewing a Vehicle does not set its power and toughness, so a Vehicle\'s base power and toughness remain 0/0 if you crew it."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The effect of Workshop Elders\'s triggered ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting the target card causes it to leave your graveyard and become a new object. You can\'t cast it again if it returns to your graveyard this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Emry\'s last ability targets an artifact land card, you can\'t play it. Effects that allow you to “cast” a card don\'t allow you to play a land card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much Emry\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in Emry\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Emry). The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the target artifact card. Unless it has flash, you\'ll most likely only be able to cast it during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A spell is historic if it has the legendary supertype, the artifact card type, or the Saga enchantment subtype. Having two of those qualities doesn\'t make a spell more historic than another or provide an additional bonus—a spell either is historic or it isn\'t."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells and/or permanents you control from Geth\'s last ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The target card must have mana value exactly X. You can\'t overpay to have the player mill more cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Master Transmuter can be returned to its owner\'s hand to pay the cost of its activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The artifact card you put onto the battlefield when the ability resolves may be the same card that you returned to your hand when you paid the cost. If so, it returns to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'As long as Master of Etherium is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Master of Etherium may become lethal if other artifacts you control leave the battlefield during that turn, and damage dealt to other artifact creatures you control may become lethal if Master of Etherium leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Master of Etherium\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an artifact creature you control may become lethal if Chief of the Foundry leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to artifact creatures you control may become lethal if Tempered Steel leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Sharuum the Hegemon is put into your graveyard as a state-based action immediately after Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield (most likely due to the “legend rule”) it can be the artifact card targeted by its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have a colon in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Any choices made when the spell or ability resolves won\'t have been made yet when it\'s copied. Any such choices will be made separately when the copy resolves. Most notably, if a triggered ability asks you to pay a cost (such as that of Leyline Tyrant), you pay that cost for the copy if you wish to have it paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If a permanent spell is copied, it\'s put onto the battlefield as a token as the spell resolves rather than putting the copy of the spell onto the battlefield. The rules that apply to a permanent spell becoming a permanent apply to a copy of a spell becoming a token."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If an ability is linked to a second ability, copies of that first ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to “the exiled card,” it refers to all cards exiled by the first ability and the copy. For example, if Fiend Hunter\'s enters-the-battlefield ability is copied and two creatures are exiled, they both return when Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the spell or ability has damage divided as it was put onto the stack, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells and abilities that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the spell or ability that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast or activated, the copy will have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the spell or ability that\'s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can\'t be chosen. This doesn\'t apply to copying a permanent spell with a modal enters-the-battlefield triggered ability, but it does apply to copying that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Lithoform Engine can copy any spell or ability on the stack, not just one with targets. If a permanent spell is copied, new targets can\'t be chosen for it, if it has any (perhaps because it\'s an Aura or a mutating creature spell)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Lithoform Engine\'s first ability targets an activated or triggered ability that is on the stack and creates another instance of that ability on the stack. It doesn\'t cause any object to gain an ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The copy is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast” or “activated.” Creating the copy won\'t cause abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell or activates an ability to trigger. Abilities that say that a triggered ability triggers additional times won\'t apply to copying a triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell or ability it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'The copy will resolve before the original spell or ability does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The source of the copy from Lithoform Engine\'s first ability is the same as the source of the original ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The token that a resolving copy of a spell becomes isn\'t said to have been “created.”"}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They\'re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keywords (such as prowess) are triggered abilities and will use “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy. Most notably, if the original spell was kicked, the copy is kicked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Feed the Swarm tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t lose any life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the permanent\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave your graveyard and become a new object. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the card, it remains in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Silas Renn doesn\'t change when you can cast the target artifact card. For example, if you target an artifact card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may cast that card this turn even if Silas Renn leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the target artifact card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Armix\\\'s ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may discard a card. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick one target to get -X/-X. This is different from abilities that say "If you do . . ." in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after you\\\'ve discarded a card but before the creature gets -X/-X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, that planeswalker\'s controller is the defending player."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the discarded card is an artifact card, it will be counted as you determine the value of X, provided it\'s still in the graveyard or, optimistically, on the battlefield under your control at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined only as Armix\'s ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won\'t change later in the turn, even if the number of artifacts in your graveyard and under your control changes."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving Armix\'s ability, you can\'t discard more than one card to give more than one creature -X/-X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each of the chosen modes happens sequentially. If a permanent has an ability that triggers whenever it or another permanent is destroyed, it will see permanents destroyed at the same time as it or before it, but not permanents destroyed by later modes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a card is exiled "until" another permanent leaves the battlefield, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after that permanent leaves the battlefield during Austere Command\\\'s resolution, and it may be destroyed by a later mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the first and last modes are chosen, an artifact creature with mana value 4 or greater will have to be regenerated twice to survive. This is because the modes happen sequentially, and the regeneration "shield" is used up by the first one. The same is true with any other combination of modes that covers one permanent twice.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'You can discard either one artifact card or two cards which may or may not be artifacts. If you really want to, you can discard two artifact cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Cranial Plating is counted by its own ability, so it gives at least +1/+0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Cranial Plating\'s first activated ability is similar to an equip ability, but it\'s not an equip ability. Most importantly, it can be activated any time you could cast an instant, even during another player\'s turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a ward ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter if the artifact loses ward (most likely because Bronze Guardian leaves the battlefield in response) before the ability resolves. The controller of the spell or ability will still have to pay {2} or the spell or ability will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Bronze Guardian\'s power applies in all zones, not only while it is on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "The token gets created before the artifact spell that triggered its creation resolves. Fortunately, the token counts itself, so it\'s at least 1/1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield. Any "As [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Cursed Mirror copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, power and toughness, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If Cursed Mirror somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as a creature, it can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If something else becomes a copy of Cursed Mirror while Cursed Mirror is a copy of a creature, the duration of the effect is not copied. The new copy will still be a creature (with haste) after Cursed Mirror stops being a copy at the end of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, Cursed Mirror copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Copying a token doesn\'t make Cursed Mirror a token. Similarly, if Cursed Mirror itself is a token, copying a nontoken permanent doesn\'t make it stop being a token."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'While it is copying a creature, Cursed Mirror does not have "{T}: Add {R}" (unless the creature it\\\'s copying also has that ability).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled are always exiled face up unless specified otherwise by the effect that exiled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you choose to play the exiled card this turn, you must still pay all costs and follow all timing restrictions required by that card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have a land play available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card, it remains exiled. It won\'t be available to be played on future turns."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Filigree Attendant\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2022-02-18', 'text': 'Discarding the card is part of the cost to activate a channel ability.'}, {'date': '2022-02-18', 'text': 'If a channel ability requires a target, you may not activate it without a target just to discard the card.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Although all the cards in The Brothers’ War that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn’t part of the token’s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won’t enter the battlefield tapped.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Powerstone tokens are a kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype “Powerstone” and the ability “{T}: Add {C}. This mana can’t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell.”'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn’t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Vodalian Mindsinger, ignore phased-out objects. Any such effects will expire if their conditions are no longer met after ignoring the phased-out objects.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any one-shot effects that are waiting “until [this] leaves the battlefield,” such as that of Banisher Priest, won’t happen when a permanent phases out.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Each Aura and Equipment attached to a permanent that’s phasing out also phases out. They will phase in with that permanent and still be attached to it. Similarly, permanents that phase out with counters phase in with those counters.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Disciple of Caelus Nin itself phases out, other phased out permanents can phase back in normally while it is phased out. During its controller’s untap step, Caelus Nin and all other phased out permanents that player controls phase in at the same time.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If an effect causes a permanent to phase out “until” some event occurs, and that event occurs while Disciple of Caelus Nin is still on the battlefield, the phased out permanent stays phased out forever.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Phasing out doesn’t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won’t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The last ability means that no permanents phase in under any player’s control as long as Disciple of Caelus Nin is on the battlefield. This includes permanents that phase out in ways other than the first ability, and even permanents that are phased out already when it enters the battlefield. Once it leaves the battlefield, each phased out permanent will phase in normally during its controller’s untap step, with one exception (see below).'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'While a permanent is phased out, it’s treated as though it doesn’t exist. It can’t be the target of spells or abilities, its static abilities have no effect on the game, its triggered abilities can’t trigger, it can’t attack or block, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Casting a spell with overload doesn’t change that spell’s mana cost. You just pay the overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Each token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below. It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less for a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its overload cost, too.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the chosen artifact creature is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the chosen artifact creature is itself a token, the token March of Progress creates copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copied artifact creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to pay its overload cost instead.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Overload doesn’t change when you can cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Machine God’s Effigy enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work. Note that some of these effects may function correctly only if it is a creature, and will not do anything productive since the copy is an artifact, not a creature.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Except for its types and non-artifact subtypes, Machine God’s Effigy copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below), and it will have “{T}:Add {U}.” It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Machine God’s Effigy copies a Saga that has become a creature due to an effect, it will have that Saga’s chapter abilities, but it won’t get a lore counter every turn because it isn’t itself a Saga since its only card type is artifact. Unless it has the read ahead ability found on some Saga cards in the Dominaria United set, it also won’t enter the battlefield with any counters. If you do find a way to put lore counters on it, the appropriate ability or abilities will trigger. It will not be sacrificed after it has lore counters equal to its final chapter number.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Machine God’s Effigy copies a land with a basic land type that has become a creature due to an effect, it will not have any mana abilities that land had due to its land types (it will have the one it gives itself, though). For example, if a basic Forest became a creature due to some effect, and Machine God’s Effigy entered the battlefield as a copy of it, it would be a basic artifact named Forest and have “{T}: Add {U},” but not the intrinsic ability “{T}: Add {G}.”'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Machine God’s Effigy copies a planeswalker that became a creature due to an effect, Machine God’s Effigy will have that planeswalker’s loyalty abilities but its only card type is artifact (it will still be legendary in most cases). Because it isn’t a planeswalker itself, it won’t enter the battlefield with any loyalty counters, but it also won’t die because due to not having any. Similarly, it can’t be attacked and damage can’t be dealt to it. You may activate only one loyalty ability of that permanent per turn. If it later becomes a creature and damage is dealt to it, that damage won’t remove any loyalty counters.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Machine God’s Effigy somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Machine God’s Effigy copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token, plus the listed exceptions. Machine God’s Effigy is not a token, even when copying one.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else, then Machine God’s Effigy enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature is copying (with the listed exceptions).'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Machine God’s Effigy will not copy any types (such as creature or enchantment) or non-artifact subtypes (such as Phyrexian or Elf) that creature had, but it will copy any supertypes, such as legendary, and artifact subtypes (such as Treasure or Vehicle). It also has the same name, so if you copy a legendary creature you control, you will need to choose one of them to put in your graveyard due to the legend rule.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The ability of Machine God’s Effigy doesn’t target the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the target permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Except for name, power, toughness, and types, the token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or it is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, and so on.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is a token, the new token that’s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token (with the listed exceptions).'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is copying something else, then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied (with the listed exceptions).'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the token you create will trigger when it enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied token or card will also work.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'For both abilities, if a token is created copying a token or card with {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the original token is copying something else, the token you create will use the copiable values of the original token. In most cases, it will be a copy of whatever the original token is copying.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The token you create with the first ability copies the original characteristics of the token it’s copying as stated by the effect that created that token. The newly created token doesn’t copy whether the original token is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it, whether it has any Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Attacking with a goaded creature doesn’t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Being goaded isn’t an ability the creature has. Once it’s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn’t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the creature doesn’t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can’t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or the player that goaded it.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that’s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack that player.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The token’s name is Scrap, and it has no abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Being basic doesn’t grant any abilities to a land that it didn’t already have, and doesn’t remove any card types, subtypes, or supertypes. For example, a land card that is legendary will be both basic and legendary while on the battlefield or in your library.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Lands that become basic are no longer nonbasic lands. This may change what effects can apply to them. For example, if an opponent controls Blood Moon, an enchantment which says “Nonbasic lands are Mountains,” and you play Rootpath Purifier, Blood Moon can no longer apply to the lands you control because they are all basic.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Notably, becoming basic also doesn’t grant any of the basic land types. If an effect instructs you to search your library for a basic land while you control Rootpath Purifier, you may search for any land card in your library. However, if an effect instructs you to search your library for a card with a basic land type, you must search for a land that is a Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, or Forest, regardless of whether or not the land is basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Blast-Furnace Hellkite’s last ability applies to any creature that is attacking one of your opponents, even if another opponent controls that creature.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'When you cast a spell with offering by sacrificing a permanent, generic mana in the sacrificed permanent’s mana cost reduces only generic mana in the spell’s total cost. Colored and colorless mana in the sacrificed permanent’s mana cost reduces mana of the same type in spell’s total cost, and any excess reduces the spell’s total cost by that much generic mana. The total cost of the spell can’t be reduced to less than {0}.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Each token must attack the appropriate player if able.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Exiling the card with encore is a cost to activate the ability. Once you announce that you’re activating it, no player may take actions until you’ve finished. They can’t try to remove the card from your graveyard to stop you from paying the cost.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If an effect stops a token from attacking a specific player, that token can attack any player or planeswalker, or not attack at all. If the effect stops the token from attacking a specific player unless a cost is paid, you don’t have to pay that cost unless you want to attack that player.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If one of the tokens can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If one of the tokens somehow is under another player’s control as the delayed triggered ability resolves, you can’t sacrifice that token. It remains on the battlefield indefinitely, even if you regain control of it later.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Opponents who have left the game aren’t counted when determining how many tokens to create.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The tokens copy only what’s on the original card. Effects that modified that creature when it was previously on the battlefield won’t be copied.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If Sanwell, Avenger Ace is somehow an artifact creature, its first ability will see itself while it is attacking.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast a spell this way, it goes to the bottom of the library with the other exiled cards. You can’t wait and cast it later.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You must pay all costs for a spell cast using Sanwell’s last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If an artifact on the battlefield has an {X} in its mana cost, that X is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If an artifact revealed this way has an {X} is its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If the copy has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'If you don’t cast the copy (perhaps because there are no legal targets available or you don’t want to), the copy will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The card remains exiled no matter what happens to the copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'No other player may look at the face-down cards you own exiled with Kayla’s Music Box, even if another player takes control of it.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Since The Archimandrite’s activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven’t been under your control since your most recent turn began (including The Archimandrite itself) to pay the cost.'}, {'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You can’t gain negative amounts of life. If you have fewer than four cards in hand as the first ability resolves, you won’t gain any life, but you won’t lose any life either.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'The ability of that Construct token does count the Construct itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'Titania, Nature’s Force doesn’t change the times when you can play those Forests. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': 'You may choose to put the card into your hand rather than onto the battlefield even if an opponent controls more lands than you.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-10-14', 'text': '“Sacrificed to activate it” means that a permanent was sacrificed to pay the ability’s costs. Sacrificing an artifact, such as a Treasure token, to create mana that you used to pay an activation cost doesn’t count.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abbild des Maschinengottes\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Abbild des Maschinengottes als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass es ein Artefakt ist und „{T}: Erzeuge {U}" hat. (Es ist keine Kreatur.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Gix sorgte dafür, das seine treuesten Anhänger als Erste in den Genuss phyrexianischer Perfektion kamen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd32de7d-c30e-46cd-86eb-52fcc4356317\', \'multiverseId\': 588427}, \'multiverseid\': 588427}, {\'name\': \'Efigie del dios de las máquinas\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que la Efigie del dios de las máquinas entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que es un artefacto y tiene "{T}: Agrega {U}". (No es una criatura.)\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Gix se aseguró de que sus seguidores más acérrimos fueran los primeros en experimentar la perfección pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1203b0c8-2069-441a-aa73-396ae36bd6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 588443}, \'multiverseid\': 588443}, {\'name\': \'Effigie du Dieu-machine\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Effigie du Dieu-machine arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est un artefact et qu\'elle a « {T} : Ajoutez {U}. » (Ce n\'est pas une créature.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Gix veilla à ce que ses plus fidèles disciples soient les premiers à goûter à la perfection phyrexiane.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0dadb4-47b2-4dfa-b9d3-b8ac6b514ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 588459}, \'multiverseid\': 588459}, {\'name\': \'Effige del Dio Macchina\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare l\\\'Effige del Dio Macchina nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che è un artefatto e ha "{T}: Aggiungi {U}". (Non è una creatura.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Gix si assicurò che i suoi più leali seguaci fossero i primi ad assaggiare la perfezione Phyrexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd5b737-7b3c-454d-bddf-4f280699ab94\', \'multiverseId\': 588475}, \'multiverseid\': 588475}, {\'name\': \'機械神の肖像\', \'text\': \'あなたは機械神の肖像を、これがアーティファクトであり「{T}：{U}を加える。」を持つことを除き、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。（これはクリーチャーではない。）\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギックスは最も忠実なる信奉者に対し、ファイレクシアの完全化を真っ先に味わわせることを約束した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b729c694-3380-4533-9707-d125276344bc\', \'multiverseId\': 588491}, \'multiverseid\': 588491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abbild des Maschinengottes\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Abbild des Maschinengottes als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass es ein Artefakt ist und „{T}: Erzeuge {U}" hat. (Es ist keine Kreatur.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec81c94-bc01-4499-bbea-13f0bfab7128\', \'multiverseId\': 588578}, \'multiverseid\': 588578}, {\'name\': \'Effigie du Dieu-machine\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Effigie du Dieu-machine arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est un artefact et qu\'elle a « {T} : Ajoutez {U}. » (Ce n\'est pas une créature.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0e9de7-e175-408f-9f42-56b0eea850e5\', \'multiverseId\': 588594}, \'multiverseid\': 588594}, {\'name\': \'機械神の肖像\', \'text\': \'あなたは機械神の肖像を、これがアーティファクトであり「{T}：{U}を加える。」を持つことを除き、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。（これはクリーチャーではない。）\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f3fcc0-ce0e-463d-9aad-9495f4824191\', \'multiverseId\': 588610}, \'multiverseid\': 588610}, {\'name\': \'机械神肖像\', \'text\': \'你可以使机械神肖像当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它是神器，且具有「{T}：加{U}。」（它不是生物。）\\n{T}：加{U}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e785554e-2619-4e20-81bc-a2adca916d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 588626}, \'multiverseid\': 588626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16221a56-4bf3-40cd-8c73-3334a551c778\', \'multiverseId\': 588899}, \'multiverseid\': 588899}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo del olvido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si creaste una ficha este turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo del olvido: Crea una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Álzate, ser inmenso, y libra al mundo de nuestros enemigos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9298acb7-50d3-412d-86f0-4548c0b0a913\', \'multiverseId\': 589043}, \'multiverseid\': 589043}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3c3298-b4a9-4d3a-b73b-b0b40f9d25f5\', \'multiverseId\': 589187}, \'multiverseid\': 589187}, {\'name\': "Idolo dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "{T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se hai creato una pedina in questo turno.\\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Idolo dell\'Oblio: Crea una pedina creatura Eldrazi 10/10 incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Risvegliati, essere supremo, e purifica il mondo dai nostri nemici!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ba834d-fc91-4527-af0c-8d9147c645e6\', \'multiverseId\': 589331}, \'multiverseid\': 589331}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8},{T},忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82b4dfca-7e31-4707-ba91-615104512a85\', \'multiverseId\': 589475}, \'multiverseid\': 589475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alela, listige Provokateurin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAndere fliegende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\\nImmer wenn du einen Artefakt- oder Verzauberungszauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Feenwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Feenwesen, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ad06bc-ac10-41a1-8224-b7308f42fbc8\', \'multiverseId\': 588874}, \'multiverseid\': 588874}, {\'name\': \'Alila, incitadora taimada\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas con la habilidad de volar obtienen +1/+0.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto o de encantamiento, crea una ficha de criatura Hada azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85673261-87b2-4b50-bd96-b12bda3d6a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 589018}, \'multiverseid\': 589018}, {\'name\': \'Alela, provocatrice ingénieuse\', \'text\': "Vol, contact mortel, lien de vie\\nLes autres créatures avec le vol que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact ou d\'enchantement, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Peuple fée avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : peuple fée et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1033870-b09f-4461-a15e-7a129342cc92\', \'multiverseId\': 589162}, \'multiverseid\': 589162}, {\'name\': \'Alela, Abile Provocatrice\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale, legame vitale\\nLe altre creature con volare che controlli prendono +1/+0.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto o incantesimo, crea una pedina creatura Spiritello 1/1 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a58eebaf-29f9-4a89-8888-a432f979bc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 589306}, \'multiverseid\': 589306}, {\'name\': \'巧妙な工作員、アリーラ\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしていて飛行を持ちこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがアーティファクトやエンチャントである呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の１/１のフェアリー・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェアリー・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418c465e-fcac-4c80-b9e3-ea58977a6db8\', \'multiverseId\': 589450}, \'multiverseid\': 589450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd35ebe-55d9-4198-a95a-6ab5e9af597c\', \'multiverseId\': 588887}, \'multiverseid\': 588887}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315032ba-8d8e-452b-8d90-59507f06b954\', \'multiverseId\': 589031}, \'multiverseid\': 589031}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ac53a3-26dd-4379-bbe9-b7a66cae7080\', \'multiverseId\': 589175}, \'multiverseid\': 589175}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762a71e7-7b05-476f-ad70-295fb53d3f0a\', \'multiverseId\': 589319}, \'multiverseid\': 589319}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b2dc36-c957-4a90-83c0-4d0e706c3ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 589463}, \'multiverseid\': 589463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armix, Filigranschmetterer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Armix, Filigranschmetterer, angreift, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Wenn du dies tust, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst, plus der Anzahl an Artefaktkarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588858&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a559a9bf-67ae-4ae0-8efd-37375a284e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 588858}, \'multiverseid\': 588858}, {\'name\': \'Ármix, trilladora de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Ármix, trilladora de filigrana ataque, puedes descartar una carta. Cuando lo hagas, la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas más la cantidad de cartas de artefacto en tu cementerio.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b844dd3-6c6a-4ae8-a7fc-bb68abd1517c\', \'multiverseId\': 589002}, \'multiverseid\': 589002}, {\'name\': \'Armix, rudoyeur de filigrane\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Armix, rudoyeur de filigrane attaque, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Quand vous faites ainsi, une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez plus le nombre de cartes d\'artefact dans votre cimetière.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6a784c-07d1-4ce4-b181-04f5fb44dfd2\', \'multiverseId\': 589146}, \'multiverseid\': 589146}, {\'name\': \'Armix, Devastatore di Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Armix, Devastatore di Filigrana attacca, puoi scartare una carta. Quando lo fai, una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli più il numero di carte artefatto nel tuo cimitero.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5873c05c-ec78-4f4a-ad54-30803a7dee76\', \'multiverseId\': 589290}, \'multiverseid\': 589290}, {\'name\': \'金線の打破者、アーミクス\', \'text\': \'金線の打破者、アーミクスが攻撃するたび、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたとき、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カードの枚数を足した値に等しい。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf65f8e-3033-4584-b6ba-6f4cfbf1f875\', \'multiverseId\': 589434}, \'multiverseid\': 589434}]', "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588929&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '452aa9eb-a7d1-4759-83cd-186f32f62783', 'multiverseId': 588929}, 'multiverseid': 588929}, {'name': 'Yermos humeantes', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589073&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f112f542-d0f1-448e-956c-5e14669914bc', 'multiverseId': 589073}, 'multiverseid': 589073}, {'name': 'Landes cendreuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589217&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d7a8877-5883-46f7-8c58-73f0f0834645', 'multiverseId': 589217}, 'multiverseid': 589217}, {'name': 'Distese di Polvere', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589361&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09dfcd05-8da7-4173-a144-478cf664878a', 'multiverseId': 589361}, 'multiverseid': 589361}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1},このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589505&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab02ef35-0194-48e9-878d-97db70d0c823', 'multiverseId': 589505}, 'multiverseid': 589505}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ashnod die Herzlose\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn du eine Fähigkeit eines Artefakts oder einer Kreatur aktivierst, die keine Manafähigkeit ist, und falls eine oder mehrere bleibende Karten geopfert wurden, um sie zu aktivieren, kannst du die Fähigkeit kopieren. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. (Das Opfern eines Artefakts, um Mana zu erzeugen, das zum Aktivieren einer Fähigkeit ausgegeben wird, zählt nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ee08bf-0c80-487d-b065-6a4c70c00cf9\', \'multiverseId\': 588381}, \'multiverseid\': 588381}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, la Impasible\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad de un artefacto o criatura que no sea una habilidad de maná, si se sacrificaron uno o más permanentes para activarla, puedes copiar esa habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia. (Sacrificar un artefacto para obtener maná para activar una habilidad no cuenta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea1055e-32b6-4f2e-889d-55411ee8369c\', \'multiverseId\': 588383}, \'multiverseid\': 588383}, {\'name\': "Ashnod l\'Indifférente", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un artefact ou d\'une créature qui n\'est pas une capacité de mana, si au moins un permanent a été sacrifié pour l\'activer, vous pouvez copier cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. (Sacrifier un artefact pour du mana pour activer une capacité ne compte pas.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1870fb-36e5-484c-aa32-b843fd953ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 588385}, \'multiverseid\': 588385}, {\'name\': "Ashnod l\'Indifferente", \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta attivi un\'abilità di un artefatto o di una creatura che non è un\'abilità di mana, se uno o più permanenti sono stati sacrificati per attivarla, puoi copiare quella abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia. (Sacrificare un artefatto per attingere mana per attivare un\'abilità non conta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd1eb58-67ff-42e8-b7fe-c5f2ed36fd45\', \'multiverseId\': 588387}, \'multiverseid\': 588387}, {\'name\': \'冷酷な者、アシュノッド\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたがアーティファクトやクリーチャーが持ちマナ能力でない能力を起動するたび、それを起動するために１つ以上のパーマネントが生け贄に捧げられていた場合、あなたはその能力をコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。（能力を起動するためのマナ能力でアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げることは含めない。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5811b0cd-6e7b-4a80-ae69-81c97185589d\', \'multiverseId\': 588389}, \'multiverseid\': 588389}, {\'name\': \'Ashnod, a Indiferente\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nToda vez que você ativa uma habilidade de um artefato ou de uma criatura que não seja uma habilidade de mana, se uma ou mais permanentes tiverem sido sacrificadas para ativá-la, você pode copiar aquela habilidade. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia. (Sacrificar um artefato para gerar mana para ativar uma habilidade não conta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25475fb-795c-4ba2-be9d-2f898b4cf433\', \'multiverseId\': 588393}, \'multiverseid\': 588393}, {\'name\': \'冷漠的阿士诺\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当你起动神器或生物的异能，且其不为法术力异能时，若牺牲了一个或数个永久物来起动，则你可以复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。（因产生起动异能所需之法术力而牺牲的神器不属此类。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ee7785-bf54-4247-a389-926d66166be3\', \'multiverseId\': 588397}, \'multiverseid\': 588397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnod die Herzlose\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn du eine Fähigkeit eines Artefakts oder einer Kreatur aktivierst, die keine Manafähigkeit ist, und falls eine oder mehrere bleibende Karten geopfert wurden, um sie zu aktivieren, kannst du die Fähigkeit kopieren. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. (Das Opfern eines Artefakts, um Mana zu erzeugen, das zum Aktivieren einer Fähigkeit ausgegeben wird, zählt nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0790ed11-d46b-4819-9b74-f464dd3d20a0\', \'multiverseId\': 588513}, \'multiverseid\': 588513}, {\'name\': "Ashnod l\'Indifférente", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un artefact ou d\'une créature qui n\'est pas une capacité de mana, si au moins un permanent a été sacrifié pour l\'activer, vous pouvez copier cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. (Sacrifier un artefact pour du mana pour activer une capacité ne compte pas.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa9c2b0-fb2e-4df7-a5e8-17e0d735beef\', \'multiverseId\': 588524}, \'multiverseid\': 588524}, {\'name\': \'冷酷な者、アシュノッド\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたがアーティファクトやクリーチャーが持ちマナ能力でない能力を起動するたび、それを起動するために１つ以上のパーマネントが生け贄に捧げられていた場合、あなたはその能力をコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。（能力を起動するためのマナ能力でアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げることは含めない。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'633b87f6-7a25-47aa-924a-8346d74c4723\', \'multiverseId\': 588535}, \'multiverseid\': 588535}, {\'name\': \'冷漠的阿士诺\', \'text\': \'死触\\n每当你起动神器或生物的异能，且其不为法术力异能时，若牺牲了一个或数个永久物来起动，则你可以复制该异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。（因产生起动异能所需之法术力而牺牲的神器不属此类。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73cbe833-72e3-4207-b165-bef396ba91b9\', \'multiverseId\': 588546}, \'multiverseid\': 588546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufscheuern\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Aufscheuern fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wüste ist eine hungrige Bestie, die sowohl Fleisch als auch Knochen verschlingt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7797b862-4f19-4332-95d6-e74b7307ba5e\', \'multiverseId\': 588866}, \'multiverseid\': 588866}, {\'name\': \'Erosionar\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Erosionar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El desierto es una bestia voraz que devora tanto carne como roca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0dab75-d3c1-457c-bf6c-df342a67957f\', \'multiverseId\': 589010}, \'multiverseid\': 589010}, {\'name\': \'Fissuration\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• La Fissuration inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Le désert est une bête vorace, tout autant avide de chair que de pierre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aebebc4a-5f5c-4ac4-8019-216e011ebd14\', \'multiverseId\': 589154}, \'multiverseid\': 589154}, {\'name\': \'Abrasione\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• L\'Abrasione infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il deserto è una belva famelica che divora carne e pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777961ef-fd01-401d-b84a-dcbc90651a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 589298}, \'multiverseid\': 589298}, {\'name\': \'削剥\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。削剥はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'砂漠の食欲は底無しで、肉も石も貪り尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1f850f-fda7-409f-a8fc-e7fb37c7345c\', \'multiverseId\': 589442}, \'multiverseid\': 589442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseher aus Stahl\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege auf jede Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt wird jetzt schon von unterschiedlichsten Maschinen regiert. Eines Tages werden sie es uns spüren lassen."\\n—Sargis Haz, Tüftler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17eecdc9-d04c-4035-8b4d-040ab9e1fc8d\', \'multiverseId\': 588919}, \'multiverseid\': 588919}, {\'name\': \'Capataz de acero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura artefacto que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"El mundo ya está dirigido por todo tipo de máquinas. Un día, nos recordarán ese hecho".\\n—Sargis Haz, artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55152f49-aad2-49d1-9133-54d72e255da5\', \'multiverseId\': 589063}, \'multiverseid\': 589063}, {\'name\': "Brigadier d\'acier", \'text\': \'{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Le monde est déjà dirigé par toutes sortes de machines. Un jour, elles nous le rappelleront. »\\n—Sargis Haz, artificier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d28f22eb-59ed-4d7e-a364-1225ec6f1c62\', \'multiverseId\': 589207}, \'multiverseid\': 589207}, {\'name\': "Sorvegliante d\'Acciaio", \'text\': \'{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura artefatto che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo ormai è gestito da macchine di ogni genere. Un giorno, ci ricorderanno questo fatto."\\n—Sargis Haz, artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d8b1144-9da6-4fda-bdc5-5e8487709e97\', \'multiverseId\': 589351}, \'multiverseid\': 589351}, {\'name\': \'鋼の監視者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている各アーティファクト・クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「世界は既に機械の方式で動いているのよ。いつか、その事実を向こうに思い知らされるんでしょうね。」\\n――工匠、サルギス・ハズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5559749-eccb-47b8-8114-6e2d658adbb8\', \'multiverseId\': 589495}, \'multiverseid\': 589495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdrucksvolle Iteration\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand, lege eine davon unter deine Bibliothek und schicke eine davon ins Exil. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Prismari-Studenten tanzen im Spannungsfeld zwischen Leidenschaft und Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acea0e5c-3c6f-4c0a-80a1-1f82a3c6d5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 588880}, \'multiverseid\': 588880}, {\'name\': \'Iteración expresiva\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano, una de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y exilia una de ellas. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de Prismari bailan con la tensión entre la pasión y la perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b43decf-1939-430d-adcd-a20bab45bc82\', \'multiverseId\': 589024}, \'multiverseid\': 589024}, {\'name\': \'Itération expressive\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main, mettez l\'une d\'elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, et exilez l\'une d\'elles. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants de Prismari dansent entre passion et perfection.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd7ca96-a0fa-4146-b7be-2cd1616b49e8\', \'multiverseId\': 589168}, \'multiverseid\': 589168}, {\'name\': \'Iterazione Espressiva\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano, mettine una in fondo al tuo grimorio ed esiliane una. Puoi giocare la carta esiliata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studenti di Prismari danzano sul confine tra passione e perfezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e7f816-7baa-4a68-a880-554a61df4404\', \'multiverseId\': 589312}, \'multiverseid\': 589312}, {\'name\': \'表現の反復\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。それらのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、それらのうち１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはその追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'プリズマリの学生たちは情熱と完璧の葛藤の中で踊る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b059b415-e00b-42de-a9ac-1e54c39426a4\', \'multiverseId\': 589456}, \'multiverseid\': 589456}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungsingenieurin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Grab da drüben, du Bolzenkopf!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e7025a-75ce-467c-b7e1-c032ca1aee22\', \'multiverseId\': 588826}, \'multiverseid\': 588826}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniera de la excavación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 0/0 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice enano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Que caves por allí, trozo de chatarra!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9037bf-8f98-4a80-a1a2-93f298d8b7e7\', \'multiverseId\': 588970}, \'multiverseid\': 588970}, {\'name\': "Ingénieure d\'excavation", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Creuse par-là, tête de pioche ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589114&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636ab8bd-2596-4066-92e9-ab285139cfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 589114}, \'multiverseid\': 589114}, {\'name\': \'Ingegnera dello Scavo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0 incolore con "Questa creatura prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Scava laggiù, testa di bullone!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e2232db-d6b5-4290-a250-2ce668cb3263\', \'multiverseId\': 589258}, \'multiverseid\': 589258}, {\'name\': \'発掘現場の技師\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、「このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。」を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「あそこを掘るのよ、ボルト頭！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3583c344-b3c8-4d18-95c8-f854352b8df5\', \'multiverseId\': 589402}, \'multiverseid\': 589402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b67e57-e310-48a3-9060-fbb813ff0542\', \'multiverseId\': 588930}, \'multiverseid\': 588930}, {\'name\': \'Tribunal azorio\', \'text\': \'El Tribunal azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Tribunal azorio entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bc2bf1-01ce-4124-b85b-89c80e6d474f\', \'multiverseId\': 589074}, \'multiverseid\': 589074}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589218&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90b4034-d62c-4eeb-bb7d-930d18fd4c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 589218}, \'multiverseid\': 589218}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d941432b-0307-4651-b7fb-349f62c58d53\', \'multiverseId\': 589362}, \'multiverseid\': 589362}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffe3996-f5e4-4b5d-bbca-0ab4463313fd\', \'multiverseId\': 589506}, \'multiverseid\': 589506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a82736a-ca25-47e1-8ce3-e60693dba07a\', \'multiverseId\': 588888}, \'multiverseid\': 588888}, {\'name\': \'Sello azorio\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El diseño, similar a un laberinto, representa el corazón de la ley azoria; una estructura rígida diseñada para desafiar voluntades y retrasar el cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec49e16-6d45-411a-9f2d-780f6ef90775\', \'multiverseId\': 589032}, \'multiverseid\': 589032}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e975dab-a45c-4d8c-99e5-9b2be9bcea05\', \'multiverseId\': 589176}, \'multiverseid\': 589176}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lo stile labirintico rappresenta l\'essenza della legge Azorius: una rigida struttura progettata per mettere alla prova la determinazione e per impedire i cambiamenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99998de8-370f-4558-9d6c-3d913e43e837\', \'multiverseId\': 589320}, \'multiverseid\': 589320}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed7b4e92-10db-46dd-92d6-94e38f8a342d\', \'multiverseId\': 589464}, \'multiverseid\': 589464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a61e50-367d-4f97-9e67-1f1524520577\', \'multiverseId\': 588933}, \'multiverseid\': 588933}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b35f5bab-37a3-4e9a-8e07-d67d3dd3175c\', \'multiverseId\': 589077}, \'multiverseid\': 589077}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d793137-b77e-41e9-bd93-4d6c0676f5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 589221}, \'multiverseid\': 589221}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e5b540-f640-40d5-a301-873e6f88aa5d\', \'multiverseId\': 589365}, \'multiverseid\': 589365}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a3b33a-d06e-47cf-a8a4-131b7535fb2a\', \'multiverseId\': 589509}, \'multiverseid\': 589509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem."\\n—Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09442ec4-8a94-4055-96c5-214eed2d480a\', \'multiverseId\': 588868}, \'multiverseid\': 588868}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada".\\n—Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597896c4-9118-480f-ac48-d8048d43beeb\', \'multiverseId\': 589012}, \'multiverseid\': 589012}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. »\\n—Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d740e145-8e40-4d9a-a1f1-3de1c083cec6\', \'multiverseId\': 589156}, \'multiverseid\': 589156}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla."\\n—Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'353ed8dd-4128-45f2-9011-39fd45a688bb\', \'multiverseId\': 589300}, \'multiverseid\': 589300}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでに安住の地ではありません。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212a0f7d-1146-41e8-9580-f1dcba14486c\', \'multiverseId\': 589444}, \'multiverseid\': 589444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5050b03b-e203-443a-9acb-c07a65733d45\', \'multiverseId\': 588931}, \'multiverseid\': 588931}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cca3afb-34b5-48a1-95fb-b8932136aef4\', \'multiverseId\': 589075}, \'multiverseid\': 589075}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589219&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2992dda6-8552-404e-a761-731cda12293c\', \'multiverseId\': 589219}, \'multiverseid\': 589219}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345da1ee-eac0-4736-8b27-4bb329f6ae8e\', \'multiverseId\': 589363}, \'multiverseid\': 589363}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97180bf1-dc26-4a7e-a703-fb7bdb54f13d\', \'multiverseId\': 589507}, \'multiverseid\': 589507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzener Wächter\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag, Abwehr {2}\\nAndere Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\\nDie Stärke des Bronzenen Wächters ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5eebe86-eac5-48b9-b327-fcac768910a1\', \'multiverseId\': 588825}, \'multiverseid\': 588825}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de bronce\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces, rebatir {2}.\\nLos otros artefactos que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {2}.\\nLa fuerza del Guardián de bronce es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c54073e-ef51-4f0c-8c91-8411cceefa3a\', \'multiverseId\': 588969}, \'multiverseid\': 588969}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de bronze\', \'text\': "Double initiative, parade {2}\\nLes autres artefacts que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\\nLa force du Gardien de bronze est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf003d8-6887-4dec-8226-76a755abec17\', \'multiverseId\': 589113}, \'multiverseid\': 589113}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano di Bronzo\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco, egida {2}\\nGli altri artefatti che controlli hanno egida {2}.\\nLa forza del Guardiano di Bronzo è pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3887a31-24ac-4a56-8794-ef7bfe3d8832\', \'multiverseId\': 589257}, \'multiverseid\': 589257}, {\'name\': \'青銅の守護者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃、護法{2}\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクトは護法{2}を持つ。\\n青銅の守護者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232bd0ed-03b4-485a-89d6-c9632b255369\', \'multiverseId\': 589401}, \'multiverseid\': 589401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Wandersmanns\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist wie der Wald hinterm Horizont, wie der Berg, der noch bezwungen werden will, wie das neue Land hinter dem endlosen Meer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ff524f-fbc6-4b1a-9b10-5645fd1c7ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 588926}, \'multiverseid\': 588926}, {\'name\': \'Baratija del caminante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Baratija del caminante: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Es el bosque más allá del horizonte, la montaña que espera ser escalada, la nueva tierra detrás del mar interminable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0cde75-5187-4936-a16d-1887025758fc\', \'multiverseId\': 589070}, \'multiverseid\': 589070}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du voyageur\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la forêt au-delà de l\'horizon, la montagne encore vierge, la nouvelle terre au-delà de la mer éternelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d52d49e-1b5d-4586-bb9d-46c032665522\', \'multiverseId\': 589214}, \'multiverseid\': 589214}, {\'name\': \'Ninnolo del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "È la foresta oltre l\'orizzonte, la montagna che attende di essere scalata, la nuova terra dall\'altra parte del mare infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdf318d-618d-407b-9c05-b1b6547b98e6\', \'multiverseId\': 589358}, \'multiverseid\': 589358}, {\'name\': \'旅人のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{2},{T},旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それは地平線の彼方の森であり、登るものを待つ山であり、終わりなき海の向こうの見果てぬ地である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'731ba909-5d2f-4ced-aea3-5a64748a0236\', \'multiverseId\': 589502}, \'multiverseid\': 589502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brudiclad, Telchor-Ingenieur\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 2/1 blauen Phyrexianer-Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. Dann kannst du einen Spielstein bestimmen, den du kontrollierst. Falls du dies tust, wird jeder andere Spielstein, den du kontrollierst, zu einer Kopie des bestimmten Spielsteins.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf726f20-d986-48e7-9641-7e5d26997008\', \'multiverseId\': 588877}, \'multiverseid\': 588877}, {\'name\': \'Brúdiclad, ingeniero telchor\', \'text\': \'Las fichas de criatura que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Myr Pirexiano azul 2/1. Luego puedes elegir una ficha que controlas. Si lo haces, cada otra ficha que controlas se convierte en una copia de esa ficha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Artífice pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ae71d4-1148-4827-b38b-c238b8cc9d63\', \'multiverseId\': 589021}, \'multiverseid\': 589021}, {\'name\': \'Brudiclad, ingénieur telchor\', \'text\': \'Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/1 bleue Phyrexian et Myr. Vous pouvez ensuite choisir un jeton que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque autre jeton que vous contrôlez devient une copie de ce jeton.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : phyrexian et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70286ca9-3149-4f40-b467-ecf5cccba84f\', \'multiverseId\': 589165}, \'multiverseid\': 589165}, {\'name\': \'Brudiclad, Ingegnere Telchor\', \'text\': "Le pedine creatura che controlli hanno rapidità.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Myr Phyrexiano 2/1 blu. Poi puoi scegliere una pedina che controlli. Se lo fai, ogni altra pedina che controlli diventa una copia di quella pedina.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Artefice Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dfc771a-3f8b-4b0f-8383-be54c67aaebd\', \'multiverseId\': 589309}, \'multiverseid\': 589309}, {\'name\': \'テルカーの技師、ブルーディクラッド\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・トークンは速攻を持つ。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、青の２/１のファイレクシアン・マイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。その後、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているトークン１つを選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたがコントロールしていてそれでない各トークンはそれぞれ、その選ばれたトークンのコピーになる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda6f8b0-9bee-4b1b-a559-2263f3cfba85\', \'multiverseId\': 589453}, \'multiverseid\': 589453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt sie in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d510856-8283-4dc6-91ef-e919f975b413\', \'multiverseId\': 588869}, \'multiverseid\': 588869}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d8e2028-40e2-42f8-ac6b-d0531fec4746\', \'multiverseId\': 589013}, \'multiverseid\': 589013}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f16541b2-70be-4cd7-87fe-a498c71f351e\', \'multiverseId\': 589157}, \'multiverseid\': 589157}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9191eb2d-0246-440a-a546-c3d6eb9a43f1\', \'multiverseId\': 589301}, \'multiverseid\': 589301}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135fffdc-5e9f-48a0-9afe-81b8378a4398\', \'multiverseId\': 589445}, \'multiverseid\': 589445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromkurier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Chromkurier ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof. Falls du auf diese Weise eine Artefaktkarte auf deine Hand nimmst, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c44c14-3b62-4937-9e06-12793cfa5e86\', \'multiverseId\': 588878}, \'multiverseid\': 588878}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero de cromo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Mensajero de cromo entre al campo de batalla, muestra las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio. Si pusiste una carta de artefacto en tu mano de esta manera, ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d0b0f0-e5ce-4377-9735-c080595944ab\', \'multiverseId\': 589022}, \'multiverseid\': 589022}, {\'name\': \'Messager de chrome\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Messager de chrome arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'entre elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. Si vous mettez une carte d\'artefact dans votre main de cette manière, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1ee303-981d-4a11-8dff-e0e7954809e7\', \'multiverseId\': 589166}, \'multiverseid\': 589166}, {\'name\': \'Corriere Cromato\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Corriere Cromato entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero. Se aggiungi una carta artefatto alla tua mano in questo modo, guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6754e117-9344-4344-ae53-1d122991eca4\', \'multiverseId\': 589310}, \'multiverseid\': 589310}, {\'name\': \'金属の急使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金属の急使が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を公開する。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、もう１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。あなたがこれによりアーティファクト・カードをあなたの手札に加えたなら、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4421773-20dd-42d4-b653-3fb34a30dca6\', \'multiverseId\': 589454}, \'multiverseid\': 589454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Krieg der Brüder\', \'text\': \'(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Erzeuge zwei getappte Kraftstein-Spielsteine.\\nII — Bestimme zwei Spieler deiner Wahl. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen in jedem Kampf alle Kreaturen, die sie kontrollieren, den jeweils anderen bestimmten Spieler an, falls möglich.\\nIII — Der Krieg der Brüder fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte und einem anderen Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a7e8712-a68c-479e-b3f8-9f3c78852fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 586472}, \'multiverseid\': 586472}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra de los Hermanos\', \'text\': \'(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI — Crea dos fichas de Piedra de poder giradas.\\nII — Elige dos jugadores objetivo. Hasta tu próximo turno, cada criatura que controlan ataca al otro jugador elegido cada combate si puede.\\nIII — La Guerra de los Hermanos hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y X puntos de daño a cualquier otro objetivo, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40527679-8c7a-4807-a752-d2388c6af041\', \'multiverseId\': 586480}, \'multiverseid\': 586480}, {\'name\': \'La Guerre Fratricide\', \'text\': "(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Créez deux jetons Lithoforce engagés.\\nII — Choisissez deux joueurs ciblés. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, chaque créature qu\'ils contrôlent attaque l\'autre joueur choisi à chaque combat si possible.\\nIII — La Guerre Fratricide inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et X blessures à n\'importe quelle autre cible, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9013abf5-00df-46ff-b500-006b6f8400d6\', \'multiverseId\': 586488}, \'multiverseid\': 586488}, {\'name\': \'La Guerra dei Fratelli\', \'text\': "(Mentre questa Saga entra e dopo la tua sottofase di acquisizione, aggiungi un segnalino sapere. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Crea due pedine Pietra del Potere TAPpate.\\nII — Scegli due giocatori bersaglio. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, ogni creatura che controllano attacca l\'altro giocatore scelto in ogni combattimento, se possibile.\\nIII — La Guerra dei Fratelli infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e X danni a un qualsiasi altro bersaglio, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b1c9f9-c024-4afb-9071-7039334cfdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 586496}, \'multiverseid\': 586496}, {\'name\': \'兄弟戦争\', \'text\': \'（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — パワーストーン・トークン２つをタップ状態で生成する。\\nII — プレイヤー２人を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、各戦闘で、それらのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、可能ならタイパンにしたもう１人のプレイヤーを攻撃する。\\nIII — クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つと、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうちそれでない１つを対象とする。兄弟戦争はその前者にＸ点、その後者にＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3ea5ef-ba4e-4569-a151-a593414df142\', \'multiverseId\': 586504}, \'multiverseid\': 586504}, {\'name\': \'A Guerra dos Irmãos\', \'text\': \'(Conforme esta Saga entra e após sua etapa de compra, adicione um marcador de conhecimento. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Crie duas fichas de Pedra de Energia viradas.\\nII — Escolha dois jogadores alvo. Até seu próximo turno, cada criatura que eles controlam ataca o outro jogador escolhido a cada combate se estiver apta.\\nIII — A Guerra dos Irmãos causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e X pontos de dano a qualquer outro alvo, sendo X o número de artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f19fa7-08d3-48b8-973a-c46a855867e2\', \'multiverseId\': 586520}, \'multiverseid\': 586520}, {\'name\': \'兄弟之战\', \'text\': \'（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 派出两个已横置的魔力石衍生物。\\nII — 选择两位目标牌手。对每个由这些牌手操控的生物而言，直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击另一位所选牌手，则必须如此攻击。\\nIII — 兄弟之战对任意一个目标造成X点伤害，且对任意另一个目标造成X点伤害，X为由你操控的神器数量。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a2e6d0-35b0-4eb1-b6e4-90571adba100\', \'multiverseId\': 586536}, \'multiverseid\': 586536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Erzimandritin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand minus 4 ist.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält jeder Berater, Handwerker und Mönch, den du kontrollierst, Wachsamkeit und erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du dazuerhalten hast.\\nTappe drei ungetappte Berater, Handwerker und/oder Mönche, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586476&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0350a54b-5cd0-4485-a38e-3e99839ef544\', \'multiverseId\': 586476}, \'multiverseid\': 586476}, {\'name\': \'La archimandrita\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano menos 4.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, cada Consejero, Artífice y Monje que controlas gana la habilidad de vigilancia y obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste.\\nGirar tres Consejeros, Artífices y/o Monjes enderezados que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93dc2592-0175-4799-876a-2a74117f4f02\', \'multiverseId\': 586484}, \'multiverseid\': 586484}, {\'name\': "L\'Archimandrite", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main moins 4.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque conseiller, artificier et moine que vous contrôlez acquiert la vigilance et gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés.\\nEngagez trois conseillers, artificiers et/ou moines que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42152c9b-f697-4fc4-a05f-18cf0baa420d\', \'multiverseId\': 586492}, \'multiverseid\': 586492}, {\'name\': "L\'Archimandrita", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guadagni X punti vita, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano meno 4.\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni Consigliere, Artefice e Monaco che controlli ha cautela e prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X sono i punti vita che hai guadagnato.\\nTAPpa tre Consiglieri, Artefici e/o Monaci STAPpati che controlli: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba4ce9c-a45f-432f-8dea-62c840092884\', \'multiverseId\': 586500}, \'multiverseid\': 586500}, {\'name\': \'最高機構長\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数から４を引いた値に等しい。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアドバイザーや工匠やモンクは警戒を得て＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい。\\nアドバイザーや工匠やモンクのうちあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である３体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cadd96dc-9c8a-4306-9b33-0d083daf48a4\', \'multiverseId\': 586508}, \'multiverseid\': 586508}, {\'name\': \'A Arquimandrita\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cards em sua mão menos 4.\\nToda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, cada Conselheiro, Artesão e Monge que você controla ganha vigilância e recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou.\\nVire três Conselheiros, Artesãos e/ou Monges desvirados que você controla: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca76ea2-9744-4b34-ae24-2a23cba5fc8d\', \'multiverseId\': 586524}, \'multiverseid\': 586524}, {\'name\': \'至尊掌院\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得X点生命，X为你的手牌数量减4。\\n每当你获得生命时，直到回合结束，每个由你操控的参谋、神器师和修行僧均获得警戒异能且得+X/+0，X为你所获得的生命数量。\\n横置三个由你操控且未横置的参谋，神器师和／或修行僧：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60262234-b930-4b51-b449-207837cc1097\', \'multiverseId\': 586540}, \'multiverseid\': 586540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Erzimandritin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand minus 4 ist.\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält jeder Berater, Handwerker und Mönch, den du kontrollierst, Wachsamkeit und erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du dazuerhalten hast.\\nTappe drei ungetappte Berater, Handwerker und/oder Mönche, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab722017-c062-4a57-a576-02b79aeccc60\', \'multiverseId\': 588512}, \'multiverseid\': 588512}, {\'name\': "L\'Archimandrite", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main moins 4.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque conseiller, artificier et moine que vous contrôlez acquiert la vigilance et gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés.\\nEngagez trois conseillers, artificiers et/ou moines que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5472eab-6c79-47bc-86f9-31f2a50006ac\', \'multiverseId\': 588523}, \'multiverseid\': 588523}, {\'name\': \'最高機構長\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数から４を引いた値に等しい。\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアドバイザーや工匠やモンクは警戒を得て＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたが得たライフの点数に等しい。\\nアドバイザーや工匠やモンクのうちあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である３体をタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'682071ff-cf0f-4eef-9920-0d308d2dd8f8\', \'multiverseId\': 588534}, \'multiverseid\': 588534}, {\'name\': \'至尊掌院\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得X点生命，X为你的手牌数量减4。\\n每当你获得生命时，直到回合结束，每个由你操控的参谋、神器师和修行僧均获得警戒异能且得+X/+0，X为你所获得的生命数量。\\n横置三个由你操控且未横置的参谋，神器师和／或修行僧：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78940473-36c4-4a54-a0b6-0160964c60a2\', \'multiverseId\': 588545}, \'multiverseid\': 588545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener des Filigranen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Dieners des Filigranen ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Homunkulus\', \'flavor\': \'„Der perfekte Helfer ist ein reaktionsschneller und geschickter Assistent, der in der Lage ist, alle hohen Regale zu erreichen."\\n—Coruk, Esper-Handwerker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8fd336-5377-4bab-a9a4-868272dd0e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 588840}, \'multiverseid\': 588840}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Ayudante de filigrana es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': \'"El ayudante ideal es el que está atento, es hábil y puede llegar a las estanterías altas".\\n—Córuk, artífice de Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'428eac79-60b4-4662-8b7a-8478833c827c\', \'multiverseId\': 588984}, \'multiverseid\': 588984}, {\'name\': \'Suivant de filigrane\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Suivant de filigrane est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : homoncule\', \'flavor\': "« Le parfait assistant doit être réactif, adroit et capable d\'atteindre les étagères les plus hautes. »\\n—Coruk, artificier d\'Esper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395b5871-1aa1-4a23-8ccd-bc536365aba4\', \'multiverseId\': 589128}, \'multiverseid\': 589128}, {\'name\': \'Servitore di Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza del Servitore di Filigrana è pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Omuncolo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'assistente perfetto deve essere reattivo, capace e in grado di raggiungere gli scaffali più alti."\\n—Coruk, artefice di Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29bd6c49-664d-4560-805f-a7c1b993f3d8\', \'multiverseId\': 589272}, \'multiverseid\': 589272}, {\'name\': \'金線の従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金線の従者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ホムンクルス\', \'flavor\': \'「完璧な助手の条件は、責任感があり、器用で、高い棚にも手が届くことだ。」\\n――エスパーの工匠、コルーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecea9e2-aa78-4798-9234-0c376cda4f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 589416}, \'multiverseid\': 589416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408fc188-da83-4da3-b093-012a443c689a\', \'multiverseId\': 588937}, \'multiverseid\': 588937}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1dfc0f4-68d0-462f-ae6b-301b358d26a3\', \'multiverseId\': 589081}, \'multiverseid\': 589081}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5959e0a0-b851-48fc-a50f-de394f3e65e4\', \'multiverseId\': 589225}, \'multiverseid\': 589225}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3126f820-1897-4fe3-b499-b03c6e9cfdab\', \'multiverseId\': 589369}, \'multiverseid\': 589369}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a826884d-534a-404a-96db-7de158948a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 589513}, \'multiverseid\': 589513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Symbol der Dimir bekommen nur die eigenen Mitglieder als Erkennungszeichen der geheimen Gilde zu sehen — und die Verdammten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd23fb16-685a-4bcb-8bc5-ac650257d63b\', \'multiverseId\': 588893}, \'multiverseid\': 588893}, {\'name\': \'Sello dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Como emblema de un gremio secreto, la insignia dimir solo la conocen sus propios miembros... y los condenados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d8e0b6-c461-444c-bbe0-cd450be29ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 589037}, \'multiverseid\': 589037}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'insigne de Dimir est l\'emblème d\'une guilde secrète, et seuls ses membres le voient — ses membres, mais aussi ses victimes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e897b4e7-d155-4f84-83f4-cf2c3cef75f8\', \'multiverseId\': 589181}, \'multiverseid\': 589181}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Dimir\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Emblema di una gilda segreta, le insegne dei Dimir possono essere viste solo dai suoi membri e da coloro che sono condannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83e7d84-435d-4226-ad39-8fd5f1d84ba6\', \'multiverseId\': 589325}, \'multiverseid\': 589325}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち、そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e3e5469-e408-4165-90ab-0f1cfec0107e\', \'multiverseId\': 589469}, \'multiverseid\': 589469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drahtchirurgen\', \'text\': \'Furcht\\nJede Artefaktkreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Zugabe. Ihre Zugabe-Kosten sind gleich ihren Manakosten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4922c4b0-b065-4ae6-846a-9e79f904b3c9\', \'multiverseId\': 588572}, \'multiverseid\': 588572}, {\'name\': \'Chirurgiens câblés\', \'text\': "Peur\\nChaque carte de créature-artefact dans votre cimetière a l\'encore. Son coût d\'encore est égal à son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f80a2c9-879e-49fa-b6e4-766138e67399\', \'multiverseId\': 588588}, \'multiverseid\': 588588}, {\'name\': \'導線外科医\', \'text\': \'畏（い）怖（ふ）\\nあなたの墓地にある各アーティファクト・クリーチャー・カードはそれぞれ再演を持つ。それらの再演コストはそれぞれ、マナ・コストに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411d935f-b15c-49d5-9301-0279eaaa9486\', \'multiverseId\': 588604}, \'multiverseid\': 588604}, {\'name\': \'线缆医士\', \'text\': \'恐惧\\n你坟墓场中的每张神器生物牌均具有返场异能。其返场费用等同于其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b47335-1076-4fa5-bcfa-441e80f25fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 588620}, \'multiverseid\': 588620}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drahtchirurgen\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\\nJede Artefaktkreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Zugabe. Ihre Zugabe-Kosten sind gleich ihren Manakosten. (Schicke die Karte ins Exil und bezahle ihre Manakosten: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2bf649-8183-441d-9e63-dd46cfe0d302\', \'multiverseId\': 588421}, \'multiverseid\': 588421}, {\'name\': \'Cirujanos conectados\', \'text\': \'Inspirar temor. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\\nCada carta de criatura artefacto en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de replicar. Su coste de replicar es igual a su coste de maná. (Exiliarla y pagar su coste de maná: Por cada oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia y que ataca a ese oponente este turno, si puede. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícalas al comienzo del próximo paso final. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beefca3b-21c9-4f77-9b50-6b3a47902b02\', \'multiverseId\': 588437}, \'multiverseid\': 588437}, {\'name\': \'Chirurgiens câblés\', \'text\': "Peur (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nChaque carte de créature-artefact dans votre cimetière a l\'encore. Son coût d\'encore est égal à son coût de mana. (Exilez-la et payez son coût de mana : Pour chaque adversaire, créez une copie jeton qui attaque cet adversaire ce tour-ci si possible. Elle acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2025e988-a293-4187-9fe3-181dec03e915\', \'multiverseId\': 588453}, \'multiverseid\': 588453}, {\'name\': \'Chirurghi Cablati\', \'text\': "Paura (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature nere.)\\nOgni carta creatura artefatto nel tuo cimitero ha bis. Il suo costo di bis è pari al suo costo di mana. (Esilia quella carta e paga il suo costo di mana: Per ogni avversario, crea una pedina che è una sua copia e che attacca quell\'avversario in questo turno, se può farlo. Queste pedine hanno rapidità. Sacrificale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa1fdd4-da45-4979-a6bd-e032293dacb6\', \'multiverseId\': 588469}, \'multiverseid\': 588469}, {\'name\': \'導線外科医\', \'text\': \'畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーにはブロックされない。）\\nあなたの墓地にある各アーティファクト・クリーチャー・カードはそれぞれ再演を持つ。それらの再演コストはそれぞれ、マナ・コストに等しい。（それを追放し、そのマナ・コストを支払う：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１つを生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e967478-33aa-4475-8173-41166d8ad63c\', \'multiverseId\': 588485}, \'multiverseid\': 588485}]', "[{'name': 'Dreiste Umformer', 'text': '{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Artefaktkarte aufdeckst. Bringe sie ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Die Dreisten Umformer fügen dir Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588867&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc3a2b96-5fc9-4272-bd6f-394273d2ed07', 'multiverseId': 588867}, 'multiverseid': 588867}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c16e8a9-2aaf-4c7d-9499-4efe6598f21a\', \'multiverseId\': 588936}, \'multiverseid\': 588936}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las lóbregas mareas otarianas esconden las traiciones olvidadas de la guerra pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6368958-258a-4342-b256-475907aec14c\', \'multiverseId\': 589080}, \'multiverseid\': 589080}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bddc33b-711a-4144-a141-cc04ee308a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 589224}, \'multiverseid\': 589224}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le fosche maree di Otaria celano allo sguardo i tradimenti dimenticati della guerra di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be3e365-8256-42ef-8de8-2c9d81e04211\', \'multiverseId\': 589368}, \'multiverseid\': 589368}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアの濁った潮流が、ファイレクシア戦の古い裏切り行為を覆い隠している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e674e6c-ce82-45a6-a98e-170757d9c656\', \'multiverseId\': 589512}, \'multiverseid\': 589512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit der Maschine\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Anzahl Karten in Höhe des höchsten Manabetrags unter den Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Als ich die Weltenbrücke in meinen Körper integrierte, spürte ich, wie mein Planeswalker-Funke über mich hinaus entflammte. Das Multiversum war mein Spielzeug. Es fühlte sich … unglaublich an."\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4316c0cb-e921-4141-b1a6-1d38a1d21872\', \'multiverseId\': 588845}, \'multiverseid\': 588845}, {\'name\': \'Ser uno con la máquina\', \'text\': \'Roba una cantidad de cartas igual al mayor valor de maná entre los artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando me fusioné con el puente entre planos, sentí que mi chispa de Planeswalker brillaba más allá de mi cuerpo. El Multiverso era mi juguete. La sensación fue... increíble".\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f5650f-664e-4090-949b-f24b486aaa0a\', \'multiverseId\': 588989}, \'multiverseid\': 588989}, {\'name\': \'Fusion avec la machine\', \'text\': \'Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi les artefacts que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque je me suis greffé le Pont planaire, j\'ai senti mon étincelle de Planeswalker flamboyer au-delà de mon corps. Le Multivers était mon jouet. Je me sentais... incroyablement bien. »\\n—Tezzeret", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b193ef-dcd2-4547-b28c-7b4145906ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 589133}, \'multiverseid\': 589133}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con la Macchina\', \'text\': \'Pesca un numero di carte pari al valore di mana maggiore tra gli artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il Ponte Planare è diventato parte di me, la mia scintilla di Planeswalker è divampata al di fuori del mio corpo. L\\\'intero Multiverso era il mio giocattolo. È stato... incredibile."\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9926ac8-9c8f-47ea-a993-0544f5cc0ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 589277}, \'multiverseid\': 589277}, {\'name\': \'機械と共に\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「次元橋を私の中へと移植したとき、プレインズウォーカーの灯が私の身体を越えて燃え上がるのを感じたのだ。多元宇宙は私の遊び道具だった。あれは……最高の気分だった。」\\n――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9299e531-6c62-4549-9d62-ba9c4090d66d\', \'multiverseId\': 589421}, \'multiverseid\': 589421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emry, Wächterin des Sees\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\\nWenn Emry, Wächterin des Sees, ins Spiel kommt, millst du vier Karten.\\n{T}: Bestimme eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken. (Du bezahlst immer noch ihre Kosten. Zeitpunkts-Einschränkungen gelten weiterhin.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf8bc2c5-5323-4ac8-bc83-57581762225c\', \'multiverseId\': 588836}, \'multiverseid\': 588836}, {\'name\': \'Emry, acechadora del lago\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada artefacto que controlas.\\nCuando Emry, acechadora del lago entre al campo de batalla, muele cuatro cartas.\\n{T}: Elige una carta de artefacto objetivo en tu cementerio. Puedes lanzar esa carta este turno. (Sigues pagando sus costes. Las reglas sobre cuándo jugarla se siguen aplicando.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'babfcace-a981-4907-9642-fcb8d309776a\', \'multiverseId\': 588980}, \'multiverseid\': 588980}, {\'name\': \'Emry, guetteuse du loch\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand Emry, guetteuse du loch arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez quatre cartes.\\n{T} : Choisissez une carte d\'artefact ciblée dans votre cimetière. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte ce tour-ci. (Vous payez toujours ses coûts. Les restrictions de temps s\'appliquent quand même.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60503e5d-4ca3-4da0-bcfe-abf342209597\', \'multiverseId\': 589124}, \'multiverseid\': 589124}, {\'name\': \'Emry, Nascosta nel Loch\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli.\\nQuando Emry, Nascosta nel Loch entra nel campo di battaglia, macina quattro carte.\\n{T}: Scegli una carta artefatto bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Puoi lanciare quella carta in questo turno. (Paghi comunque i suoi costi. Le regole sulla tempistica si applicano comunque.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b75a8a-5a52-478d-9297-4cb0e62f62b1\', \'multiverseId\': 589268}, \'multiverseid\': 589268}, {\'name\': \'湖に潜む者、エムリー\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\\n湖に潜む者、エムリーが戦場に出たとき、カード４枚を切削する。\\n{T}：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。このターン、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。（そのコストは支払う必要がある。タイミングのルールも適用される。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f31fc0-082b-42be-85fc-5d3b381e1236\', \'multiverseId\': 589412}, \'multiverseid\': 589412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Ruinen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588823&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320e321e-4c25-4994-8569-b7e9ab2e13e8\', \'multiverseId\': 588823}, \'multiverseid\': 588823}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de las ruinas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de las ruinas entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta dos artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b2225d-b6db-4ac6-b823-53bc45a56600\', \'multiverseId\': 588967}, \'multiverseid\': 588967}, {\'name\': \'Ange des ruines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange des ruines arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à deux cibles, artefacts et/ou enchantements.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'837bc039-d99d-48a5-97dd-72b1ba999f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 589111}, \'multiverseid\': 589111}, {\'name\': \'Angelo delle Rovine\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo delle Rovine entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia fino a due artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cae90ad-749e-4f64-9068-2f59032d0316\', \'multiverseId\': 589255}, \'multiverseid\': 589255}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺跡の天使が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2},このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29dcf502-d49d-48da-9a0e-58b57cb8c383\', \'multiverseId\': 589399}, \'multiverseid\': 589399}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588916&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8df3e04f-e432-425f-bc14-0a7c59eab450', 'multiverseId': 588916}, 'multiverseid': 588916}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589060&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '218553bc-f616-466a-8f9c-87937f0451e0', 'multiverseId': 589060}, 'multiverseid': 589060}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589204&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79c54df8-9b51-45ae-9037-ab717f17b78e', 'multiverseId': 589204}, 'multiverseid': 589204}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589348&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a271ca77-c4ff-41e6-8797-0a15a39eed76', 'multiverseId': 589348}, 'multiverseid': 589348}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589492&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf41eb8f-2d7c-4696-bff6-2b8a387771f4', 'multiverseId': 589492}, 'multiverseid': 589492}]", '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588940&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8084657a-1429-4c5e-941d-bc2acc4990a4\', \'multiverseId\': 588940}, \'multiverseid\': 588940}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db45a3d2-081b-4840-bd92-109d1e2d1fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 589084}, \'multiverseid\': 589084}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb2b193-ed9c-4a0b-9763-d27865bf4a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 589228}, \'multiverseid\': 589228}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d835e9-a378-4d10-b6a9-a7745ebb37be\', \'multiverseId\': 589372}, \'multiverseid\': 589372}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fec1a43-38d6-4fe9-8ba2-e40d8a3947f1\', \'multiverseId\': 589516}, \'multiverseid\': 589516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fain der Vermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{B}: Enttappe Fain den Vermittler.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1569c2f6-5b3a-420b-a130-2a7efda084a0\', \'multiverseId\': 588860}, \'multiverseid\': 588860}, {\'name\': \'Fain, el Negociante\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{T}, remover un contador de una criatura que controlas: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{B}: Endereza a Fain, el Negociante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae8a80d-4ca8-4b08-99d6-b23dcba115a9\', \'multiverseId\': 589004}, \'multiverseid\': 589004}, {\'name\': \'Faïn, le courtier\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'une créature que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol.\\n{3}{B} : Dégagez Faïn, le courtier.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72f38c9d-73fd-4038-aef5-d2cf6278766d\', \'multiverseId\': 589148}, \'multiverseid\': 589148}, {\'name\': \'Fain, il Mediatore\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino da una creatura che controlli: Crea una pedina Tesoro.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Crea una pedina creatura Scarabocchio 2/1 bianca e nera con volare.\\n{3}{B}: STAPpa Fain, il Mediatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f023a44-70fb-4bdf-ac77-c2db64ab4d16\', \'multiverseId\': 589292}, \'multiverseid\': 589292}, {\'name\': \'仲介人、フェイン\', \'text\': \'{T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T},あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T},アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つ白黒の２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{3}{B}：仲介人、フェインをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60ea1d9-b4d6-45ef-bfd8-eff15a453317\', \'multiverseId\': 589436}, \'multiverseid\': 589436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm den einen Haufen auf deine Hand und lege den anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Tu wenigstens so, als ob du verstündest, was wichtig ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1013e81-832b-406f-914c-931db67445a5\', \'multiverseId\': 588839}, \'multiverseid\': 588839}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Intenta fingir que entiendes lo que es importante".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c48a4517-3b64-49f5-8e85-0dbf2b792c85\', \'multiverseId\': 588983}, \'multiverseid\': 588983}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Fais au moins semblant de suivre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0162e92-a1c1-4324-959e-df1427c3ddc8\', \'multiverseId\': 589127}, \'multiverseid\': 589127}, {\'name\': \'Certezza o Finzione\', \'text\': "Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerca di far finta di capire cosa è importante."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a100bfd7-782f-4eee-afb7-eee29c732b42\', \'multiverseId\': 589271}, \'multiverseid\': 589271}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に、もう一方の束をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「何が重要かわかっているふりでもするがいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123a9e9e-04cc-4515-8a75-faec75bd3c69\', \'multiverseId\': 589415}, \'multiverseid\': 589415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Farid, geschäftstüchtiger Schrottsammler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Nichtspielstein-Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Schrott.\\n{1}{R}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bestimme eines —\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Farid. Er erhält Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2800f4d-c641-43a2-83ca-cead34ba25c1\', \'multiverseId\': 588424}, \'multiverseid\': 588424}, {\'name\': \'Farid, rescatador decisivo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto que no sea ficha que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de artefacto incolora llamada Chatarra.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un artefacto: Elige uno:\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Farid. Gana la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\\n• Incita a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Descarta una carta, luego roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bcac79-1c68-452e-982e-3696ddf31eb6\', \'multiverseId\': 588440}, \'multiverseid\': 588440}, {\'name\': \'Farid, récupérateur entreprenant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact non-jeton que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Ferraille.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un artefact : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Farid. Il acquiert la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bdf134-93da-4c10-8550-e8b77e6b6fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 588456}, \'multiverseid\': 588456}, {\'name\': \'Farid, Recuperatore Intraprendente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto non pedina che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina artefatto incolore chiamata Rottame.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Scegli uno —\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Farid. Ha minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Scarta una carta, poi pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73afd0a-24aa-4bbb-8b51-08479379fe0c\', \'multiverseId\': 588472}, \'multiverseid\': 588472}, {\'name\': \'実業的な回収者、ファリド\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、「屑鉄」という名前の無色のアーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{1}{R}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 実業的な回収者、ファリドの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、これは威迫を得る。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n• カード１枚を捨て、その後、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b6ba07b-652f-4ec1-9763-ed09c53c9781\', \'multiverseId\': 588488}, \'multiverseid\': 588488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Farid, geschäftstüchtiger Schrottsammler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Nichtspielstein-Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Schrott.\\n{1}{R}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bestimme eines —\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Farid. Er erhält Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\n• Wirf eine Karte ab und ziehe dann eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa00925e-f2f3-41fa-80c3-69cee831ac67\', \'multiverseId\': 588575}, \'multiverseid\': 588575}, {\'name\': \'Farid, récupérateur entreprenant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact non-jeton que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Ferraille.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un artefact : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Farid. Il acquiert la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée.\\n• Défaussez-vous d\'une carte, puis piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548c618f-1ac5-423c-9a3d-08b48d61e969\', \'multiverseId\': 588591}, \'multiverseid\': 588591}, {\'name\': \'実業的な回収者、ファリド\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、「屑鉄」という名前の無色のアーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{1}{R}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 実業的な回収者、ファリドの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、これは威迫を得る。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n• カード１枚を捨て、その後、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c2471a1-8fd3-4ca1-ba54-c6a265ab48fe\', \'multiverseId\': 588607}, \'multiverseid\': 588607}, {\'name\': \'野望回收师法逸德\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控且非衍生物的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个无色，名称为废铁的衍生神器。\\n{1}{R}，牺牲一个神器：选择一项～\\n•在法逸德上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得威慑异能直到回合结束。\\n•煽惑目标生物。\\n•弃一张牌，然后抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223b04d4-5cdf-40ce-a554-fbbacf77b6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 588623}, \'multiverseid\': 588623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868cf4a7-d812-4dee-8289-da0b1cf53b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 588896}, \'multiverseid\': 588896}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?".\\n—Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9f0c710-e8c8-4eed-8485-6728f8c5385a\', \'multiverseId\': 589040}, \'multiverseid\': 589040}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? »\\n—Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d20b0d-c25d-4752-b4df-428a4585d535\', \'multiverseId\': 589184}, \'multiverseid\': 589184}, {\'name\': \'Pietra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'hai tu che io non posso ottenere?"\\n—Mairsil, il Pretendente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86676970-0655-49bc-9046-8875e945eb70\', \'multiverseId\': 589328}, \'multiverseid\': 589328}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――偽善者、メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4a94ac-574a-40f0-b6f9-e3007bdf999a\', \'multiverseId\': 589472}, \'multiverseid\': 589472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet ist."\\n—Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef2d480-b475-4470-b607-599ea0ac2e73\', \'multiverseId\': 588921}, \'multiverseid\': 588921}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado".\\n—Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9914f5-2449-4076-908e-ed98a3514bda\', \'multiverseId\': 589065}, \'multiverseid\': 589065}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. »\\n—Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd600ce1-efc4-4ef1-b769-b6721fba5d46\', \'multiverseId\': 589209}, \'multiverseid\': 589209}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati."\\n—Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe156e7b-6c65-4684-9429-149d98373561\', \'multiverseId\': 589353}, \'multiverseid\': 589353}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ。ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」\\n――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4acb4c7b-b49a-4771-acec-43e85978e9af\', \'multiverseId\': 589497}, \'multiverseid\': 589497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss der Tränen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}. Falls du in diesem Zug ein Land gespielt hast, erzeuge stattdessen {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Westvolk weinte, und seine Tränen gruben tiefe Flüsse in die Wangen der Welt."\\n—Glem, der einsame Barde,„Die Ursprünge von Kholon"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfaa7708-2dce-4967-843d-7e3e3ecd00ca\', \'multiverseId\': 588952}, \'multiverseid\': 588952}, {\'name\': \'Río de lágrimas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}. Si jugaste una tierra este turno, en vez de eso, agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"El pueblo del oeste llora, y sus lágrimas forman ríos que atraviesan la mejilla del mundo".\\n—Glem, el bardo solitario, Orígenes de Kholon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca52ef91-1d01-4608-a2b0-9a898d2e523a\', \'multiverseId\': 589096}, \'multiverseid\': 589096}, {\'name\': \'Rivière de larmes\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U}. Si vous avez joué un terrain ce tour-ci, ajoutez {B} à la place.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Ouestriens pleurèrent, et leurs larmes creusèrent de longs fleuves sinueux dans la joue du monde. »\\n—Glem le Solibarde, « Les origines de Kholon »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df398f5-5590-4944-a8d3-a1ab2e77b59e\', \'multiverseId\': 589240}, \'multiverseid\': 589240}, {\'name\': \'Fiume di Lacrime\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}. Se hai giocato una terra in questo turno, aggiungi invece {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Le Genti dell\\\'Ovest piansero e le loro lacrime tracciarono fiumi tortuosi sulle gote del mondo."\\n—Glem il Bardo Solitario, "Le Origini di Kholon"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffca8ee9-6cd3-4c9a-82b9-0773280ebf6c\', \'multiverseId\': 589384}, \'multiverseid\': 589384}, {\'name\': \'涙の川\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。あなたがこのターンに土地をプレイしていたなら、代わりに{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'西の民は嘆き、その涙はうねる川となって世界の頬へとそそいだ。\\n――独り唄のグレム、「コロンの起源」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66856920-d4f8-470d-88de-4bf3d9778cec\', \'multiverseId\': 589528}, \'multiverseid\': 589528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüssigmetall-Halsreif\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einem Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wehrhafter Schmuck hat eine lange und respektierte Geschichte."\\n—Ervos Trax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebdd9a4b-f22e-4ce8-be58-4a82d3795527\', \'multiverseId\': 588900}, \'multiverseid\': 588900}, {\'name\': \'Torques de metal líquido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: El permanente objetivo que no sea tierra se convierte en un artefacto además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las joyas hechas armas tienen una larga y respetada historia".\\n—Ervos Trax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a18705-efa8-4289-93ea-b5642d3c1ca3\', \'multiverseId\': 589044}, \'multiverseid\': 589044}, {\'name\': \'Torque de liquimétal\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Un permanent non-terrain ciblé devient un artefact en plus de ses autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les bijoux de combat ont une longue histoire très respectée. »\\n—Ervos Trax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d312ff-2dc5-4e8a-9203-00c610444dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 589188}, \'multiverseid\': 589188}, {\'name\': \'Collana di Liquimetallo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Un permanente non terra bersaglio diventa un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I gioielli a uso bellico vantano una lunga e antica tradizione."\\n—Ervos Trax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5dfae7-e85c-4511-a0d0-e33e33eff5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 589332}, \'multiverseid\': 589332}, {\'name\': \'液鋼の首飾り\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはそれの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「武器を兼ねたアクセサリーには長い立派な歴史があるのだ。」\\n――エルヴォス・トラクス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d2f988-3eec-491e-aadc-9fddb9535f50\', \'multiverseId\': 589476}, \'multiverseid\': 589476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelstöberer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Funkelstöberer erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter den Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn der Funkelstöberer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken. Nimm eine Artefaktkarte, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurde, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588418&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daff7d20-3bfb-4b63-a061-68cc9381642e\', \'multiverseId\': 588418}, \'multiverseid\': 588418}, {\'name\': \'Atesorador de centelleos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Atesorador de centelleos obtiene +X/+0, donde X es el mayor valor de maná entre los artefactos que controlas.\\nSiempre que el Atesorador de centelleos haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes mostrar esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Pon una carta de artefacto mostrada de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ac2906-b524-4d87-8070-e614ee2cf598\', \'multiverseId\': 588434}, \'multiverseid\': 588434}, {\'name\': \'Ratisseur rutilant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLe Ratisseur rutilant gagne +X/+0, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi les artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ratisseur rutilant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez révéler autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez une carte d\'artefact révélée de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6047c9b-a700-4934-868f-a1c8b2fd1d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 588450}, \'multiverseid\': 588450}, {\'name\': \'Rastrella Bagliori\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nIl Rastrella Bagliori prende +X/+0, dove X è il valore di mana maggiore tra gli artefatti che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta il Rastrella Bagliori infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi rivelare altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano una carta artefatto rivelata in questo modo e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55fc6d13-914c-41ed-bf74-a407c4c7956e\', \'multiverseId\': 588466}, \'multiverseid\': 588466}, {\'name\': \'きらめき削り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nきらめき削りは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しい。\\nきらめき削りがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを公開してもよい。これにより公開されたアーティファクト・カード１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a389d96-dd06-42a8-91c5-e8321259767a\', \'multiverseId\': 588482}, \'multiverseid\': 588482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelstöberer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Funkelstöberer erhält +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter den Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn der Funkelstöberer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken. Nimm eine Artefaktkarte, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurde, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1286a7-f49e-468a-8aeb-d642b94d5adc\', \'multiverseId\': 588569}, \'multiverseid\': 588569}, {\'name\': \'Ratisseur rutilant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLe Ratisseur rutilant gagne +X/+0, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi les artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ratisseur rutilant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez révéler autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez une carte d\'artefact révélée de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588585&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4c4bbe-f3bd-42ee-9809-0206f428e303\', \'multiverseId\': 588585}, \'multiverseid\': 588585}, {\'name\': \'きらめき削り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nきらめき削りは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しい。\\nきらめき削りがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるその点数に等しい枚数のカードを公開してもよい。これにより公開されたアーティファクト・カード１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813d0efa-612e-492b-9f40-e7a39ca237de\', \'multiverseId\': 588601}, \'multiverseid\': 588601}, {\'name\': \'晶闪纵掠兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n晶闪纵掠兽得+X/+0，X为由你操控之神器中的最大法术力值。\\n每当晶闪纵掠兽对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以从你的牌库顶展示等量的牌。将以此法展示出的一张神器牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a3f921-d36f-4f72-a564-e9777afedc55\', \'multiverseId\': 588617}, \'multiverseid\': 588617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenraub\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana wandte sich flüsternd an die Reste von Oketras und Bontus Bewusstsein: „Ihr seid die Götter. Er ist ein Eindringling. Ihr wisst, was zu tun ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bbb151-845e-430a-a6e9-937a92a482a8\', \'multiverseId\': 588879}, \'multiverseid\': 588879}, {\'name\': \'Extraer la chispa\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana susurró a la poca conciencia de sí mismas que quedaba en Oketra y Bontu:\\n—Ustedes son las diosas. Él es el usurpador. Ya saben qué hacer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e1e1a37-6a41-4803-b04c-5365666beb45\', \'multiverseId\': 589023}, \'multiverseid\': 589023}, {\'name\': "Suppression d\'étincelle", \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent ciblé avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Liliana murmura au peu de conscience qu\'il restait à Oketra et Bontu. « Vous êtes les dieux. C\'est lui l\'imposteur. Vous savez ce que vous avez à faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931f6a64-9023-4eab-9043-c6069500e5c7\', \'multiverseId\': 589167}, \'multiverseid\': 589167}, {\'name\': \'Descintillazione\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sussurrò al barlume di coscienza che rimaneva in Oketra e Bontu. "Voi siete le dee. Lui è l\\\'usurpatore. Sapete cosa fare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c75cd7e3-5a9f-4ab5-ac7f-b6e2bbb9bb4b\', \'multiverseId\': 589311}, \'multiverseid\': 589311}, {\'name\': \'灯の燼滅\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以上であるパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オケチラとバントゥにどれほど自意識が残っているか分からないまま、リリアナはこう囁いた。「あなたたちは本当の神でしょ。あれは簒奪者よ。どうするべきか分かるわね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813dea1d-01a9-42f4-9149-2b43ebb799c7\', \'multiverseId\': 589455}, \'multiverseid\': 589455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Futter für den Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jener bleibenden Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf abscheulichen Schwingen und blutigem Wind wird sich der Schwarm erheben."\\n—Inschrift einer Himmelsfestung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b2dc67-d8a7-4ac2-95f2-a18e75721a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 588861}, \'multiverseid\': 588861}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar al enjambre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El enjambre se alzará con alas repugnantes y viento ensangrentado".\\n—Inscripción de aerorruina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a69a42-4510-47ee-9966-4f7c4966a4c0\', \'multiverseId\': 589005}, \'multiverseid\': 589005}, {\'name\': "Nourrir l\'essaim", \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essaim s\'envolera sur ses ailes infâmes, porté par un vent sanglant. »\\n—Inscription sur un fort céleste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f88549-8130-48b1-b7d1-55388bbcfe94\', \'multiverseId\': 589149}, \'multiverseid\': 589149}, {\'name\': \'Nutrire lo Sciame\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio controllati da un avversario. Perdi punti vita pari al valore di mana di quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Su ali spregevoli e vento sanguinario, lo sciame si innalzerà."\\n—Iscrizione dell\\\'enclave celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ac7362-f37a-419d-afd9-e346712d42aa\', \'multiverseId\': 589293}, \'multiverseid\': 589293}, {\'name\': \'大群への給餌\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、そのパーマネントのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「不快な翼と血の風により大群が起きるだろう。」\\n――スカイクレイブの碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a0894f-3f3b-4cce-b0b5-1bd309b5c964\', \'multiverseId\': 589437}, \'multiverseid\': 589437}]', "[{'name': 'Gedankenanordnung', 'text': 'Affinität zu Artefakten (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nZiehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Vedalkenaugen erkennen nicht die Schönheit in den Dingen. Sie sehen nur, was sie aus diesen Dingen lernen können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588854&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aca486dc-7e5a-4e81-85ef-4b25026f42ce', 'multiverseId': 588854}, 'multiverseid': 588854}, {'name': 'Idea expandida', 'text': 'Afinidad por artefactos. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada artefacto que controlas.)\\nRoba dos cartas.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Los ojos de los vedalken no ven la belleza de las cosas. Solo ven lo que esas cosas pueden enseñar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588998&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f3b6668-e1b1-4b44-9dd9-6103945e8bd4', 'multiverseId': 588998}, 'multiverseid': 588998}, {'name': 'Adjuration des pensées', 'text': 'Affinité pour les artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nPiochez deux cartes.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les yeux des vedalkens ne voient pas la beauté qui réside en toute chose. Ils ne voient que ce que ces choses peuvent leur enseigner.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589142&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cadd537-7f18-42d0-a7d8-7a82621ea129', 'multiverseId': 589142}, 'multiverseid': 589142}, {'name': 'Scagliapensiero', 'text': 'Affinità con gli artefatti (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli.)\\nPesca due carte.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Agli occhi dei vedalken la bellezza delle cose è nascosta. Essi sono in grado di vedere solo ciò che le cose possono insegnare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589286&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7693ea9e-3ee7-49c2-966e-0b399625da43', 'multiverseId': 589286}, 'multiverseid': 589286}, {'name': '物読み', 'text': '親和（アーティファクト）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\nカード２枚を引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ヴィダルケンの目は物の美しさを見ていない。彼らが見るのは、物が語る知識だけだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589430&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ccde2bb-feb8-4823-94fe-03818a340ad4', 'multiverseId': 589430}, 'multiverseid': 589430}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gedankengefäß\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Unendliche Möglichkeiten in einem endlichen Raum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c648688e-d5b4-4eed-a323-ade6752664dd\', \'multiverseId\': 588922}, \'multiverseid\': 588922}, {\'name\': \'Vasija de pensamientos\', \'text\': \'Tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Posibilidades infinitas en un espacio finito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba4c627-c1fd-48ba-a7f1-d54ba8c48da6\', \'multiverseId\': 589066}, \'multiverseid\': 589066}, {\'name\': \'Urne de pensée\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Des possibilités infinies dans un espace réduit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9585ca-28b0-43ff-a52b-0d9793b79ec4\', \'multiverseId\': 589210}, \'multiverseid\': 589210}, {\'name\': \'Ricettacolo di Pensieri\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Possibilità infinite contenute in uno spazio finito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22644ada-f211-486c-b239-6b57837e9960\', \'multiverseId\': 589354}, \'multiverseid\': 589354}, {\'name\': \'思考の器\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'有限の空間に封じ込まれた無限の可能性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21949d16-be5a-4b89-9966-811a55af570f\', \'multiverseId\': 589498}, \'multiverseid\': 589498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef24b90-f829-4442-8dd0-21ba2a4642dd\', \'multiverseId\': 588903}, \'multiverseid\': 588903}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58fd05f4-83a3-46d8-9c67-3d8fc3d1b87a\', \'multiverseId\': 589047}, \'multiverseid\': 589047}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da8b626f-4a63-4009-9078-38f2b8327410\', \'multiverseId\': 589191}, \'multiverseid\': 589191}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a8ec03-7fd4-4bf1-9450-15e17ce459eb\', \'multiverseId\': 589335}, \'multiverseid\': 589335}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1},{T},精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515dd0a3-610e-487f-a3fd-18697707d8c6\', \'multiverseId\': 589479}, \'multiverseid\': 589479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenüberwacher\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefakten (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Gedankenüberwacher ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Er durchstreift den Himmel über der Quecksilbersee, stets wachsam für jeden Hinweis auf fehlgeleitete Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d2a196f-5844-4984-b16a-c71629af0f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 588853}, \'multiverseid\': 588853}, {\'name\': \'Monitor de pensamientos\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por artefactos. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada artefacto que controlas.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Monitor de pensamientos entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Surca los cielos sobre el Mar de Mercurio y se mantiene alerta por si hay algún amago de pensamiento aberrante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad8f51f-2815-4eab-92c0-7b712674fdad\', \'multiverseId\': 588997}, \'multiverseid\': 588997}, {\'name\': \'Surveillant de pensées\', \'text\': \'Affinité pour les artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nVol\\nQuand le Surveillant de pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Il patrouille les cieux au-dessus de la mer de Vif-argent, à l\'affût de la moindre trace de pensée anormale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'877a6296-c4ad-4605-85c3-4fcb105b88dd\', \'multiverseId\': 589141}, \'multiverseid\': 589141}, {\'name\': \'Supervisore dei Pensieri\', \'text\': \'Affinità con gli artefatti (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli.)\\nVolare\\nQuando il Supervisore dei Pensieri entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Solca i cieli sul Mare di Mercurio, attento a cogliere qualsiasi traccia di pensiero aberrante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d3172c-9402-4586-b2b3-ea3c5b62c1d8\', \'multiverseId\': 589285}, \'multiverseid\': 589285}, {\'name\': \'思考の監視者\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）\\n飛行\\n思考の監視者が戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'水銀海の上空を巡回し、異常な思考の兆しを見張る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f729c0ad-ee41-4fff-b8f7-38a5ad0523ff\', \'multiverseId\': 589429}, \'multiverseid\': 589429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gehärteter Stahl\', \'text\': \'Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod wird siegen, solange unser Wille rostet. Möge die Not unsere Entschlusskraft stählen."\\n—Ghalma die Formerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f77676-1470-457c-a4fd-77cc614176e4\', \'multiverseId\': 588831}, \'multiverseid\': 588831}, {\'name\': \'Acero templado\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte prevalecerá mientras nuestra voluntad se oxida. Que la necesidad temple nuestra determinación".\\n—Ghalma la Moldeadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23ab75d-1d32-4887-b8fd-136e49961f63\', \'multiverseId\': 588975}, \'multiverseid\': 588975}, {\'name\': \'Acier trempé\', \'text\': \'Les créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La mort l\'emportera tant que nos volontés succomberont à la rouille. Que la nécessité trempe notre détermination. »\\n—Ghalma la forgeuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a22433-9df1-4601-bc9e-2a9092d50032\', \'multiverseId\': 589119}, \'multiverseid\': 589119}, {\'name\': \'Acciaio Temprato\', \'text\': \'Le creature artefatto che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La morte prevarrà finché la nostra volontà soccombe alla ruggine. Possa la necessità fortificare i nostri propositi."\\n—Ghalma la Plasmatrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ffb587c-4c01-4c10-8ffe-f5117d0c62e2\', \'multiverseId\': 589263}, \'multiverseid\': 589263}, {\'name\': \'鍛えられた鋼\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の意思が錆びていくならば、死が広まるでしょう。求める心が我らの決心を鍛えてくれることを願います。」\\n――造物師ガルマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ffb7e1-e76f-48ca-a26b-3c255e2f146c\', \'multiverseId\': 589407}, \'multiverseid\': 589407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gelehrter der Neuen Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Der Gelehrte der Neuen Horizonte kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte und zeige sie offen vor. Falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du die Karte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Falls du die Karte nicht ins Spiel bringst, nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4bb2688-870a-4bca-8275-dcbac1146665\', \'multiverseId\': 588417}, \'multiverseid\': 588417}, {\'name\': \'Erudito de nuevos horizontes\', \'text\': \'El Erudito de nuevos horizontes entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\n{T}, remover un contador de un permanente que controlas: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura y muéstrala. Si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada. Si no pones la carta en el campo de batalla, ponla en tu mano. Luego, baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8be9968-dc16-4a8c-89b5-8e33d008ce81\', \'multiverseId\': 588433}, \'multiverseid\': 588433}, {\'name\': \'Érudit des nouveaux horizons\', \'text\': "L\'Érudit des nouveaux horizons arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine et révélez-la. Si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte sur le champ de bataille, mettez-la dans votre main. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17bb0f0-6ddd-4b24-b1a8-77f87e250d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 588449}, \'multiverseid\': 588449}, {\'name\': \'Studioso dei Nuovi Orizzonti\', \'text\': \'Lo Studioso dei Nuovi Orizzonti entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino da un permanente che controlli: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura e rivelala. Se un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Se non la metti sul campo di battaglia, aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664494f7-e7b5-4de4-8a4b-9d0c57331b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 588465}, \'multiverseid\': 588465}, {\'name\': \'新たな地平の識者\', \'text\': \'新たな地平の識者は＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つの上からカウンター１個を取り除く：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしているなら、あなたはそのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。それを戦場に出さないなら、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76995d25-e063-4e4e-a614-d2b575576f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 588481}, \'multiverseid\': 588481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gelehrter der Neuen Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Der Gelehrte der Neuen Horizonte kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte und zeige sie offen vor. Falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du die Karte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Falls du die Karte nicht ins Spiel bringst, nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5808664-b7e3-4a71-9045-97d4b2b858a6\', \'multiverseId\': 588568}, \'multiverseid\': 588568}, {\'name\': \'Érudit des nouveaux horizons\', \'text\': "L\'Érudit des nouveaux horizons arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine et révélez-la. Si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte sur le champ de bataille, mettez-la dans votre main. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31aeed5-1625-435d-91a2-85aee2e86723\', \'multiverseId\': 588584}, \'multiverseid\': 588584}, {\'name\': \'新たな地平の識者\', \'text\': \'新たな地平の識者は＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つの上からカウンター１個を取り除く：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしているなら、あなたはそのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。それを戦場に出さないなら、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0573e6-786b-431b-b96f-09bbb0ee7e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 588600}, \'multiverseid\': 588600}, {\'name\': \'新天地学者\', \'text\': \'新天地学者进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}，从由你操控的永久物上移去一个指示物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌并展示之。如果某对手操控的地比你多，则你可以将该牌横置放进战场。如果你未将该牌放进战场，则将它置于你手上。然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52671cb-4cf4-471f-bd65-bad9b4059169\', \'multiverseId\': 588616}, \'multiverseid\': 588616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geth, Fürst der Gruft\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\\n{X}{B}: Bringe eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners unter deiner Kontrolle getappt ins Spiel. Dann millt der Spieler X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ca7002-f448-459c-9275-67a621bd8f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 588862}, \'multiverseid\': 588862}, {\'name\': \'Geth, Señor de la Bóveda\', \'text\': \'Intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\\n{X}{B}: Pon en el campo de batalla girada bajo tu control la carta de artefacto o de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X del cementerio de un oponente. Luego, ese jugador muele X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Zombie pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05ded42-d386-42fc-9265-250d42501fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 589006}, \'multiverseid\': 589006}, {\'name\': \'Geth, seigneur du Caveau\', \'text\': "Intimidation (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\\n{X}{B} : Mettez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle et engagée, une carte d\'artefact ou de créature avec une valeur de mana de X ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire. Ce joueur meule ensuite X cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : phyrexian et zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77966288-e853-471e-a1ed-0e6f3545e3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 589150}, \'multiverseid\': 589150}, {\'name\': \'Geth, Signore della Cripta\', \'text\': \'Intimidire (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\\n{X}{B}: Metti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo TAPpata una carta creatura o artefatto bersaglio con valore di mana pari a X dal cimitero di un avversario. Poi, quel giocatore macina X carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Zombie Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583f2180-9b4c-4f15-bdca-1cc95cffd919\', \'multiverseId\': 589294}, \'multiverseid\': 589294}, {\'name\': \'大霊堂の王、ゲス\', \'text\': \'威嚇（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクト・クリーチャーやこれと共通の色を持つクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n{X}{B}：対戦相手の墓地にありマナ総量がＸでありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c1e530-16fb-45d7-ad95-1bb87cf7bf65\', \'multiverseId\': 589438}, \'multiverseid\': 589438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geätzter Champion\', \'text\': \'Metallkunst — Der Geätzte Champion hat Schutz vor allen Farben, solange du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'In seine Vorgänger war die Weisheit der Uralten eingeätzt, auf ihm sind Warnungen vor einer Zukunft voll mit Kriegen zu lesen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'280b30cd-87b6-486a-891f-fc12b75b0e68\', \'multiverseId\': 588895}, \'multiverseid\': 588895}, {\'name\': \'Campeón grabado\', \'text\': \'Metalurgia — El Campeón grabado tiene protección contra todos los colores mientras controles tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Sus predecesores fueron grabados con la sabiduría de los antiguos; sus propios grabados llevan las advertencias sobre un futuro asolado por la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bee0a46-0c03-416a-b4d0-7f9954de42db\', \'multiverseId\': 589039}, \'multiverseid\': 589039}, {\'name\': \'Champion gravé\', \'text\': \'Art des métaux — Le Champion gravé a la protection contre toutes les couleurs tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : soldat\', \'flavor\': "Ses prédécesseurs étaient gravés de la sagesse des anciens ; ses propres gravures parlent d\'avertissements d\'un avenir troublé par la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'731083f2-be56-4938-8dbd-e8b4c66fd60c\', \'multiverseId\': 589183}, \'multiverseid\': 589183}, {\'name\': \'Campione Inciso\', \'text\': \'Metallurgia — Il Campione Inciso ha protezione da tutti i colori fintanto che controlli tre o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Soldato\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi predecessori erano incisi con la saggezza degli anziani; le sue incisioni mostrano avvisaglie di un futuro pieno di guerre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d76b3bd0-9d25-44ee-a279-4100904136b2\', \'multiverseId\': 589327}, \'multiverseid\': 589327}, {\'name\': \'刻まれた勇者\', \'text\': \'金属術 ― あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、刻まれた勇者はプロテクション（すべての色）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 兵士\', \'flavor\': \'その前身には古代の知恵が刻まれていたが、自身には戦争に悩む未来への警告が刻まれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0ec929-7899-4776-9fc9-c1ce00e200ef\', \'multiverseId\': 589471}, \'multiverseid\': 589471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldschlammbrücke\', \'text\': \'Die Goldschlammbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUnzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Weg zum Ruhm wird im Ehrgeiz geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef3763aa-8500-4fc3-9aff-89a299f95bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 588941}, \'multiverseid\': 588941}, {\'name\': \'Puente cenagaldorado\', \'text\': \'El Puente cenagaldorado entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nIndestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El camino a la gloria se forja con ambición.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'386afce3-9b04-4322-b2e4-9b355cd2f06b\', \'multiverseId\': 589085}, \'multiverseid\': 589085}, {\'name\': "Pont d\'Ormarais", \'text\': "Le Pont d\'Ormarais arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nIndestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le chemin de la gloire est forgé dans l\'ambition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5860fadf-e4b5-483b-b5ea-b4f597dac3de\', \'multiverseId\': 589229}, \'multiverseid\': 589229}, {\'name\': \'Ponte di Paludoro\', \'text\': \'Il Ponte di Paludoro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIndistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il cammino verso la gloria è forgiato nell\'ambizione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86d9a47-2c6a-433d-86e9-dd1a027d1a58\', \'multiverseId\': 589373}, \'multiverseid\': 589373}, {\'name\': \'黄金沼の橋\', \'text\': \'黄金沼の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n破壊不能\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'栄光へと至る道は野心によって築かれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f89bb3-b126-4372-86c5-335aa8731f57\', \'multiverseId\': 589517}, \'multiverseid\': 589517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Große Schmelze\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Geschmolzenes Blut fließt durch die Ruinen der Schmiedenstadt Phoenon, ein immer noch schlagendes Herz in einem Körper, der schon vor Jahrhunderten verrottet ist."\\n—*Untergang der Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67fa6f4-e93d-4597-9daf-7bc5ed8c57aa\', \'multiverseId\': 588942}, \'multiverseid\': 588942}, {\'name\': \'Gran horno\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La sangre fundida corre por las ruinas de la ciudad forjadora de Fenon, un corazón latiente cuyo cuerpo se pudrió hace siglos".\\n—*Caída de los thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33eca30f-b79e-4c0c-8df4-877addc5b058\', \'multiverseId\': 589086}, \'multiverseid\': 589086}, {\'name\': \'Grand Fourneau\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Du sang en fusion s\'écoule dans les ruines de la ville-forge de Phoënon, un cœur qui bat toujours dans un corps décomposé depuis des siècles. »\\n—*Chute de l\'empire thran*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58feb4df-84b9-4421-9c07-c5ded129b17e\', \'multiverseId\': 589230}, \'multiverseid\': 589230}, {\'name\': \'Grande Fornace\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sangue fuso scorre tra le rovine della città forgia di Phoenon, il cuore ancora pulsante di un corpo da secoli putrefatto."\\n—*Caduta dei Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6505d2a9-ec52-4110-b80f-cdccb7b016e7\', \'multiverseId\': 589374}, \'multiverseid\': 589374}, {\'name\': \'大焼炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'「フェノンの鍛冶屋街跡には未だに溶岩が流れている。数世紀前に朽ちた身体の、脈打ち続ける心臓なのである。」\\n――*スランの崩落*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6ef99d-f95a-4f4a-a74b-f9cbc4e61735\', \'multiverseId\': 589518}, \'multiverseid\': 589518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruft des Geflüsters\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Koilos, die Gefängnisstadt der Thran, gebaut, um ihre Ausgestoßenen und Abtrünnigen zu beherrbergen. Hier schwelte der Einfluss Phyrexias als Erstes."\\n—*Untergang der Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b84e4e9-a8fb-4ad8-8ad7-205f334dd063\', \'multiverseId\': 588966}, \'multiverseid\': 588966}, {\'name\': \'Bóveda de los susurros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Koilos, la ciudad carcelaria de los thran, se construyó para albergar a los parias y disidentes. Allí fue donde empezó a enconarse la influencia de Pirexia".\\n—*Caída de los thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cbd012-a4fe-4cc8-8cc5-82a8f9cb5cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 589110}, \'multiverseid\': 589110}, {\'name\': \'Caveau des chuchotements\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Koïlos, la cité-prison des Thrans, fut construite pour les parias et les dissidents. C\'est ici que l\'influence de Phyrexia s\'est d\'abord manifestée. »\\n—*Chute de l\'empire thran*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589254&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7716b023-d77c-44c6-8266-923a8a8c7930\', \'multiverseId\': 589254}, \'multiverseid\': 589254}, {\'name\': \'Volta dei Sussurri\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Koilos, la città prigione dei Thran, costruita per ospitarne i reietti e i dissidenti. Terreno fertile per le prime infestazioni di Phyrexia."\\n—*Caduta dei Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b29af884-7265-4df3-a8b2-75e460c86b64\', \'multiverseId\': 589398}, \'multiverseid\': 589398}, {\'name\': \'囁きの大霊堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'「スランの牢獄都市、コイロスはのけ者や造反者の居住地として作られた。ファイレクシアの影響力が広まったのも、ここからであった。」\\n――*スランの崩落*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e57b66f-47fd-4a47-bf4e-f29449e7084a\', \'multiverseId\': 589542}, \'multiverseid\': 589542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Handelsposten\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n{1}, {T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge einen 0/1 weißen Ziege-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ec08e1-1341-4f44-9194-fa486a5c574e\', \'multiverseId\': 588924}, \'multiverseid\': 588924}, {\'name\': \'Puesto comercial\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, descartar una carta: Ganas 4 vidas.\\n{1}, {T}, pagar 1 vida: Crea una ficha de criatura Cabra blanca 0/1.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670c8b65-3979-4f1f-8751-af50fb96814e\', \'multiverseId\': 589068}, \'multiverseid\': 589068}, {\'name\': \'Comptoir de commerce\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\n{1}, {T}, payez 1 point de vie : Créez un jeton de créature 0/1 blanche Chèvre.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589212&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6f9232-3200-49e0-9bee-024089dbe303\', \'multiverseId\': 589212}, \'multiverseid\': 589212}, {\'name\': \'Stazione Commerciale\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Guadagni 4 punti vita.\\n{1}, {T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Crea una pedina creatura Capra 0/1 bianca.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad6d9ea-697b-4f6d-8ee3-33d20df1ebf7\', \'multiverseId\': 589356}, \'multiverseid\': 589356}, {\'name\': \'交易所\', \'text\': \'{1},{T},カード１枚を捨てる：４点のライフを得る。\\n{1},{T},１点のライフを支払う：白の０/１のヤギ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1},{T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n{1},{T},アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43d8138-470b-401a-8bc3-54d0cd4b813e\', \'multiverseId\': 589500}, \'multiverseid\': 589500}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herold der Pein\', \'text\': \'Improvisieren (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nFliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\\n{1}{B}, opfere ein Artefakt: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7ee46c-a984-4cf2-93c0-b63db563f095\', \'multiverseId\': 588863}, \'multiverseid\': 588863}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo del padecimiento\', \'text\': \'Improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\\nVuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, cada oponente descarta una carta.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar un artefacto: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e087e3-2fbe-4ed6-adf8-40ae2eb3fba1\', \'multiverseId\': 589007}, \'multiverseid\': 589007}, {\'name\': "Héraut de l\'angoisse", \'text\': "Improvisation (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)\\nVol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez un artefact : Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f45ae93-c418-441c-a684-e06144eadfed\', \'multiverseId\': 589151}, \'multiverseid\': 589151}, {\'name\': "Araldo dell\'Angoscia", \'text\': "Improvvisare (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nVolare\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'995b98ae-58cc-4ced-ad15-33ef8c3ffe00\', \'multiverseId\': 589295}, \'multiverseid\': 589295}, {\'name\': \'艱苦の伝令\', \'text\': \'即席（あなたのアーティファクトが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは、{1}を支払う。）\\n飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\n{1}{B},アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecf0054-398a-43e8-a7cb-e789d2f48f65\', \'multiverseId\': 589439}, \'multiverseid\': 589439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexavus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Hexavus kommt mit sechs +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{1}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Hexavus: Lege eine Fliegend-Marke auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{1}, entferne eine Marke von einer anderen Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Hexavus.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd5d1762-4550-4716-b6fd-0c5727a92c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 588425}, \'multiverseid\': 588425}, {\'name\': \'Héxavo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Héxavo entra al campo de batalla con seis contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\n{1}, remover un contador +1/+1 del Héxavo: Pon un contador de volar sobre otra criatura objetivo.\\n{1}, remover un contador de otra criatura que controlas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Héxavo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6976944f-f641-40a7-843f-b336dbc92159\', \'multiverseId\': 588441}, \'multiverseid\': 588441}, {\'name\': \'Hexavus\', \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Hexavus arrive sur le champ de bataille avec six marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 de l\'Hexavus : Mettez un marqueur « vol » sur une autre créature ciblée.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur d\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hexavus.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71eed561-08c1-43b1-91f8-cdc2ce082851\', \'multiverseId\': 588457}, \'multiverseid\': 588457}, {\'name\': \'Hexavus\', \'text\': "Volare\\nL\'Hexavus entra nel campo di battaglia con sei segnalini +1/+1.\\n{1}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dall\'Hexavus: Metti un segnalino volare su un\'altra creatura bersaglio.\\n{1}, Rimuovi un segnalino da un\'altra creatura che controlli: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Hexavus.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e85831-bb11-425f-88f9-ea6e897ed45d\', \'multiverseId\': 588473}, \'multiverseid\': 588473}, {\'name\': \'ヘキサバス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nヘキサバスは＋１/＋１カウンター６個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, ヘキサバスの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に飛行カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}, あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：ヘキサバスの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4fa2d0e-4d1a-4dc7-8de2-18bad5822049\', \'multiverseId\': 588489}, \'multiverseid\': 588489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexavus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Hexavus kommt mit sechs +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{1}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Hexavus: Lege eine Fliegend-Marke auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{1}, entferne eine Marke von einer anderen Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Hexavus.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b48d951-3cea-4cbb-9b97-7708966b4cce\', \'multiverseId\': 588576}, \'multiverseid\': 588576}, {\'name\': \'Hexavus\', \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Hexavus arrive sur le champ de bataille avec six marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 de l\'Hexavus : Mettez un marqueur « vol » sur une autre créature ciblée.\\n{1}, retirez un marqueur d\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hexavus.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0411d67-1ca7-4193-8fb7-5bd3a9a632e6\', \'multiverseId\': 588592}, \'multiverseid\': 588592}, {\'name\': \'ヘキサバス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nヘキサバスは＋１/＋１カウンター６個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, ヘキサバスの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に飛行カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}, あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：ヘキサバスの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3a5e60-d809-4c53-a4d2-10c8d5756752\', \'multiverseId\': 588608}, \'multiverseid\': 588608}, {\'name\': \'六节兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n六节兽进战场时上面有六个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}，从六节兽上移去一个+1/+1指示物：在另一个目标生物上放置一个飞行指示物。\\n{1}，从另一个由你操控的生物上移去一个指示物：在六节兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea834a15-40c9-4657-be53-035eb8467b71\', \'multiverseId\': 588624}, \'multiverseid\': 588624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelswolken-Weite\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In großer Höhe bewegt sich die schwebende Stadt Otawara über Kamigawa. Nur wenige wissen, warum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d260167d-1bb0-4afb-a3e2-97443349648d\', \'multiverseId\': 588956}, \'multiverseid\': 588956}, {\'name\': \'Expansión Nubeceleste\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La ciudad flotante de Otawara, remota pero vigilante, se mueve por Kamigawa con un fin desconocido por muchos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4c0817-1501-4128-863b-e3d4091a9581\', \'multiverseId\': 589100}, \'multiverseid\': 589100}, {\'name\': \'Immensité de Cielcouvert\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Observant en permanence malgré son isolement, la ville aérienne d\'Otawara survole Kamigawa à des fins que peu comprennent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b280219a-23ce-4948-8629-c51b59704b26\', \'multiverseId\': 589244}, \'multiverseid\': 589244}, {\'name\': \'Distesa di Cielonube\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Remota ma sempre vigile, la città di Otawara vola sopra Kamigawa con un obiettivo conosciuto a pochi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71bae122-4256-4d28-8f32-1901fa553c53\', \'multiverseId\': 589388}, \'multiverseid\': 589388}, {\'name\': \'広漠なるスカイクラウド\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'遠方から常に覗いている天上都市大田原は、神河の上空を動き続けている。その目的を知る者はほとんど存在しない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7915db02-7b4e-42ab-bfd4-b1bdeddeb66c\', \'multiverseId\': 589532}, \'multiverseid\': 589532}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochofen-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Artefakt-Opfer (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch wirken, als ob er Aufblitzen hätte, indem du ein Artefakt opferst und die Manakosten-Differenz zum geopferten Artefakt bezahlst. Manakosten schließen die Farben mit ein.)\\nFliegend, Doppelschlag\\nKreaturen haben Doppelschlag, solange sie deine Gegner angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52c9064-de58-4fd3-a4bd-2bb5914fce43\', \'multiverseId\': 588423}, \'multiverseid\': 588423}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de fundición\', \'text\': \'Ofrenda de artefacto. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo como si tuviera la habilidad de destello si sacrificas un artefacto y pagas la diferencia entre el coste de maná de esta carta y el del artefacto sacrificado. El coste de maná incluye el color.)\\nVuela, daña dos veces.\\nLas criaturas que atacan a tus oponentes tienen la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e31f561-c397-4a6c-8def-bf7398795e80\', \'multiverseId\': 588439}, \'multiverseid\': 588439}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du fourneau\', \'text\': "Offrande d\'artefact (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort comme s\'il avait le flash en sacrifiant un artefact et en payant la différence de coût de mana entre cette carte et l\'artefact sacrifié. Le coût de mana inclut la couleur.)\\nVol, double initiative\\nLes créatures attaquant vos adversaires ont la double initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da891bf-49f4-4bb8-a5b9-b707a0c4019f\', \'multiverseId\': 588455}, \'multiverseid\': 588455}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale della Fornace Esplosiva\', \'text\': "Obolo dell\'artefatto (Puoi lanciare questa magia come se avesse lampo, sacrificando un artefatto e pagando la differenza del costo di mana tra questa magia e l\'artefatto sacrificato. Il costo di mana comprende i colori.)\\nVolare, doppio attacco\\nLe creature che attaccano i tuoi avversari hanno doppio attacco.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6adb0878-c532-4068-95a4-67127a5f37f5\', \'multiverseId\': 588471}, \'multiverseid\': 588471}, {\'name\': \'爆発炉のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'献身（アーティファクト）（あなたはこの呪文を、アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げ、これとその生け贄に捧げたアーティファクトのマナ・コストの差を支払うことで、瞬速を持つかのように唱えてもよい。マナ・コストは色を含む。）\\n飛行、二段攻撃\\n対戦相手を攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d102e9-4d7d-4333-ae76-a19b3c3e61dc\', \'multiverseId\': 588487}, \'multiverseid\': 588487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochofen-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Artefakt-Opfer\\nFliegend, Doppelschlag\\nKreaturen haben Doppelschlag, solange sie deine Gegner angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8799fa41-6e88-4760-844a-d01d054003d3\', \'multiverseId\': 588574}, \'multiverseid\': 588574}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du fourneau\', \'text\': "Offrande d\'artefact\\nVol, double initiative\\nLes créatures attaquant vos adversaires ont la double initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'555a3ce6-954e-4a8e-b56f-63ffddabc029\', \'multiverseId\': 588590}, \'multiverseid\': 588590}, {\'name\': \'爆発炉のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'献身（アーティファクト）\\n飛行、二段攻撃\\n対戦相手を攻撃しているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae517c1-2080-405b-baf7-2d75a4e066d8\', \'multiverseId\': 588606}, \'multiverseid\': 588606}, {\'name\': \'高炉残虐者\', \'text\': \'神器献祭\\n飞行，连击\\n正向你对手进行攻击的生物都具有连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e169b3b-2f2b-46fd-a35d-bc4f6dc62c76\', \'multiverseId\': 588622}, \'multiverseid\': 588622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei Schritte nach Norden führen dich in die ungewisse Zukunft, nach Süden in die unruhige Vergangenheit, nach Osten in den heutigen Tag und nach Westen in das große Durcheinander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bca001-9697-4416-a5fc-cd96f67016ed\', \'multiverseId\': 588965}, \'multiverseid\': 588965}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Haz dos pasos al norte hacia el futuro inestable, al sur hacia el pasado inquieto, al este hacia el presente o al oeste hacia lo desconocido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b02014-8489-43a9-a0fb-faec4fd85cba\', \'multiverseId\': 589109}, \'multiverseid\': 589109}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Faites deux pas au nord dans l\'avenir instable, au sud dans le passé agité, à l\'est dans le présent ou à l\'ouest dans le vaste inconnu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a04277-fb42-4688-bab2-afecd1aab8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 589253}, \'multiverseid\': 589253}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Fai due passi a nord nel futuro incerto, a sud nel passato inquieto, a est nel giorno attuale o a ovest nel grande ignoto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13c9c26-8b71-4689-a218-89fcac05e3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 589397}, \'multiverseid\': 589397}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T},広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'二歩北へ進めば不安定な未来、南へ進めば不穏な過去、東に進めば今日この日、西へ進めば偉大なる未知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24f086a6-b2e2-4e92-ac9c-bb33830ded10\', \'multiverseId\': 589541}, \'multiverseid\': 589541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Dampfwerk\', \'text\': \'Das Izzet-Dampfwerk kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Izzet-Dampfwerk ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a08738e7-44f3-4daa-9c9c-a8bc062243b5\', \'multiverseId\': 588943}, \'multiverseid\': 588943}, {\'name\': \'Calderas ízzet\', \'text\': \'Las Calderas ízzet entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Calderas ízzet entren al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dedb7f67-d82c-4867-9756-26c4d82c6716\', \'multiverseId\': 589087}, \'multiverseid\': 589087}, {\'name\': "Chaufferie d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26993a35-58dd-4d1b-bc97-b1caf8e35580\', \'multiverseId\': 589231}, \'multiverseid\': 589231}, {\'name\': \'Ebollitori Izzet\', \'text\': \'Gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d0ffb74-6c7d-4e4f-971e-979eed938967\', \'multiverseId\': 589375}, \'multiverseid\': 589375}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの煮沸場\', \'text\': \'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec18e93-7782-4540-9ba0-ca8bcd0ec6f4\', \'multiverseId\': 589519}, \'multiverseid\': 589519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jhoira, Kapitänin der Wetterlicht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen historischen Zauberspruch wirkst, ziehe eine Karte. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Als sie zum ersten Mal nach einem Jahrtausend das Steuer der *Wetterlicht* übernahm, wusste Jhoira, dass es richtig gewesen war, das Schiff wieder aufzubauen. Nun war alles möglich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4942e44a-d676-4c8b-a697-08f2a0df3a27\', \'multiverseId\': 588881}, \'multiverseid\': 588881}, {\'name\': \'Jhoira, capitana del Vientoligero\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo histórico, roba una carta. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando rozó el timón del Vientoligero por primera vez en un milenio, Jhoira supo que había estado en lo correcto al reconstruir el barco. ** Ahora todo era posible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3385e98b-f569-44bd-b2c5-a4160e30904a\', \'multiverseId\': 589025}, \'multiverseid\': 589025}, {\'name\': "Djoïra, capitaine de l\'Aquilon", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort historique, piochez une carte. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques.)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Alors qu\'elle prenait la barre de l\'*Aquilon* pour la première fois depuis un millénaire, Djoïra sut qu\'elle avait eu raison de restaurer le navire. Tout était désormais possible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8627d5d4-4356-4f1e-a471-6187ae2f4347\', \'multiverseId\': 589169}, \'multiverseid\': 589169}, {\'name\': \'Jhoira, Capitana della Cavalcavento\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia storica, pesca una carta. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Quando prese il timone della *Cavalcavento* per la prima volta dopo un millennio, Jhoira seppe che riparare la nave era stata la decisione giusta. Ora qualsiasi cosa era possibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37186274-b987-4650-b68e-900416596e67\', \'multiverseId\': 589313}, \'multiverseid\': 589313}, {\'name\': \'ウェザーライトの艦長、ジョイラ\', \'text\': \'あなたが歴史的な呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。（歴史的とは、アーティファクトや伝説や英雄譚のことである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'ジョイラが、過去数百年で初めて*ウェザーライト*の操舵輪に手を置いたとき、彼女には自分が艦の修復に適任だったとわかった。これで何でもできるのだ、と。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e1516b-fc9a-4798-ae49-05612d69c283\', \'multiverseId\': 589457}, \'multiverseid\': 589457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kapsel des Henkers\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, opfere die Kapsel des Henkers: Zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt immer einen kleinen Moment der Beklemmung, bevor die Kapsel mit der Nachricht geöffnet wird, da niemand das Urteil vorher kennt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0747fb-eead-4479-9755-edd2265bacf8\', \'multiverseId\': 588859}, \'multiverseid\': 588859}, {\'name\': \'Cápsula del verdugo\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, sacrificar la Cápsula del verdugo: Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Siempre hay un momento de duda antes de abrir una cápsula mensajera, por miedo al juicio que podría contener.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1947c6-437d-48da-98d4-68383bf28128\', \'multiverseId\': 589003}, \'multiverseid\': 589003}, {\'name\': "Capsule de l\'exécuteur", \'text\': "{1}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez la Capsule de l\'exécuteur : Détruisez une créature non-noire ciblée.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'ouverture d\'une capsule est toujours précédée d\'un instant de trépidation, de crainte du jugement qu\'elle pourrait contenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589147&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c44169-39b6-4093-8ed2-28b4e485b50f\', \'multiverseId\': 589147}, \'multiverseid\': 589147}, {\'name\': \'Capsula del Carnefice\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica la Capsula del Carnefice: Distruggi una creatura non nera bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "C\'è sempre un momento di trepidazione prima di aprire una capsula di messaggi, per timore del giudizio che potrebbe esservi all\'interno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a0310c-f7d6-4645-ab9a-0c40a196a6ae\', \'multiverseId\': 589291}, \'multiverseid\': 589291}, {\'name\': \'処刑人の薬包\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},{T},処刑人の薬包を生け贄に捧げる：黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'書簡を開封する前には、いつも恐ろしい瞬間がある。その中にあるかもしれない決定に対する恐怖だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca63ee16-cedb-4d3b-b90b-156cbb591d6a\', \'multiverseId\': 589435}, \'multiverseid\': 589435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Spieluhr\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an und schicke sie dann verdeckt ins Exil. (Du kannst sie dir jederzeit anschauen.)\\n{T}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die du besitzt und die von Kaylas Spieluhr ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Kayla fragte sich, ob Urza ihr mit der Reparatur der Spieluhr Zuneigung zeigen oder nur sein Geschick demonstrieren wollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588426&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3736bd02-acad-4460-971d-2216a0c8c42b\', \'multiverseId\': 588426}, \'multiverseid\': 588426}, {\'name\': \'Caja de música de Kayla\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego exíliala boca abajo. (Puedes mirarla en cualquier momento.)\\n{T}: Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar las cartas de las cuales eres propietario exiliadas con la Caja de música de Kayla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Kayla no sabía si Urza había reparado la caja de música para demostrarle su afecto o solo su habilidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d529763b-eac0-4df7-96c3-8b878f031fca\', \'multiverseId\': 588442}, \'multiverseid\': 588442}, {\'name\': \'Boîte à musique de Kayla\', \'text\': "{W}, {T} : Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis exilez-la face cachée. (Vous pouvez la regarder à tout moment.)\\n{T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer les cartes que vous possédez exilées par la Boîte à musique de Kayla.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Kayla se demanda si Urza avait réparé la boîte à musique en gage d\'affection, ou juste pour faire montre de son talent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b403a37-4421-454e-85d6-29b9cd5932c8\', \'multiverseId\': 588458}, \'multiverseid\': 588458}, {\'name\': \'Carillon di Kayla\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi esiliala a faccia in giù. (Puoi guardarla in qualsiasi momento.)\\n{T}: Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare le carte che possiedi esiliate con il Carillon di Kayla.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Kayla si chiedeva se Urza avesse riparato il carillon per dimostrare il suo affetto o la sua abilità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cbc69f5-6866-4ce9-b9a0-1caccafc196e\', \'multiverseId\': 588474}, \'multiverseid\': 588474}, {\'name\': \'カイラのオルゴール\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見、その後、裏向きに追放する。（あなたはいつでもそれを見てよい。）\\n{T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたはカイラのオルゴールによって追放されていてあなたがオーナーである各カードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザがオルゴールを直したのは好意の印なのか、あるいは腕前の披露にすぎないのか。カイラは図りかねていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e79c02-0290-4cb6-88b3-abc11c34d572\', \'multiverseId\': 588490}, \'multiverseid\': 588490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaylas Spieluhr\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an und schicke sie dann verdeckt ins Exil. (Du kannst sie dir jederzeit anschauen.)\\n{T}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du Karten spielen, die du besitzt und die von Kaylas Spieluhr ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bcab0f4-59f9-4105-aa76-4066a7e66c23\', \'multiverseId\': 588577}, \'multiverseid\': 588577}, {\'name\': \'Boîte à musique de Kayla\', \'text\': "{W}, {T} : Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis exilez-la face cachée. (Vous pouvez la regarder à tout moment.)\\n{T} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer les cartes que vous possédez exilées par la Boîte à musique de Kayla.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588593&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc9d1d9-d134-4ca5-a333-2a6001807d79\', \'multiverseId\': 588593}, \'multiverseid\': 588593}, {\'name\': \'カイラのオルゴール\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見、その後、裏向きに追放する。（あなたはいつでもそれを見てよい。）\\n{T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたはカイラのオルゴールによって追放されていてあなたがオーナーである各カードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764e3d04-b773-419d-a926-b08a6babc51a\', \'multiverseId\': 588609}, \'multiverseid\': 588609}, {\'name\': \'凯拉的音乐盒\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：检视你的牌库顶牌，然后将它牌面朝下地放逐。（你可以随时检视之。）\\n{T}：直到回合结束，你可以使用由你拥有且以凯拉的音乐盒放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983449e4-a798-48f0-991d-5235f4c419d8\', \'multiverseId\': 588625}, \'multiverseid\': 588625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klingenflutbrücke\', \'text\': \'Die Klingenflutbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUnzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Weg zur Einheit wird im Verständnis geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b88adc07-1424-45f1-ae78-7684ab324781\', \'multiverseId\': 588950}, \'multiverseid\': 588950}, {\'name\': \'Puente mareanavaja\', \'text\': \'El Puente mareanavaja entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nIndestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El camino a la unidad se forja con entendimiento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e76d2e3-8183-430c-803a-f25cf355b0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 589094}, \'multiverseid\': 589094}, {\'name\': \'Pont de Lamejusant\', \'text\': \'Le Pont de Lamejusant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nIndestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le chemin de l\'unité est forgé dans la compréhension.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dcb978c-8dca-48de-9dbe-33bc394d9dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 589238}, \'multiverseid\': 589238}, {\'name\': \'Ponte di Marelama\', \'text\': \'Il Ponte di Marelama entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIndistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il cammino verso l\'unità è forgiato nella comprensione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f26eed-cd65-4503-89bd-0e8942576a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 589382}, \'multiverseid\': 589382}, {\'name\': \'剃刀潮の橋\', \'text\': \'剃刀潮の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n破壊不能\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'連帯へと至る道は理解によって築かれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9042878e-8ace-4266-80c2-c96b716ab15c\', \'multiverseId\': 589526}, \'multiverseid\': 589526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lithoform-Maschine\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Kopiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\n{3}, {T}: Kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl, den bzw. die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\n{4}, {T}: Kopiere einen Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst. (Die Kopie wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e38514-96af-42e0-bd7e-4e8e7981cbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 588901}, \'multiverseid\': 588901}, {\'name\': \'Motor litoforme\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Copia la habilidad activada o disparada objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\n{3}, {T}: Copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\n{4}, {T}: Copia el hechizo de permanente objetivo que controlas. (La copia se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d63081d-b3fd-46c0-af0d-1c25cb2754b7\', \'multiverseId\': 589045}, \'multiverseid\': 589045}, {\'name\': \'Machine lithoforme\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Copiez une capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\n{3}, {T} : Copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\n{4}, {T} : Copiez un sort de permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez. (La copie devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49494b62-138a-48a9-b31d-74e661fdd9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 589189}, \'multiverseid\': 589189}, {\'name\': \'Ordigno Litomorfico\', \'text\': "{2}, {T}: Copia un\'abilità attivata o innescata bersaglio che controlli. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\n{3}, {T}: Copia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio che controlli. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\n{4}, {T}: Copia una magia permanente bersaglio che controlli. (La copia diventa una pedina.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5442fd-f79e-4615-9063-b418589acf2b\', \'multiverseId\': 589333}, \'multiverseid\': 589333}, {\'name\': \'石成エンジン\', \'text\': \'{2},{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて起動型や誘発型である能力１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n{3},{T}：あなたがコントロールしていてインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n{4},{T}：あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント・呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。（そのコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5ed1e2-c485-44eb-bfad-708da6cedc03\', \'multiverseId\': 589477}, \'multiverseid\': 589477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Losheel, Gelehrte der Mechanik\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der angreifenden Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elefant, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e263a93-bd53-4ec3-8505-8739362f5ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 588828}, \'multiverseid\': 588828}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, erudita mecánica\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer a las criaturas artefacto atacantes que controlas.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c5c2226-8805-47ba-b63a-adf34926e347\', \'multiverseId\': 588972}, \'multiverseid\': 588972}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, érudite en mécanique\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées aux créatures-artefacts attaquantes que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éléphant et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a42c45-81e4-4528-b5b2-f52d80a5f0d4\', \'multiverseId\': 589116}, \'multiverseid\': 589116}, {\'name\': \'Losheel, Studiosa di Meccanica\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto alle creature artefatto attaccanti che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Elefante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e9c90e-ab72-4e05-89b1-dd80607a2c43\', \'multiverseId\': 589260}, \'multiverseid\': 589260}, {\'name\': \'機械細工の学者、ロシール\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて攻撃しているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーが受けるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。\\n１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 象・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615b2d7b-83df-4414-a898-5ead2eb18513\', \'multiverseId\': 589404}, \'multiverseid\': 589404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60bbbf1e-6dd5-4607-b519-8137f9e97d87\', \'multiverseId\': 588945}, \'multiverseid\': 588945}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f9c79ed-fe18-4f46-96d4-a1127e218102\', \'multiverseId\': 589089}, \'multiverseid\': 589089}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d5e1e01-a456-467a-83ff-22b759906abe\', \'multiverseId\': 589233}, \'multiverseid\': 589233}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aea825e-1cbe-4242-89fb-90bd960935c4\', \'multiverseId\': 589377}, \'multiverseid\': 589377}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を共通の土地タイプを持つように選んで探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b50cec-7b23-4d74-b1ac-3fbfa388d634\', \'multiverseId\': 589521}, \'multiverseid\': 589521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marsch des Fortschritts\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde, einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist.\\nÜberlast {6}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, verändere seinen Text, indem du alle Vorkommen von „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …" ersetzt.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588419&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e705bb17-3caa-4430-ab3c-852e5c7ecc01\', \'multiverseId\': 588419}, \'multiverseid\': 588419}, {\'name\': \'Marcha del progreso\', \'text\': \'Elige la criatura artefacto objetivo que controlas. Por cada criatura elegida de esta manera, crea una ficha que es una copia de ella.\\nSobrecarga {6}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia su texto reemplazando "la criatura artefacto objetivo" por "cada criatura artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1fef037-d556-473a-818c-1681a74d79ac\', \'multiverseId\': 588435}, \'multiverseid\': 588435}, {\'name\': \'Marche du progrès\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez. Pour chaque créature choisie de cette manière, créez un jeton qui en est une copie.\\nSurcharge {6}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, modifiez son texte en remplaçant toutes les occurrences de « cible/ciblé(e) » par « chaque ».)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d753712-321e-4c34-bddf-6a7a2ba82b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 588451}, \'multiverseid\': 588451}, {\'name\': \'Marcia del Progresso\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Per ogni creatura scelta in questo modo, crea una pedina che è una copia di quel permanente.\\nSovraccarico {6}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "una creatura artefatto bersaglio" con "ogni creatura artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3c5bad-4b69-4c21-b337-9df2c8f071ab\', \'multiverseId\': 588467}, \'multiverseid\': 588467}, {\'name\': \'発展の行進\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。これにより選ばれたクリーチャー１体につき、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n超過{6}{U}（あなたはこの呪文をこれの超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、あなたがコントロールしている各アーティファクト・クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5940367-294a-41ab-9b14-94d71d36c3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 588483}, \'multiverseid\': 588483}]', "[{'name': 'Marsch des Fortschritts', 'text': 'Bestimme eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Erzeuge für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde, einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist.\\nÜberlast {6}{U}', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588570&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9a31f11-6c37-4d60-b9df-8b53da59a9a1', 'multiverseId': 588570}, 'multiverseid': 588570}, {'name': 'Marche du progrès', 'text': 'Choisissez une créature-artefact ciblée que vous contrôlez. Pour chaque créature choisie de cette manière, créez un jeton qui en est une copie.\\nSurcharge {6}{U}', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588586&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bfb4427-3182-4d1c-8086-7d0eec21522f', 'multiverseId': 588586}, 'multiverseid': 588586}, {'name': '発展の行進', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。これにより選ばれたクリーチャー１体につき、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n超過{6}{U}', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588602&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cae2170-e4d5-40e5-a74d-e26d0aa8bfd4', 'multiverseId': 588602}, 'multiverseid': 588602}, {'name': '进展行进', 'text': '选择目标由你操控的神器生物。对每个以此法选中的生物而言，派出一个为其复制品的衍生物。\\n超载{6}{U}', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a38feaa-4d02-4743-9ab3-9f00de983ab9', 'multiverseId': 588618}, 'multiverseid': 588618}]", '[{\'name\': \'Martern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist leicht, sich im Spektakel zu verlieren und ein paar dreiste Scherze zu genießen. Aber vergiss nie, dass der Rakdos-Kult gefährlich ist."\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c762a8-220e-47dd-9199-9448157140d1\', \'multiverseId\': 588876}, \'multiverseid\': 588876}, {\'name\': \'Atormentar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto, criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es fácil dejarse llevar por el espectáculo y disfrutar de un poco de diversión culpable. Pero no te confundas: el Culto a Rakdos es un peligro".\\n—Tájic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94102e43-89ab-4df2-a530-9d3b6e0fc792\', \'multiverseId\': 589020}, \'multiverseid\': 589020}, {\'name\': \'Affres\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact, créature ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« On se laisse facilement emporter par le spectacle, profitant de quelques plaisirs coupables. Mais ne vous y trompez pas : le Culte de Rakdos est dangereux. »\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af98e876-99cb-4c2d-b03d-ed5ff9bd6846\', \'multiverseId\': 589164}, \'multiverseid\': 589164}, {\'name\': \'Tormento Diabolico\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto, una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È facile lasciarsi affascinare dallo spettacolo e gustarsi un po\\\' di crudele divertimento. Non fatevi ingannare, però: il Culto di Rakdos è una minaccia."\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e92b36e-c081-4862-9edf-e3a3e704d913\', \'multiverseId\': 589308}, \'multiverseid\': 589308}, {\'name\': \'魔性\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「絢爛に惑わされて、多少の汚らわしい娯楽を楽しみがちだ。しかし間違いない、ラクドス教団は危険だ。」\\n――タージク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a8ddf2c-453b-45e8-9784-a11cd32aa89e\', \'multiverseId\': 589452}, \'multiverseid\': 589452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister der Umwandler\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}, bringe ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück: Du kannst eine Artefaktkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Uns umgeben vergeudete Möglichkeiten. Gib mir doch mal diesen Tinnef und lass mich schauen, was wir daraus noch machen können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea9af28-8bf1-45fd-abc9-7f1e783c1c74\', \'multiverseId\': 588842}, \'multiverseid\': 588842}, {\'name\': \'Maestra transmutadora\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}, regresar un artefacto que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de artefacto de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nos rodea potencial desperdiciado. Dame esa baratija y déjame ver qué se puede hacer con ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ed8981-7147-4e1b-b29f-9606cb979708\', \'multiverseId\': 588986}, \'multiverseid\': 588986}, {\'name\': \'Maîtresse transmutatrice\', \'text\': "{U}, {T}, renvoyez un artefact que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire : Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Tant de potentiel gaspillé nous entoure. Donnez-moi cette babiole que je voie ce qu\'il est possible d\'en faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b85764f-9e34-4d7e-9712-3550b62686f4\', \'multiverseId\': 589130}, \'multiverseid\': 589130}, {\'name\': \'Maestra Trasmutatrice\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}, Fai tornare un artefatto che controlli in mano al suo proprietario: Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo circondati da potenziale sprecato. Prestami quel gingillo, e fammi vedere cosa potrei farlo diventare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d7acb7d-210f-4191-878b-824e96fd1dea\', \'multiverseId\': 589274}, \'multiverseid\': 589274}, {\'name\': \'練達の変成者\', \'text\': \'{U},{T},あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つをオーナーの手札に戻す：あなたは、あなたの手札にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「無駄になった潜在的な力が我々の周りにはある。その欠片を私に貸せば、それがいかようになるべきであったかを見せてやろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee71a1c-e113-4a12-8fbf-e9df27731002\', \'multiverseId\': 589418}, \'multiverseid\': 589418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meister des Ätheriums\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Meisters des Ätheriums sind gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\\nAndere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur ein Verstand, der nicht von den Sorgen eines Körpers belastet wird, kann die Welt so sehen, wie sie wirklich ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208ecf4b-25d3-4892-9371-d712d5cd2b83\', \'multiverseId\': 588841}, \'multiverseid\': 588841}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de eterium\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Maestro de eterium son iguales a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\\nLas otras criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo una mente no contaminada con las preocupaciones de la carne puede ver el mundo como realmente es".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ced851d-fbf9-4acd-8df6-3f8be48a3408\', \'multiverseId\': 588985}, \'multiverseid\': 588985}, {\'name\': "Maître de l\'étherium", \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Maître de l\'étherium sont chacune égales au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\nLes autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : vedalken et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Seul l\'esprit qui se moque des exigences de la chair peut voir le monde tel qu\'il est véritablement. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9ddcd9-a63c-4430-8fec-0e0fe451fa69\', \'multiverseId\': 589129}, \'multiverseid\': 589129}, {\'name\': \'Maestro di Eterium\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione del Maestro di Eterium sono pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\\nLe altre creature artefatto che controlli prendono +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo una mente libera dalle preoccupazioni della carne può vedere il mondo com\\\'è realmente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69a5ab6-d24f-4976-8eb3-23b3f713a552\', \'multiverseId\': 589273}, \'multiverseid\': 589273}, {\'name\': \'エーテリウムの達人\', \'text\': \'エーテリウムの達人のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「肉体の懸念から解き放たれた精神のみが、真の世界を見ることができる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b69fbb3-6bfd-447d-87a0-5ec88d43e327\', \'multiverseId\': 589417}, \'multiverseid\': 589417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meisterin der Marionetten\', \'text\': \'Fabrizieren 3 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie oder erzeuge drei 1/1 farblose Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.)\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der Meisterin der Marionetten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7350a8e3-21b2-4dac-89a9-59ac6b0713b1\', \'multiverseId\': 588864}, \'multiverseid\': 588864}, {\'name\': \'Maestra titiritera\', \'text\': \'Fabricar 3. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella o crea tres fichas de criatura artefacto Servo incoloras 1/1.)\\nSiempre que un artefacto que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la fuerza de la Maestra titiritera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832f005c-68de-4ae0-8e42-844609b117f4\', \'multiverseId\': 589008}, \'multiverseid\': 589008}, {\'name\': \'Maîtresse des marionnettes\', \'text\': "Fabrication 3 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle ou créez trois jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal à la force de la Maîtresse des marionnettes.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4fd18f9-d85f-4f72-992d-0e645677a7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 589152}, \'multiverseid\': 589152}, {\'name\': \'Maestra Burattinaia\', \'text\': \'Fabbrica 3 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa o crea tre pedine creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolori.)\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde punti vita pari alla forza della Maestra Burattinaia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5206f038-a749-4736-8bed-34a8287fe9ac\', \'multiverseId\': 589296}, \'multiverseid\': 589296}, {\'name\': \'マリオネットの達人\', \'text\': \'製造３（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはマリオネットの達人のパワーに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0fce2fd-24b2-4b8b-87a4-7e9f51ee4258\', \'multiverseId\': 589440}, \'multiverseid\': 589440}]', "[{'name': 'Metallener Koloss', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich dem Gesamt-Manabetrag aller Nichtkreatur-Artefakte ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nOpfere zwei Artefakte: Bringe den Metallenen Koloss aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588902&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76586954-cf6c-4885-aafb-e767e32297f9', 'multiverseId': 588902}, 'multiverseid': 588902}, {'name': 'Coloso metalúrgico', 'text': 'Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar este hechizo, donde X es el valor de maná total de los artefactos que no sean criatura que controlas.\\nSacrificar dos artefactos: Regresa el Coloso metalúrgico de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589046&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d7052b3-8394-4e3c-9adc-30a4e2a2f23f', 'multiverseId': 589046}, 'multiverseid': 589046}, {'name': 'Colosse de métallurgie', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant la valeur de mana totale des artefacts non-créature que vous contrôlez.\\nSacrifiez deux artefacts : Renvoyez dans votre main le Colosse de métallurgie depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589190&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5a7b196-d4a2-40fe-ad88-7ee8bc45c923', 'multiverseId': 589190}, 'multiverseid': 589190}, {'name': 'Colosso di Metallo Lavorato', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {X} in meno per essere lanciata, dove X è il valore di mana totale degli artefatti non creatura che controlli.\\nSacrifica due artefatti: Riprendi in mano il Colosso di Metallo Lavorato dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589334&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37879c12-d51c-42c6-a82a-c9252572ce5c', 'multiverseId': 589334}, 'multiverseid': 589334}, {'name': '金属製の巨像', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないすべてのアーティファクトのマナ総量の合計に等しい。\\nアーティファクト２つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にある金属製の巨像をあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589478&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b920c3c-e035-4647-9294-9225a195e99e', 'multiverseId': 589478}, 'multiverseid': 589478}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mishra der Herausragende\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Nichtkreatur-Artefakts deiner Wahl ist, das du kontrollierst, außer dass sein Name Mishras Kriegsautomat ist und er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 4/4 Konstrukt-Artefaktkreatur ist. Er erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08a5950d-ae9e-4848-a1b7-311357bc1472\', \'multiverseId\': 588358}, \'multiverseid\': 588358}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, el Ilustre\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura que controlas, excepto que su nombre es Guerriforme de Mishra y es una criatura artefacto Constructo 4/4 además de sus otros tipos. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d17bad-57b8-4a74-bfe5-f5785910318a\', \'multiverseId\': 588360}, \'multiverseid\': 588360}, {\'name\': "Mishra, l\'éminent", \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez, excepté que son nom est Formeguerre de Mishra et que c\'est une créature-artefact 4/4 Construction en plus de ses autres types. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a404b49f-0d51-4156-aa90-e4172c485551\', \'multiverseId\': 588362}, \'multiverseid\': 588362}, {\'name\': "Mishra l\'Eminente", \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto non creatura bersaglio che controlli, tranne che il suo nome è Bellico di Mishra ed è una creatura artefatto Costrutto 4/4 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4f23ed-bd0f-46a9-ace6-f04fddcf5235\', \'multiverseId\': 588364}, \'multiverseid\': 588364}, {\'name\': \'高名な者、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。「ミシュラの戦機」という名前で４/４で他のタイプに加えて構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャーであることを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcc2d39-6161-4229-b40a-b12e500b1f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 588366}, \'multiverseid\': 588366}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, O Eminente\', \'text\': \'No início do combate no seu turno, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do artefato não criatura alvo que você controla, exceto por seu nome ser Guerriforme de Mishra e ela ser uma criatura artefato Constructo 4/4 além de seus outros tipos. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. Sacrifique-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a954e39-eb79-4909-9cdb-198e6d16f80f\', \'multiverseId\': 588370}, \'multiverseid\': 588370}, {\'name\': \'显赫械师米斯拉\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个衍生物，其为目标由你操控之非生物神器的复制品，但名称是米斯拉的战形械，为4/4组构体神器生物，且仍具有原本类别。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e918a0-2754-4f85-b505-7b195ee0d9f3\', \'multiverseId\': 588374}, \'multiverseid\': 588374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishra der Herausragende\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Nichtkreatur-Artefakts deiner Wahl ist, das du kontrollierst, außer dass sein Name Mishras Kriegsautomat ist und er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 4/4 Konstrukt-Artefaktkreatur ist. Er erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04eafbcd-e711-4607-a41d-b5263f2aff4a\', \'multiverseId\': 588514}, \'multiverseid\': 588514}, {\'name\': "Mishra, l\'éminent", \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez, excepté que son nom est Formeguerre de Mishra et que c\'est une créature-artefact 4/4 Construction en plus de ses autres types. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834f7278-b857-4e98-8d41-eb1e23227ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 588525}, \'multiverseid\': 588525}, {\'name\': \'高名な者、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。「ミシュラの戦機」という名前で４/４で他のタイプに加えて構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャーであることを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc0733c-90c9-46d3-8e2d-60f92110f38a\', \'multiverseId\': 588536}, \'multiverseid\': 588536}, {\'name\': \'显赫械师米斯拉\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个衍生物，其为目标由你操控之非生物神器的复制品，但名称是米斯拉的战形械，为4/4组构体神器生物，且仍具有原本类别。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f308884-e28d-429e-a8dd-fb1ba8ec9aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 588547}, \'multiverseid\': 588547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishra der Herausragende\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Nichtkreatur-Artefakts deiner Wahl ist, das du kontrollierst, außer dass sein Name Mishras Kriegsautomat ist und er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine 4/4 Konstrukt-Artefaktkreatur ist. Er erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'125b2265-bd4d-4c3d-b77a-95b4ad28055d\', \'multiverseId\': 589545}, \'multiverseid\': 589545}, {\'name\': \'Mishra, el Ilustre\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura que controlas, excepto que su nombre es Guerriforme de Mishra y es una criatura artefacto Constructo 4/4 además de sus otros tipos. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf00006a-e30d-4f37-a021-a5bd7dba5789\', \'multiverseId\': 589547}, \'multiverseid\': 589547}, {\'name\': "Mishra, l\'éminent", \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez, excepté que son nom est Formeguerre de Mishra et que c\'est une créature-artefact 4/4 Construction en plus de ses autres types. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44577841-1a93-40ca-98d1-dd9e0a3ecc7c\', \'multiverseId\': 589549}, \'multiverseid\': 589549}, {\'name\': "Mishra l\'Eminente", \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina che è una copia di un artefatto non creatura bersaglio che controlli, tranne che il suo nome è Bellico di Mishra ed è una creatura artefatto Costrutto 4/4 in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b67c125-a1fb-4295-a658-803d503ef2a6\', \'multiverseId\': 589551}, \'multiverseid\': 589551}, {\'name\': \'高名な者、ミシュラ\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。「ミシュラの戦機」という名前で４/４で他のタイプに加えて構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャーであることを除き、それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f3a9e7-b1c8-479c-b18f-1fc17683ed17\', \'multiverseId\': 589553}, \'multiverseid\': 589553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mnemonische Sphäre\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, opfere die Mnemonische Sphäre: Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nBlutzoll — {U}, wirf die Mnemonische Sphäre ab: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollen die kaiserlichen Truppen unsere Labore durchsuchen. Ob sie auf die Idee kommen, in einer hübschen Kugel nach Geheimnissen zu suchen?"\\n—Emire, Direktor der Saiba-Futuristen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff31e801-67dd-4a93-8d1e-b5d255b47933\', \'multiverseId\': 588843}, \'multiverseid\': 588843}, {\'name\': \'Esfera mnemónica\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, sacrificar la Esfera mnemónica: Roba dos cartas.\\nCanalizar — {U}, descartar la Esfera mnemónica: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Dejen que los imperiales inspeccionen los laboratorios. Dudo que busquen secretos en una baratija bonita".\\n—Emire, director de los futuristas de Saiba\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d076072e-7c1d-4eda-a6be-32a7e366ed39\', \'multiverseId\': 588987}, \'multiverseid\': 588987}, {\'name\': \'Sphère mnémonique\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, sacrifiez la Sphère mnémonique : Piochez deux cartes.\\nTransfert — {U}, défaussez-vous de la Sphère mnémonique : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Laissez donc les Impériaux fouiller nos laboratoires. Jamais ils ne penseront à chercher des secrets dans une petite babiole. »\\n—Emire, directeur des Futuristes Saiba\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34dc021a-b7d5-480a-8336-da140c4b289d\', \'multiverseId\': 589131}, \'multiverseid\': 589131}, {\'name\': \'Sfera Mnemonica\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}, Sacrifica la Sfera Mnemonica: Pesca due carte.\\nIncanalare — {U}, Scarta la Sfera Mnemonica: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciate che gli Imperiali ispezionino i nostri laboratori. Non penseranno mai di cercare i nostri segreti in un grazioso soprammobile."\\n—Emire, direttore dei Futuristi Saiba\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bdd575a-5769-4179-b502-f8685538f30d\', \'multiverseId\': 589275}, \'multiverseid\': 589275}, {\'name\': \'記憶の宝球\', \'text\': \'{1}{U},記憶の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。\\n魂力 — {U},記憶の宝球を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「皇国兵に研究所を捜索させるがよい。綺麗な玉飾りに秘密が隠されているとは思わぬだろう？」\\n――サイバ未来派の指揮者、エミレイ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85232e09-6084-4b3f-9b91-be48b865658a\', \'multiverseId\': 589419}, \'multiverseid\': 589419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Muzzio, Visionärer Architekt\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}: Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter den Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst. Du kannst davon eine Artefaktkarte ins Spiel bringen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a731e9bc-728f-4d97-936b-0f765dc5600b\', \'multiverseId\': 588844}, \'multiverseid\': 588844}, {\'name\': \'Muzzio, arquitecto visionario\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}: Mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es el mayor valor de maná entre los artefactos que controlas. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de artefacto de entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcf32be7-1f72-4ad6-aa9c-122624653c46\', \'multiverseId\': 588988}, \'multiverseid\': 588988}, {\'name\': \'Muzzio, architecte visionnaire\', \'text\': "{3}{U}, {T} : Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi les artefacts que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589132&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'590279c1-ac60-4ff3-a577-38979ced7d01\', \'multiverseId\': 589132}, \'multiverseid\': 589132}, {\'name\': \'Muzzio, Architetto Visionario\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}, {T}: Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il valore di mana maggiore tra gli artefatti che controlli. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto scelta tra esse. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b1838b-298d-4f36-92ef-9ebddfa4232b\', \'multiverseId\': 589276}, \'multiverseid\': 589276}, {\'name\': \'先見的設計家、ムッツィオ\', \'text\': \'{3}{U},{T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を見る。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しい。あなたはその中からアーティファクト・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d94762cb-ea36-4658-a3ae-25a578e22f91\', \'multiverseId\': 589420}, \'multiverseid\': 589420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mycosynth-Urquell\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Mycosynth-Urquell ins Spiel kommt oder aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Öl erzeugte das Mycosynth. Das Mycosynth erzeugte das Neue Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d2fc2f2-b36b-4eae-870c-efe57d27de91\', \'multiverseId\': 588905}, \'multiverseid\': 588905}, {\'name\': \'Manantial de micosintético\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Manantial de micosintético entre al campo de batalla o vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El aceite creó el micosintético. El micosintético creó Nueva Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bc4895-0572-4a12-a092-da7965371f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 589049}, \'multiverseid\': 589049}, {\'name\': \'Source de mycosynthèse\', \'text\': \'Quand la Source de mycosynthèse arrive sur le champ de bataille ou est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Le pétrole créa la mycosynthèse. La mycosynthèse créa la Nouvelle Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afec3a71-f453-4f1c-aad2-0c93f8a93c5d\', \'multiverseId\': 589193}, \'multiverseid\': 589193}, {\'name\': \'Sorgente di Micosinti\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sorgente di Micosinti entra nel campo di battaglia o viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'olio creò i micosinti. I micosinti crearono la Nuova Phyrexia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1323bd3-cb26-4460-a85c-208a8d5d4172\', \'multiverseId\': 589337}, \'multiverseid\': 589337}, {\'name\': \'マイコシンスの水源\', \'text\': \'マイコシンスの水源が戦場に出たか戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'油はマイコシンスを生み出した。マイコシンスは新ファイレクシアを生み出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbab80be-60fa-441a-b394-dd0020b495bb\', \'multiverseId\': 589481}, \'multiverseid\': 589481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Myr-Kampfkugel\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 farblose Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn die Myr-Kampfkugel angreift, kannst du X ungetappte Myr, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Myr-Kampfkugel +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges und fügt dem Spieler oder Planeswalker, den sie angreift, X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Myr, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080c2fde-1ccc-4aec-82dd-8ecfbc44a709\', \'multiverseId\': 588906}, \'multiverseid\': 588906}, {\'name\': \'Esfera de batalla myr\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esfera de batalla myr entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura artefacto Myr incoloras 1/1.\\nSiempre que la Esfera de batalla myr ataque, puedes girar X Myr enderezados que controlas. Si lo haces, la Esfera de batalla myr obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno y hace X puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker al que está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc1eb9e-b277-4369-8e0b-d72bb7185dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 589050}, \'multiverseid\': 589050}, {\'name\': \'Sphère de bataille myr\', \'text\': "Quand la Sphère de bataille myr arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Sphère de bataille myr attaque, vous pouvez engager X myrs dégagés que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, la Sphère de bataille myr gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour et inflige X blessures au joueur ou planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : myr et construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc9e8ed6-eed0-4879-a70d-f67a09f762ef\', \'multiverseId\': 589194}, \'multiverseid\': 589194}, {\'name\': \'Sfera da Battaglia Myr\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sfera da Battaglia Myr entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfera da Battaglia Myr attacca, puoi TAPpare X Myr STAPpati che controlli. Se lo fai, la Sfera da Battaglia Myr prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno e infligge X danni al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto Myr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5ce115-bb52-4e28-bd04-07f2add97b01\', \'multiverseId\': 589338}, \'multiverseid\': 589338}, {\'name\': \'マイアの戦闘球\', \'text\': \'マイアの戦闘球が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\\nマイアの戦闘球が攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるマイアＸ体をタップしてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、マイアの戦闘球は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受け、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア・構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36457225-05a4-4f5b-9b6c-1a355cf7d209\', \'multiverseId\': 589482}, \'multiverseid\': 589482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mysteriöses Sanktum\', \'text\': \'Das Mysteriöse Sanktum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir müssen uns auf unser eigenes Wissen verlassen, nicht auf das Dogma der Suchenden oder das Gemurmel der Sphingen."\\n—Tullus von Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16f8fed2-4e46-457b-942b-06a7b5b06bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 588928}, \'multiverseid\': 588928}, {\'name\': \'Santuario arcano\', \'text\': \'El Santuario arcano entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos confiar en nuestro conocimiento, no en el dogma de los buscadores o los balbuceos de las esfinges".\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c6206a4-5e6b-4f62-9b79-7023b344bd05\', \'multiverseId\': 589072}, \'multiverseid\': 589072}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire ésotérique\', \'text\': \'Le Sanctuaire ésotérique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons nous fier à notre connaissance, pas au dogme des chercheurs ou aux murmures des sphinx. »\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589216&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5d75e4-6fee-4027-9374-b2433d6242be\', \'multiverseId\': 589216}, \'multiverseid\': 589216}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Arcano\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario Arcano entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo confidare nelle nostre conoscenze, non nel dogma dei cercatori o nei mormorii delle sfingi."\\n—Tullus di Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea54c969-009d-4b3a-bfc4-2956c6c1f882\', \'multiverseId\': 589360}, \'multiverseid\': 589360}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の聖域\', \'text\': \'秘儀の聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は求道者の教義やスフィンクスのぼやきなどではなく、自らの知識を礎としなければならない。」\\n――パランディウスのタラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19f3f0a5-f910-462d-8504-f63a9fe03af0\', \'multiverseId\': 589504}, \'multiverseid\': 589504}]', "[{'name': 'Nachtstahl-Zitadelle', 'text': 'Unzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.', 'type': 'Artefakt, Land', 'flavor': 'Bauten aus Nachtstahl werden weder durch Angriffe noch durch Alterung geschwächt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588935&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1464d2a-7ec5-45a5-a643-7cd5620bce2c', 'multiverseId': 588935}, 'multiverseid': 588935}, {'name': 'Ciudadela de acero oscuro', 'text': 'Indestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.', 'type': 'Tierra artefacto', 'flavor': 'Las estructuras construidas con acero oscuro no ceden ante el asalto ni ante el paso del tiempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589079&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff24039a-be3d-4d73-b687-c11e062d09cb', 'multiverseId': 589079}, 'multiverseid': 589079}, {'name': 'Citadelle de sombracier', 'text': 'Indestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.', 'type': 'Terrain-artefact', 'flavor': 'Les édifices en sombracier défient les assauts et le temps.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589223&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eee8fef5-d09a-4864-a29d-2b90719fd03b', 'multiverseId': 589223}, 'multiverseid': 589223}, {'name': 'Roccaforte di Darksteel', 'text': 'Indistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.', 'type': 'Terra Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Le strutture di darksteel sono impervie sia agli attacchi sia al passare del tempo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589367&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c858f3b-d1c1-4a4e-9f3d-090a434d7f53', 'multiverseId': 589367}, 'multiverseid': 589367}, {'name': 'ダークスティールの城塞', 'text': '破壊不能\\n{T}：{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・土地', 'flavor': 'ダークスティールで造られた構造物は、攻撃にも年月にも屈することはない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589511&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edda0059-2271-4e8a-9621-421c80b2a0a4', 'multiverseId': 589511}, 'multiverseid': 589511}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachtstahljuggernaut\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Nachtstahljuggernauten sind gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\\nDer Nachtstahljuggernaut greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68cea5e-82c2-4c95-a789-7e18f952488a\', \'multiverseId\': 588892}, \'multiverseid\': 588892}, {\'name\': \'Destructor de acero oscuro\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Destructor de acero oscuro son iguales a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\\nEl Destructor de acero oscuro ataca cada combate si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Destructor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf551e30-065c-4a11-aaab-31602dc78258\', \'multiverseId\': 589036}, \'multiverseid\': 589036}, {\'name\': \'Djaggernaut de sombracier\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Djaggernaut de sombracier sont chacune égales au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.\\nLe Djaggernaut de sombracier attaque à chaque combat si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : djaggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00165f9d-a704-4a40-8854-bf8441358279\', \'multiverseId\': 589180}, \'multiverseid\': 589180}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut di Darksteel\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Juggernaut di Darksteel sono pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\\nIl Juggernaut di Darksteel attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'724d6b50-e64b-4fca-a69e-2a79ddfcb853\', \'multiverseId\': 589324}, \'multiverseid\': 589324}, {\'name\': \'ダークスティールの巨大戦車\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nダークスティールの巨大戦車のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\\n各戦闘で、ダークスティールの巨大戦車は可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'003fee57-237d-4bd0-baf5-7e13fa3e9aca\', \'multiverseId\': 589468}, \'multiverseid\': 589468}]', "[{'name': 'Nebelgruftbrücke', 'text': 'Die Nebelgruftbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUnzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Artefakt, Land', 'flavor': 'Der Weg zum Wissen wird im Hunger geschmiedet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588944&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '255ecd3f-ab44-4660-b7a5-f67a7229a99d', 'multiverseId': 588944}, 'multiverseid': 588944}, {'name': 'Puente bovedaneblinosa', 'text': 'El Puente bovedaneblinosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nIndestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra artefacto', 'flavor': 'El camino al conocimiento se forja con ansia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589088&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '972cee5d-c25a-4d5e-a19a-270d1d1f2d4d', 'multiverseId': 589088}, 'multiverseid': 589088}, {'name': 'Pont de Voûtebrume', 'text': 'Le Pont de Voûtebrume arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nIndestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain-artefact', 'flavor': 'Le chemin de la connaissance est forgé dans la soif.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589232&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3862610f-50e9-4796-aa03-f2734850bfe4', 'multiverseId': 589232}, 'multiverseid': 589232}, {'name': 'Ponte di Nebbiavolta', 'text': 'Il Ponte di Nebbiavolta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIndistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.', 'type': 'Terra Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Il cammino verso la conoscenza è forgiato nella fame.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589376&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2da50363-5a85-45b8-9330-79eb4c91dcb4', 'multiverseId': 589376}, 'multiverseid': 589376}, {'name': '霧霊堂の橋', 'text': '霧霊堂の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n破壊不能\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・土地', 'flavor': '知識へと至る道は渇望によって築かれている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589520&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4942bbc5-de3f-463f-9a5c-76b5214d9294', 'multiverseId': 589520}, 'multiverseid': 589520}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nihilistische Spruchbombe\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Nihilistische Spruchbombe: Schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nWenn die Nihilistische Spruchbombe aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du {B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5d96a0-d5a8-48bc-8051-47b4d75a4d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 588907}, \'multiverseid\': 588907}, {\'name\': \'Bombahechizo nihil\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Bombahechizo nihil: Exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\nCuando la Bombahechizo nihil vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, puedes pagar {B}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903b1eee-4659-437f-92f0-56b83fddd29d\', \'multiverseId\': 589051}, \'multiverseid\': 589051}, {\'name\': "Bombe à sortilèges d\'annihilation", \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez la Bombe à sortilèges d\'annihilation : Exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\nQuand la Bombe à sortilèges d\'annihilation est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {B}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1497b33-5d14-4429-aa87-2ef7ae89f1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 589195}, \'multiverseid\': 589195}, {\'name\': \'Bombarcana Nichilista\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Bombarcana Nichilista: Esilia il cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\nQuando la Bombarcana Nichilista viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {B}. Se lo fai, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c033f410-4fe7-4260-8654-7d0cddf39394\', \'multiverseId\': 589339}, \'multiverseid\': 589339}, {\'name\': \'虚無の呪文爆弾\', \'text\': \'{T},虚無の呪文爆弾を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\\n虚無の呪文爆弾が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、あなたは{B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c92310-860c-4e34-b781-6e45e84ebeec\', \'multiverseId\': 589483}, \'multiverseid\': 589483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nüchterner Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Zerstöre alle Artefakte.\\n• Zerstöre alle Verzauberungen.\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger.\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588824&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f04744-a9e7-44b3-abc1-14060b089578\', \'multiverseId\': 588824}, \'multiverseid\': 588824}, {\'name\': \'Dictado severo\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Destruye todos los artefactos.\\n• Destruye todos los encantamientos.\\n• Destruye todas las criaturas con valor de maná de 3 o menos.\\n• Destruye todas las criaturas con valor de maná de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d4d6a9-cfec-4014-8e3b-ed7bd80f93ae\', \'multiverseId\': 588968}, \'multiverseid\': 588968}, {\'name\': "Commandement d\'austérité", \'text\': \'Choisissez deux —\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts.\\n• Détruisez tous les enchantements.\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures dont la valeur de mana est inférieure ou égale à 3.\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures dont la valeur de mana est supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c12edb2-65ac-4d1b-8bec-bb42348edf47\', \'multiverseId\': 589112}, \'multiverseid\': 589112}, {\'name\': \'Ordine Severo\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Distruggi tutti gli artefatti.\\n• Distruggi tutti gli incantesimi.\\n• Distruggi tutte le creature con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3.\\n• Distruggi tutte le creature con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd05354-40fc-4efc-a4fb-101b1874c9b0\', \'multiverseId\': 589256}, \'multiverseid\': 589256}, {\'name\': \'質素な命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n・すべてのアーティファクトを破壊する。\\n・すべてのエンチャントを破壊する。\\n・マナ総量が３以下であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\\n・マナ総量が４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62f7a9a4-c7fb-4d9e-b026-ce2eae3ce131\', \'multiverseId\': 589400}, \'multiverseid\': 589400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Offenbarung der Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Geheimnisse liegen in der Wüste hinter dem Hekma. Aber deine Herausforderung wird nicht darin bestehen, sie zu finden, sondern darin, mit dem Wissen zu leben."\\n—Samut, zu Basri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebb5c252-404e-41b2-b269-55b98e2d0647\', \'multiverseId\': 588885}, \'multiverseid\': 588885}, {\'name\': \'Revelación de la esfinge\', \'text\': \'Ganas X vidas y robas X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestros secretos yacen en el desierto, más allá de la Hekma. No te costará encontrarlos, sino aprender a vivir con lo que descubras".\\n—Samut, a Basri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1795dca8-efc3-442f-8c8f-4e8daa413c78\', \'multiverseId\': 589029}, \'multiverseid\': 589029}, {\'name\': \'Révélation du sphinx\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nos secrets sont enfouis dans le désert au-delà de l\'Hekma. Le plus grand défi ne sera pas de les découvrir, mais de vivre avec ce savoir. »\\n—Samut, à Basri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a50ad90-25a3-4838-820f-895cff3e41b3\', \'multiverseId\': 589173}, \'multiverseid\': 589173}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione della Sfinge\', \'text\': \'Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri segreti si celano nel deserto al di là dell\\\'Hekma. La tua sfida non sarà trovarli, bensì convivere con tale conoscenza."\\n—Samut a Basri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c366964-b0ee-4417-a853-28c894a9eb41\', \'multiverseId\': 589317}, \'multiverseid\': 589317}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの啓示\', \'text\': \'あなたはＸ点のライフを得、カードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の秘密はヘクマの彼方の砂漠に隠されているわ。しかしそれを探すことが試練なのではない。その知識とどう向き合っていくかが試練なの。」\\n――サムトからバスリへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d5ececa-dcb4-4d3d-9814-f7983f1217cf\', \'multiverseId\': 589461}, \'multiverseid\': 589461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oni-Kult-Amboss\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein oder mehrere Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, in deinem Zug das Spiel verlassen, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Der Oni-Kult-Amboss fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04970f34-0a75-4e9b-bc26-fa206f2c22cf\', \'multiverseId\': 588882}, \'multiverseid\': 588882}, {\'name\': \'Yunque del culto a los oni\', \'text\': \'Siempre que uno o más artefactos que controlas dejen el campo de batalla durante tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 1/1. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: El Yunque del culto a los oni hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente. Ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6514b1e0-1a04-45d2-80aa-80a163d9eef6\', \'multiverseId\': 589026}, \'multiverseid\': 589026}, {\'name\': \'Enclume du culte des oni\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins un artefact que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Construction. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : L\'Enclume du culte des oni inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce938f7b-f8da-4544-bc08-3bd5ba9b05ff\', \'multiverseId\': 589170}, \'multiverseid\': 589170}, {\'name\': \'Incudine del Culto degli Oni\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta uno o più artefatti che controlli lasciano il campo di battaglia durante il tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 1/1 incolore. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: L\'Incudine del Culto degli Oni infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario. Guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f88324-fee1-40be-b728-ac22023cc418\', \'multiverseId\': 589314}, \'multiverseid\': 589314}, {\'name\': \'鬼流の金床\', \'text\': \'あなたのターン中に、あなたがコントロールしている１つ以上のアーティファクトが戦場を離れるたび、無色の１/１の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n{T},アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：鬼流の金床は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f34a0e2-d842-44b6-aea5-582444554009\', \'multiverseId\': 589458}, \'multiverseid\': 589458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Basilika\', \'text\': \'Die Orzhov-Basilika kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Orzhov-Basilika ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407b20b0-7a67-4642-a1b6-e14989dad5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 588946}, \'multiverseid\': 588946}, {\'name\': \'Basílica orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basílica orzhov entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Basílica orzhov entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c71333-a5de-4e1b-9800-1dd22bbdb6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 589090}, \'multiverseid\': 589090}, {\'name\': "Basilique d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6df227-b0d0-402c-9c88-ba9ee4eb2757\', \'multiverseId\': 589234}, \'multiverseid\': 589234}, {\'name\': \'Basilica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea14e33e-068a-4ed4-99d2-aa469733f6f8\', \'multiverseId\': 589378}, \'multiverseid\': 589378}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの聖堂\', \'text\': \'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91280b4c-9322-4858-a97d-179aaeba1126\', \'multiverseId\': 589522}, \'multiverseid\': 589522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Siegel hat unterschiedliche Bedeutungen, je nach Form und Material. Manche tragen es als Statussymbol, andere als Zeichen ihrer Schuld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d319e4b-677e-4575-9df7-ca958db86fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 588909}, \'multiverseid\': 588909}, {\'name\': \'Sello orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El sello tiene distintos significados dependiendo de su forma y presentación. Mientras algunos lo llevan como un símbolo de estatus, en otros indica una deuda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd2f37d3-8ca1-4454-b72a-d3e5e00be3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 589053}, \'multiverseid\': 589053}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Orzhov", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La forme et la présentation du cachet sont aussi importantes que le cachet en lui-même. Pour certains, c\'est un signe extérieur de leur statut. Pour d\'autres, c\'est un signe extérieur de dette.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589197&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755f1b07-ebc1-4d94-af9d-f787f8707e12\', \'multiverseId\': 589197}, \'multiverseid\': 589197}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il sigillo ha un diverso significato in base alla forma e alla presentazione. Mentre alcuni lo indossano per indicare il loro status, altri lo indossano per indicare un debito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b7739a-7e28-4ed3-b899-7b56114dab6b\', \'multiverseId\': 589341}, \'multiverseid\': 589341}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'印章はその形によって異なる意味を持つ。地位の証として身につけるものもいれば、負債の証として身につけるものもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'711fedbb-f111-45fd-9125-201bf8df1ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 589485}, \'multiverseid\': 589485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Padeem, Konsulin der Innovation\', \'text\': \'Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, haben Fluchsicherheit.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du das Artefakt mit dem höchsten Manabetrag kontrollierst oder diesbezüglich Gleichstand herrscht, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Beeindrucke mich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588846&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef82007-3dfd-4297-8365-16872f0d2533\', \'multiverseId\': 588846}, \'multiverseid\': 588846}, {\'name\': \'Padeem, Cónsul de Innovación\', \'text\': \'Los artefactos que controlas tienen la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas el artefacto con el valor de maná más alto o empatado por el valor de maná más alto, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Impresióname".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d343eae5-ae4f-48aa-8960-484958727707\', \'multiverseId\': 588990}, \'multiverseid\': 588990}, {\'name\': "Padeem, consul de l\'innovation", \'text\': "Les artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la défense talismanique.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez l\'artefact avec la valeur de mana la plus élevée ou qui partage la valeur de mana la plus élevée, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Impressionnez-moi. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589134&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822b0027-5d45-47b6-970a-77b1245ff52b\', \'multiverseId\': 589134}, \'multiverseid\': 589134}, {\'name\': "Padeem, Console dell\'Innovazione", \'text\': "Gli artefatti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli l\'artefatto con il valore di mana maggiore o con il valore di mana maggiore a pari merito con altri artefatti, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"Stupiscimi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3206f549-bee7-4731-a83e-08e313363929\', \'multiverseId\': 589278}, \'multiverseid\': 589278}, {\'name\': \'発明の領事、パディーム\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトは呪禁を持つ。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、マナ総量がアーティファクトのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しいアーティファクトをあなたがコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「私を驚かせなさい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c82e36d-3140-485c-8b89-a115c871f943\', \'multiverseId\': 589422}, \'multiverseid\': 589422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Wenn dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Kommandeur gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bb1982-cfc0-453d-8e00-10a66fe74e16\', \'multiverseId\': 588947}, \'multiverseid\': 588947}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd53577-290c-45df-a4ca-e7540623c730\', \'multiverseId\': 589091}, \'multiverseid\': 589091}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e411f1d-aeee-4af3-83b6-ae35f301b23a\', \'multiverseId\': 589235}, \'multiverseid\': 589235}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25aa0a89-0073-44ef-9e12-08e6fd699c09\', \'multiverseId\': 589379}, \'multiverseid\': 589379}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナがあなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプ１つを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816e288c-814c-4711-82e2-b8d765418f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 589523}, \'multiverseid\': 589523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianische Wiedergeburt\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen und erzeuge dann einen X/X farblosen Phyrexianer-Schrecken-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die auf diese Weise zerstört wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Solange noch ein Tropfen Öl existiert, geht es fröhlich weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d49f1cc7-f028-4d58-b16a-c8d4d7d42270\', \'multiverseId\': 588829}, \'multiverseid\': 588829}, {\'name\': \'Renacimiento pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas, luego crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Horror Pirexiano incolora X/X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas destruidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras exista una gota de ese aceite, la dichosa labor continúa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f73f28a-ad07-49ca-8595-e5442d427d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 588973}, \'multiverseid\': 588973}, {\'name\': \'Renaissance phyrexiane\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures, puis créez un jeton de créature-artefact X/X incolore Phyrexian et Horreur, X étant le nombre de créatures détruites de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tant qu\'il subsistera une goutte de pétrole, notre mission de joie continuera.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d7af0f-8aff-4e29-97c9-094eac307a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 589117}, \'multiverseid\': 589117}, {\'name\': \'Rinascita di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature, poi crea una pedina creatura artefatto Orrore Phyrexiano X/X incolore, dove X è il numero di creature distrutte in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Finché esiste una goccia dell\'olio, l\'allegro lavoro continua.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2cc1e13-ad05-41dc-a38a-99830c568675\', \'multiverseId\': 589261}, \'multiverseid\': 589261}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの再誕\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊し、その後、無色のＸ/Ｘのファイレクシアン・ホラー・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはこれにより破壊されたクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'油が一滴でもあるかぎり、喜びに満ちた業は続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf251db1-8047-4ff7-b959-b8e5cae35e95\', \'multiverseId\': 589405}, \'multiverseid\': 589405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederarchiv\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Polyederarchiv: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Du beginnst, den wahren Zweck der Polyeder zu verstehen", sagte Ugin. „Die Eldrazi können eingesperrt werden."\\n„Wir wissen ja, wie gut es das letzte Mal funktioniert hat …", antwortete Jace trocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e867757b-d498-4587-b091-613a1eaf846c\', \'multiverseId\': 588897}, \'multiverseid\': 588897}, {\'name\': \'Edro de almacenaje\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro de almacenaje: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás comenzando a entender el verdadero propósito de los edros", dijo Ugin. "Los Eldrazi pueden ser encerrados".\\n"¿Y qué tal funcionó el sistema la última vez?", preguntó Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb4df96-46d7-4d8f-b883-35bf866fbe30\', \'multiverseId\': 589041}, \'multiverseid\': 589041}, {\'name\': \'Archive hèdron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Archive hèdron : Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Tu commences à comprendre le véritable rôle des hèdrons, dit Ugin. Les Eldrazi peuvent être emprisonnés. »\\n« Et comment cela s\'est-il fini la dernière fois ? » demanda Jace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1bb5847-38d9-4662-b7f0-e816246df9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 589185}, \'multiverseid\': 589185}, {\'name\': "Archivio nell\'Edro", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Archivio nell\'Edro: Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai iniziando a comprendere la vera funzione degli edri," disse Ugin. "Gli Eldrazi possono essere imprigionati."\\n"E l\\\'ultima volta ha funzionato?" chiese Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740ac2ff-525c-4ebb-baa5-a08cc486e306\', \'multiverseId\': 589329}, \'multiverseid\': 589329}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の記録庫\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},面晶体の記録庫を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは言った。「おぬしは面晶体の本来の目的を理解し始めておる。エルドラージを封じることができるのだ。」\\n「それで、前回はどうなったのですか？」ジェイスが訊いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c747bfbe-7f3b-442b-9fa9-9e36689f200c\', \'multiverseId\': 589473}, \'multiverseid\': 589473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophetisches Prisma\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Prophetische Prisma ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Forscher, der es fand, wurde beim Verkauf übers Ohr gehauen. Er wurde nur reich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48d1dc5-d0b2-47d7-b99b-01a6dd8466b3\', \'multiverseId\': 588910}, \'multiverseid\': 588910}, {\'name\': \'Prisma profético\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Prisma profético entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El explorador que lo encontró no hizo un buen negocio al venderlo. Simplemente se hizo rico".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ecb244-e796-4d13-af60-f8c66bef9575\', \'multiverseId\': 589054}, \'multiverseid\': 589054}, {\'name\': \'Prisme prophétique\', \'text\': \'Quand le Prisme prophétique arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'explorateur qui l\'a trouvé s\'est fait avoir quand il l\'a vendu. Il est juste devenu riche. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df1c21c-4c6c-4f7e-bb82-d62e9e001d05\', \'multiverseId\': 589198}, \'multiverseid\': 589198}, {\'name\': \'Prisma Profetico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Prisma Profetico entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'esploratore che lo trovò fece un brutto affare quando lo vendette. Divenne solamente ricco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcccb3e8-6430-417f-914a-7d49a6d47ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 589342}, \'multiverseid\': 589342}, {\'name\': \'予言のプリズム\', \'text\': \'予言のプリズムが戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\n{1},{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「これを見つけた探険家は、売り払ったときにひどい取り引きをしたな。単に裕福になっただけとは。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f75f5cb-be30-4a2e-99cf-56c84aa192e3\', \'multiverseId\': 589486}, \'multiverseid\': 589486}]', "[{'name': 'Präriefluss', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDer Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Ondu ist ein ausgedehntes Plateau, durchzogen von tiefen Furchen und Mäanderströmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588948&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4978949e-77e8-4e02-b661-22f79745e60b', 'multiverseId': 588948}, 'multiverseid': 588948}, {'name': 'Manantial de la pradera', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nEl Manantial de la pradera entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': 'El continente de Ondu es una gran meseta atravesada por profundas zanjas y ríos serpenteantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589092&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36423d12-b78d-4ee5-bc03-f89b8c7dee44', 'multiverseId': 589092}, 'multiverseid': 589092}, {'name': 'Prairie ruisselante', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLa Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': 'Le continent du Ondou est un vaste plateau traversé de fossés profonds et de rivières sinueuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589236&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35cf6669-df24-4314-8834-8d87816aaeb7', 'multiverseId': 589236}, 'multiverseid': 589236}, {'name': 'Ruscello nella Prateria', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nIl Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Ondu è un vasto altopiano segnato da profondi fossati e fiumi sinuosi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589380&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2a1f31d-b83c-4e81-9df8-6536c7544a48', 'multiverseId': 589380}, 'multiverseid': 589380}, {'name': '大草原の川', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': 'オンドゥ大陸は広大な平地である。そこを深い溝が縦横に走り、曲がりくねった川が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589524&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae930490-c843-48d8-b1df-bab3ac012696', 'multiverseId': 589524}, 'multiverseid': 589524}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rakdos-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es wird aus Knochen gefertigt und in Blut gesiedet, aber ein Rakdos-Petschaft gilt erst dann als vollkommen, wenn es als Mordwaffe verwendet wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'337f95eb-b7ce-46f2-b08e-a7c7b1cec5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 588911}, \'multiverseid\': 588911}, {\'name\': \'Sello rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Hecho de hueso y hervido en sangre, el sello rakdos no está terminado hasta que no se usa como un arma homicida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfcd2089-4a05-430e-ac65-6198b3947421\', \'multiverseId\': 589055}, \'multiverseid\': 589055}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Fait d\'os bouilli dans le sang, un cachet de Rakdos est considéré comme terminé lorsqu\'il a été utilisé comme arme pour un meurtre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43b08758-bb49-45ec-a281-461624fa2a14\', \'multiverseId\': 589199}, \'multiverseid\': 589199}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Costruito con ossa e bollito nel sangue, un sigillo Rakdos non è considerato finito finché non viene usato come arma per un omicidio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b6f518e-9c34-486e-b05f-662003d7286c\', \'multiverseId\': 589343}, \'multiverseid\': 589343}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'骨から作られ血で煮られるラクドスの印鑑は、さらに殺しの武器として用いられるまでは完成したとみなされない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b890965-192f-42a8-901c-bb74da04c478\', \'multiverseId\': 589487}, \'multiverseid\': 589487}]', "[{'name': 'Rakdos-Schlachtstätte', 'text': 'Die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588949&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '004d115f-6a27-4cde-8c20-0c1d8fc1520c', 'multiverseId': 588949}, 'multiverseid': 588949}, {'name': 'Carnarium rakdos', 'text': 'El Carnarium rakdos entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Carnarium rakdos entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589093&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49ee4757-01ed-4e50-bc07-365871c1324a', 'multiverseId': 589093}, 'multiverseid': 589093}, {'name': 'Carnarium de Rakdos', 'text': 'Le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589237&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02ad2073-5e55-4ed5-b232-25e1b82bb110', 'multiverseId': 589237}, 'multiverseid': 589237}, {'name': 'Carnario Rakdos', 'text': 'Il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589381&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58fc6487-8115-41c4-9667-c5a0c39a38b1', 'multiverseId': 589381}, 'multiverseid': 589381}, {'name': 'ラクドスの肉儀場', 'text': 'ラクドスの肉儀場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nラクドスの肉儀場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589525&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77a243c9-f22a-4b05-b576-9c9609728555', 'multiverseId': 589525}, 'multiverseid': 589525}]", "[{'name': 'Reliquie von Progenitus', 'text': '{T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl schickt eine Karte aus seinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{1}, schicke die Reliquie von Progenitus ins Exil: Schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil. Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Elfen glauben, dass der Hydragott Progenitus unter Naya schläft und sich von vergessener Magie ernährt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588912&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfb03262-314a-442c-aa00-f2e4afd18f28', 'multiverseId': 588912}, 'multiverseid': 588912}, {'name': 'Reliquia de Progenitus', 'text': '{T}: El jugador objetivo exilia una carta de su cementerio.\\n{1}, exiliar la Reliquia de Progenitus: Exilia todos los cementerios. Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Los elfos creen que el dios hidra Progenitus duerme bajo Naya, alimentándose de la magia olvidada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589056&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '948edd48-035a-4dc4-88b9-9dc6f0ec5a36', 'multiverseId': 589056}, 'multiverseid': 589056}, {'name': 'Relique de Progénitus', 'text': '{T} : Un joueur ciblé exile une carte depuis son cimetière.\\n{1}, exilez la Relique de Progénitus : Exilez tous les cimetières. Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Les elfes croient que le dieu-hydre Progénitus sommeille sous la surface de Naya, nourri par des magies oubliées.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589200&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a3f0fb7-ec79-4342-8bdb-6676521c012a', 'multiverseId': 589200}, 'multiverseid': 589200}, {'name': 'Reliquia del Progenitus', 'text': '{T}: Un giocatore bersaglio esilia una carta dal suo cimitero.\\n{1}, Esilia la Reliquia del Progenitus: Esilia tutti i cimiteri. Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Gli elfi credono che il dio-idra Progenitus dorma sotto Naya, nutrendosi di magie dimenticate.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589344&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebdaa05b-e06e-462d-9678-5196102985f1', 'multiverseId': 589344}, 'multiverseid': 589344}, {'name': '大祖始の遺産', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地にあるカード１枚を追放する。\\n{1},大祖始の遺産を追放する：すべての墓地を追放する。カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'エルフはハイドラ神である大祖始が、ナヤの地底で忘れられた魔法を餌にしながら眠っていると信じている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589488&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '046696b7-b9e7-43a6-91af-71afdbfaf5d6', 'multiverseId': 589488}, 'multiverseid': 589488}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sai, Meister-Thopterist\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{1}{U}, opfere zwei Artefakte: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ohne die Kunst ist Handwerk nur eine umständliche Art, den Schrottplatz zu füllen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00cb1837-9942-437f-b932-64176a675768\', \'multiverseId\': 588848}, \'multiverseid\': 588848}, {\'name\': \'Sai, maestro topterista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{1}{U}, sacrificar dos artefactos: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tecnología sin arte no es más que una forma muy cara de llenar el vertedero".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c0264b-ec2b-447f-83d8-92b5649cad04\', \'multiverseId\': 588992}, \'multiverseid\': 588992}, {\'name\': \'Sai, maître mécanoptériste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\n{1}{U}, sacrifiez deux artefacts : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Une industrie sans talent artistique est une façon distinguée de remplir un dépôt de ferraille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e12df7-1ef5-4c05-b5d4-7262311af9aa\', \'multiverseId\': 589136}, \'multiverseid\': 589136}, {\'name\': \'Sayi, Maestro Totterista\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\n{1}{U}, Sacrifica due artefatti: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non è accompagnata dall\\\'arte, l\\\'operosità non è che un metodo elaborato per riempire un deposito di ferraglia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a9737c-9006-49dc-95c0-5b6b226f3d07\', \'multiverseId\': 589280}, \'multiverseid\': 589280}, {\'name\': \'練達飛行機械職人、サイ\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}{U},アーティファクト２つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「芸術のない産業なんて、おしゃれにゴミ置き場のゴミを増やすだけさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ec7c36-59d5-42ed-b15f-94007ffc157b\', \'multiverseId\': 589424}, \'multiverseid\': 589424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sanwell der Rächerpilot\', \'text\': \'Solange eine Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, verhindere allen Schaden, der Sanwell dem Rächerpiloten zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn Sanwell getappt wird, schicke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon einen Fahrzeug- oder Artefaktkreaturenzauber wirken. Lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pilot\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfde41d3-227b-4de3-9293-3ffa66340fba\', \'multiverseId\': 588416}, \'multiverseid\': 588416}, {\'name\': \'Sanwell, as vengador\', \'text\': \'Mientras una criatura artefacto que controlas esté atacando, prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer a Sanwell, as vengador.\\nSiempre que Sanwell se gire, exilia las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar un Vehículo o un hechizo de criatura artefacto de entre ellas. Luego, pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Piloto humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea56291-6c82-4f1d-93e7-58784c6b88b0\', \'multiverseId\': 588432}, \'multiverseid\': 588432}, {\'name\': \'Sanwell, as vengeur\', \'text\': "Tant qu\'une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez attaque, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à Sanwell, as vengeur.\\nÀ chaque fois que Sanwell devient engagé, exilez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort de véhicule ou de créature-artefact parmi elles. Mettez ensuite le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et pilote\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad22341c-c05f-4108-a9e7-a3b35b31dd65\', \'multiverseId\': 588448}, \'multiverseid\': 588448}, {\'name\': \'Sanwell, Asso Vendicatore\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che una creatura artefatto che controlli attacca, previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a Sanwell, Asso Vendicatore.\\nOgniqualvolta Sanwell viene TAPpato, esilia le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare una magia creatura artefatto o Veicolo scelta tra esse. Poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pilota Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481190c8-a429-42dc-9b56-3ba05e509ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 588464}, \'multiverseid\': 588464}, {\'name\': \'アヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェル\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャーが攻撃しているかぎり、アヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェルが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nアヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェルがタップ状態になるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を追放する。あなたはその中から機体やアーティファクト・クリーチャーである呪文１つを唱えてもよい。その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・操縦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315786db-a639-4832-9d06-c8588b293ede\', \'multiverseId\': 588480}, \'multiverseid\': 588480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sanwell der Rächerpilot\', \'text\': \'Solange eine Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, verhindere allen Schaden, der Sanwell dem Rächerpiloten zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn Sanwell getappt wird, schicke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon einen Fahrzeug- oder Artefaktkreaturenzauber wirken. Lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pilot\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a623af5-fe3e-4128-9adf-218297e6693c\', \'multiverseId\': 588567}, \'multiverseid\': 588567}, {\'name\': \'Sanwell, as vengeur\', \'text\': "Tant qu\'une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez attaque, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à Sanwell, as vengeur.\\nÀ chaque fois que Sanwell devient engagé, exilez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer un sort de véhicule ou de créature-artefact parmi elles. Mettez ensuite le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et pilote\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa16fb70-0b1f-4c9b-b5d0-db0131336b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 588583}, \'multiverseid\': 588583}, {\'name\': \'アヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェル\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャーが攻撃しているかぎり、アヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェルが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nアヴェンジャーの名手、サンウェルがタップ状態になるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を追放する。あなたはその中から機体やアーティファクト・クリーチャーである呪文１つを唱えてもよい。その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・操縦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ad8b10-d9fe-448b-b19b-1a92bd2a787c\', \'multiverseId\': 588599}, \'multiverseid\': 588599}, {\'name\': \'复仇王牌山威尔\', \'text\': \'只要任一由你操控的神器生物正进行攻击，便防止将对复仇王牌山威尔造成的所有伤害。\\n每当山威尔成为横置时，放逐你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以从其中施放一个载具或神器生物咒语。然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／驾手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92b2998-7dc0-4bd5-a2e4-df1f91495532\', \'multiverseId\': 588615}, \'multiverseid\': 588615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sardischer Rächer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Sardische Rächer angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, fügt der Sardische Rächer jenem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586473&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2653200b-5b7c-4015-9491-e1326feeb7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 586473}, \'multiverseid\': 586473}, {\'name\': \'Vengador de Sardia\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Vengador de Sardia ataque, obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlan tus oponentes.\\nSiempre que un artefacto que controla un oponente vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, el Vengador de Sardia hace 1 punto de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266ac77b-13a0-466b-9b06-9adaf48d7636\', \'multiverseId\': 586481}, \'multiverseid\': 586481}, {\'name\': \'Vengeur sardien\', \'text\': "Initiative, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vengeur sardien attaque, il gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vos adversaires contrôlent.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact qu\'un adversaire contrôle est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, le Vengeur sardien inflige 1 blessure à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a6534f-ba77-4d7f-b4f5-c3441e177743\', \'multiverseId\': 586489}, \'multiverseid\': 586489}, {\'name\': \'Vendicatore di Sardia\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Vendicatore di Sardia attacca, prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di artefatti controllati dai tuoi avversari.\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto controllato da un avversario viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, il Vendicatore di Sardia infligge 1 danno a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bd929e5-f987-4cd4-82f2-1eb2c2f3d29e\', \'multiverseId\': 586497}, \'multiverseid\': 586497}, {\'name\': \'サルディアの報復者\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、トランプル\\nサルディアの報復者が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘは各対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、サルディアの報復者はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb77bb7-1e25-4ad4-89fa-08ce9a5f63ea\', \'multiverseId\': 586505}, \'multiverseid\': 586505}, {\'name\': \'Vingador Sardiano\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, atropelar\\nToda vez que Vingador Sardiano ataca, ele recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o número de artefatos que seus oponentes controlam.\\nToda vez que um artefato que um oponente controla é colocado em um cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, Vingador Sardiano causa 1 ponto de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2964f80-30a2-48a6-ab7a-06df3cc92fc5\', \'multiverseId\': 586521}, \'multiverseid\': 586521}, {\'name\': \'沙地亚复仇者\', \'text\': \'先攻，践踏\\n每当沙地亚复仇者攻击时，它得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为由所有对手操控的神器数量。\\n每当一个由对手操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，沙地亚复仇者对该牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460e47c0-cccc-4541-9658-60d54229829e\', \'multiverseId\': 586537}, \'multiverseid\': 586537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sardischer Rächer\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Sardische Rächer angreift, erhält er bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, fügt der Sardische Rächer jenem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3b90de-b76e-4c4b-9da9-8fb52107d464\', \'multiverseId\': 588509}, \'multiverseid\': 588509}, {\'name\': \'Vengeur sardien\', \'text\': "Initiative, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vengeur sardien attaque, il gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vos adversaires contrôlent.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact qu\'un adversaire contrôle est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, le Vengeur sardien inflige 1 blessure à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd1e2bf-1418-4b26-b0aa-a7731f5f7420\', \'multiverseId\': 588520}, \'multiverseid\': 588520}, {\'name\': \'サルディアの報復者\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、トランプル\\nサルディアの報復者が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘは各対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、サルディアの報復者はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360ebeaf-a361-4bd6-9949-c7ee35cc33f9\', \'multiverseId\': 588531}, \'multiverseid\': 588531}, {\'name\': \'沙地亚复仇者\', \'text\': \'先攻，践踏\\n每当沙地亚复仇者攻击时，它得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为由所有对手操控的神器数量。\\n每当一个由对手操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，沙地亚复仇者对该牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71f811b8-9f52-45bd-8dcd-ab6f7097793e\', \'multiverseId\': 588542}, \'multiverseid\': 588542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenblut-Grat\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Boden Otarias zeigt immer noch die Spuren von Gemetzeln längst vergangener Konflikte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175c1ba1-4b21-4e64-8ecb-bee8e2c3b38b\', \'multiverseId\': 588954}, \'multiverseid\': 588954}, {\'name\': \'Cordillera Sangresombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La masacre de conflictos pasados aún mancha la tierra otariana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79b28925-fdc9-4bb9-b4fd-9b98ef46ecd3\', \'multiverseId\': 589098}, \'multiverseid\': 589098}, {\'name\': "Contreforts d\'Ombresang", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Le sang des conflits d\'autrefois souille encore le sol d\'Otaria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca8ceae-3cba-4eb2-b920-f638d4e7cbe2\', \'multiverseId\': 589242}, \'multiverseid\': 589242}, {\'name\': \'Costa di Sangueombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le carneficine dei conflitti di tempi lontani macchiano ancora il terreno di Otaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae5a504d-430b-423d-ab63-7644692bfd03\', \'multiverseId\': 589386}, \'multiverseid\': 589386}, {\'name\': \'シャドーブラッドの尾根\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'長きに渡った昔の闘争の血の痕跡が、いまだにオタリアの土にしみついている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51775952-c15f-46f3-8ee5-345d4329fa83\', \'multiverseId\': 589530}, \'multiverseid\': 589530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schimmernder Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange du vier oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, hat der Schimmernde Drache Fluchsicherheit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Der indigofarbene Drache tauschte gerne einen kleinen Teil seines Horts gegen ewiges Mondlicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588850&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b15c75-a7ea-4e2a-8d1e-b63899edba98\', \'multiverseId\': 588850}, \'multiverseid\': 588850}, {\'name\': \'Dragón centelleante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras controles cuatro o más artefactos, el Dragón centelleante tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\nGirar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'El dragón índigo entregó con gusto parte de su tesoro a cambio de bañarse eternamente en la luz de la luna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ccfcca2-544d-4938-9ed1-b46c66b783cd\', \'multiverseId\': 588994}, \'multiverseid\': 588994}, {\'name\': \'Dragon scintillant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que vous contrôlez au moins quatre artefacts, le Dragon scintillant a la défense talismanique.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Le dragon indigo troqua volontiers une part de son trésor contre un éternel clair de lune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca23d736-627d-4501-b46a-4acb32e549f9\', \'multiverseId\': 589138}, \'multiverseid\': 589138}, {\'name\': \'Drago Scintillante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che controlli quattro o più artefatti, il Drago Scintillante ha anti-malocchio.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': "Il drago indaco fu ben lieto di privarsi di un po\' del suo tesoro in cambio di luce lunare eterna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb2dc71-843a-4a1d-9a13-f1d0fb78ca13\', \'multiverseId\': 589282}, \'multiverseid\': 589282}, {\'name\': \'煌めくドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが４つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、煌めくドラゴンは呪禁を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアーティファクト２つをタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'この藍色のドラゴンは自分の財産の一部と引き換えに永遠の月明かりを手に入れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4fb7648-65fe-444e-bc16-3cbfb5fc582d\', \'multiverseId\': 589426}, \'multiverseid\': 589426}]', "[{'name': 'Schmelzkrätzenbrücke', 'text': 'Die Schmelzkrätzenbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUnzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Artefakt, Land', 'flavor': 'Der Weg ins Verderben wird im Schmerz geschmiedet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588938&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c95bb541-77e3-435a-83dc-4ae242119ac4', 'multiverseId': 588938}, 'multiverseid': 588938}, {'name': 'Puente forjaescoria', 'text': 'El Puente forjaescoria entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nIndestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra artefacto', 'flavor': 'El camino a la ruina se forja con dolor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589082&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a531452-b797-4375-9497-a42d2a63cc4e', 'multiverseId': 589082}, 'multiverseid': 589082}, {'name': 'Pont de Crasseforge', 'text': 'Le Pont de Crasseforge arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nIndestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain-artefact', 'flavor': 'Le chemin de la ruine est forgé dans la douleur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589226&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02628dbf-ba21-4fa3-9999-68a94a3055ef', 'multiverseId': 589226}, 'multiverseid': 589226}, {'name': 'Ponte di Forgiascorie', 'text': 'Il Ponte di Forgiascorie entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIndistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Il cammino verso la rovina è forgiato nel dolore.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589370&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7ef50df-315a-4a96-a9ae-c6705dd9c63f', 'multiverseId': 589370}, 'multiverseid': 589370}, {'name': '鉱滓造の橋', 'text': '鉱滓造の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n破壊不能\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・土地', 'flavor': '荒廃へと至る道は苦痛によって築かれている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589514&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52b73f36-9a4e-4889-8c61-8f8aa229f98d', 'multiverseId': 589514}, 'multiverseid': 589514}]", "[{'name': 'Schwelendes Marschland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDas Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Guul Draz ist ein geothermisches Sumpfland, in dem die Luft vor Hitze und fauligem Gestank flimmert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588957&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53519fcf-7319-4a96-b89a-6a450035cb57', 'multiverseId': 588957}, 'multiverseid': 588957}, {'name': 'Cenagal ardiente', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'El continente de Guul Draz es una ciénaga geotérmica que respira calor y putrefacción.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589101&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '611db945-c220-4fd2-85c6-a3922b719327', 'multiverseId': 589101}, 'multiverseid': 589101}, {'name': 'Marécage fumant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Le continent de Guul Draz est un marais géothermique, puant de chaleur et de décomposition.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589245&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8166d9ec-78f5-4c56-ad85-69cfa2db41f6', 'multiverseId': 589245}, 'multiverseid': 589245}, {'name': 'Palude Rovente', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.)\\nLa Palude Rovente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Guul Draz è un terreno geotermico paludoso che puzza di afa e putrefazione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589389&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12574f9e-c57f-43b5-8aa6-ba6fdc0b5768', 'multiverseId': 589389}, 'multiverseid': 589389}, {'name': '燻る湿地', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': 'グール・ドラズ大陸は温沼地である。地熱による高温と腐敗で燻っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589533&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b57e4b2-cdab-498b-ab42-cafb5d83a0b5', 'multiverseId': 589533}, 'multiverseid': 589533}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schwerter zu Pflugscharen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Schon ein kleiner Tropfen Bedauern kann zu einem Meer der Wiedergutmachung führen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bdc422-20af-4e58-ad40-08777bc00924\', \'multiverseId\': 588830}, \'multiverseid\': 588830}, {\'name\': \'Espadas en guadañas\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La más diminuta semilla de arrepentimiento puede germinar en redención.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d544ab75-ef8e-49e3-85f2-1fe495c75627\', \'multiverseId\': 588974}, \'multiverseid\': 588974}, {\'name\': \'Retour au pays\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'embryon de regret le plus infime peut s\'épanouir dans la rédemption.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589118&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18adda7d-812d-42b7-b307-71f3242195b6\', \'multiverseId\': 589118}, \'multiverseid\': 589118}, {\'name\': \'Da Spade a Spighe!\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La più piccola traccia di rimpianto può diventare voglia di riscatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d924294-d657-4940-9769-9ea5717c4b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 589262}, \'multiverseid\': 589262}, {\'name\': \'剣を鍬に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ごく小さい後悔の種が救済の花を咲かせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f9a954-ba3a-49c8-b6e2-0ea41d53d623\', \'multiverseId\': 589406}, \'multiverseid\': 589406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schädelstrammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/-1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Gehirn ist ein wunderbarer Schatz, der in einem langweiligen Behältnis aus Knochen versteckt ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588914&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00443118-9f3a-4c91-94a3-16551136bd32\', \'multiverseId\': 588914}, \'multiverseid\': 588914}, {\'name\': \'Engrampacráneo\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/-1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, roba dos cartas.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'La mente es una recompensa hermosa encerrada en un molesto contenedor óseo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5578f7d-915e-4a60-bbc2-7ba0a2a02cae\', \'multiverseId\': 589058}, \'multiverseid\': 589058}, {\'name\': \'Pincecrâne\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/-1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "L\'esprit est une belle récompense enveloppée d\'une pellicule agaçante en os.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d04cda-8d8d-49a2-a57c-8126f7aacc79\', \'multiverseId\': 589202}, \'multiverseid\': 589202}, {\'name\': \'Morsa Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/-1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, pesca due carte.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'La mente è un dono bellissimo racchiuso in un fastidioso contenitore osseo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dd030c7-86cb-4b46-b7ee-621f04b3afb4\', \'multiverseId\': 589346}, \'multiverseid\': 589346}, {\'name\': \'頭蓋骨絞め\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたはカード２枚を引く。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'精神とは、面倒臭い骨の器に閉じ込められた素晴らしい褒章だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df58fec-23fa-4a32-9f4b-3a168fcef300\', \'multiverseId\': 589490}, \'multiverseid\': 589490}]', "[{'name': 'Schädelverstärkung', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst.\\n{B}{B}: Lege die Schädelverstärkung an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588891&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c6c9c15-743b-4a8f-a9f1-6d5ac103ec4a', 'multiverseId': 588891}, 'multiverseid': 588891}, {'name': 'Blindaje craneano', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0 por cada artefacto que controlas.\\n{B}{B}: Anexa el Blindaje craneano a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589035&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c98950be-d111-4ed1-bd02-b27b61450b89', 'multiverseId': 589035}, 'multiverseid': 589035}, {'name': 'Blindage crânien', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +1/+0 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.\\n{B}{B} : Attachez le Blindage crânien à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589179&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82c670c2-9a9f-4641-b35a-474a1c1a585e', 'multiverseId': 589179}, 'multiverseid': 589179}, {'name': 'Placca Cefalica', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0 per ogni artefatto che controlli.\\n{B}{B}: Assegna la Placca Cefalica a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nEquipaggiare {1}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589323&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdb3822c-389e-412f-8edf-12273b767a21', 'multiverseId': 589323}, 'multiverseid': 589323}, {'name': '頭蓋囲い', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{B}{B}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。頭蓋囲いをそれにつける。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589467&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe4d61e8-6ede-4343-8302-c3e539086d11', 'multiverseId': 589467}, 'multiverseid': 589467}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schülerin von Caelus Nin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schülerin von Caelus Nin ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, bis zu fünf bleibende Karten, die er kontrolliert. Außer der Schülerin von Caelus Nin destabilisieren sich alle bleibenden Karten, die nicht auf diese Weise bestimmt wurden.\\nBleibende Karten können sich nicht stabilisieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3de44e-a531-429e-a6e1-c2b4762583ae\', \'multiverseId\': 586471}, \'multiverseid\': 586471}, {\'name\': \'Discípula de Caelus Nin\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Discípula de Caelus Nin entre al campo de batalla, comenzando contigo, cada jugador elige hasta cinco permanentes que controla. Todos los permanentes que no sean la Discípula de Caelus Nin y que no fueron elegidos de esta manera salen de fase.\\nLos permanentes no pueden entrar en fase.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38c3a68-bb26-475f-ac44-f183bbb06105\', \'multiverseId\': 586479}, \'multiverseid\': 586479}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de Caelus Nin\', \'text\': "Quand la Disciple de Caelus Nin arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur choisit jusqu\'à cinq permanents qu\'il contrôle. Tous les permanents autres que la Disciple de Caelus Nin qui n\'ont pas été choisis de cette manière passent hors phase.\\nLes permanents ne peuvent pas passer en phase.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7901f2c7-7a5e-46c0-814d-ae8bca969844\', \'multiverseId\': 586487}, \'multiverseid\': 586487}, {\'name\': \'Discepola di Caelus Nin\', \'text\': \'Quando la Discepola di Caelus Nin entra nel campo di battaglia, a partire da te, ogni giocatore sceglie fino a cinque permanenti che controlla. Tutti i permanenti diversi dalla Discepola di Caelus Nin che non sono stati scelti in questo modo scompaiono.\\nI permanenti non posso apparire.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'539e2708-bef2-4b22-9dde-3c6c639c4759\', \'multiverseId\': 586495}, \'multiverseid\': 586495}, {\'name\': \'カイラス・ニンの信奉者\', \'text\': \'カイラス・ニンの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、あなたから開始して各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているパーマネント最大５つを選ぶ。これにより選ばれもせずこれでもないすべてのパーマネントはフェイズ・アウトする。\\nすべてのパーマネントはフェイズ・インできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e67b27-5509-4ab6-8690-5c185ad6dbe6\', \'multiverseId\': 586503}, \'multiverseid\': 586503}, {\'name\': \'Discípula de Caelus Nin\', \'text\': \'Quando Discípula de Caelus Nin entra no campo de batalha, começando por você, cada jogador escolhe até cinco permanentes que ele controla. Todas as permanentes não escolhidas dessa forma, exceto Discípula de Caelus Nin, saem de fase.\\nPermanentes não podem entrar em fase.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5198146-f865-4975-b012-8b04c6ee59f3\', \'multiverseId\': 586519}, \'multiverseid\': 586519}, {\'name\': \'凯路忍信徒\', \'text\': \'当凯路忍信徒进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各选择至多五个由其操控的永久物。所有未以此法选中的永久物跃离，但凯路忍信徒除外。\\n永久物都不能跃回。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a51df65-5eeb-43b0-af2b-2cad0f820943\', \'multiverseId\': 586535}, \'multiverseid\': 586535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schülerin von Caelus Nin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schülerin von Caelus Nin ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, bis zu fünf bleibende Karten, die er kontrolliert. Außer der Schülerin von Caelus Nin destabilisieren sich alle bleibenden Karten, die nicht auf diese Weise bestimmt wurden.\\nBleibende Karten können sich nicht stabilisieren.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588507&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4fbef6-f1f2-4c04-ab86-602aac71b21f\', \'multiverseId\': 588507}, \'multiverseid\': 588507}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de Caelus Nin\', \'text\': "Quand la Disciple de Caelus Nin arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur choisit jusqu\'à cinq permanents qu\'il contrôle. Tous les permanents autres que la Disciple de Caelus Nin qui n\'ont pas été choisis de cette manière passent hors phase.\\nLes permanents ne peuvent pas passer en phase.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875c0009-f0b7-41da-842e-77acf1f27873\', \'multiverseId\': 588518}, \'multiverseid\': 588518}, {\'name\': \'カイラス・ニンの信奉者\', \'text\': \'カイラス・ニンの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、あなたから開始して各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているパーマネント最大５つを選ぶ。これにより選ばれもせずこれでもないすべてのパーマネントはフェイズ・アウトする。\\nすべてのパーマネントはフェイズ・インできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96cb621-288a-4e2c-8ade-60c4cda3d6e2\', \'multiverseId\': 588529}, \'multiverseid\': 588529}, {\'name\': \'凯路忍信徒\', \'text\': \'当凯路忍信徒进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各选择至多五个由其操控的永久物。所有未以此法选中的永久物跃离，但凯路忍信徒除外。\\n永久物都不能跃回。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821063d6-b2cb-4c9f-bac8-4d1f7af36367\', \'multiverseId\': 588540}, \'multiverseid\': 588540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstbehauptung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Zeig ihnen die gleiche Gnade, die sie Kroog gezeigt haben."\\n—Gyvan, Thopterpilot\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82a9fa9e-c3c0-4420-b46b-1aaeea02aed6\', \'multiverseId\': 588886}, \'multiverseid\': 588886}, {\'name\': \'Vindicar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ten con ellos la misma piedad que tuvieron con Kroog".\\n—Gyvan, piloto de tópteros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f014342-08e3-47d8-bdeb-227d52e19a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 589030}, \'multiverseid\': 589030}, {\'name\': \'Justification\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Montre-leur la même clémence qu\'ils ont accordée à Kroog. »\\n—Gyvan, pilote de mécanoptère", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6d1071-462d-4362-822f-abb7b5987031\', \'multiverseId\': 589174}, \'multiverseid\': 589174}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricambiali con la stessa pietà che hanno mostrato a Kroog."\\n—Gyvan, pilota di totteri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5fbeaf-1c79-4ad6-8d60-f0383ad4065a\', \'multiverseId\': 589318}, \'multiverseid\': 589318}, {\'name\': \'名誉回復\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「奴らがクルーグに見せた慈悲を返してやれ。」\\n――飛行機械の操縦士、ガイヴァン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c35dbaa-7326-4aee-9086-4dcdcec39a42\', \'multiverseId\': 589462}, \'multiverseid\': 589462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Servo-Bauplan\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Servo-Bauplan ins Spiel kommt oder aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Konsulat schätzt Erfindungen, die zuverlässig sind und sich reproduzieren lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c082519f-b397-4ad7-8265-0e4a577b333a\', \'multiverseId\': 588913}, \'multiverseid\': 588913}, {\'name\': \'Boceto de servo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Boceto de servo entre al campo de batalla o vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Servo incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Consulado recompensa la innovación cuando es fiable y reproducible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d01be7a1-7e0e-4072-ab67-cc6bc7bf851c\', \'multiverseId\': 589057}, \'multiverseid\': 589057}, {\'name\': \'Schéma de servo\', \'text\': "Quand le Schéma de servo arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le Consulat attache beaucoup de valeur à l\'innovation quand elle est fiable et reproductible.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf733153-386a-4414-8e84-089f9af51e96\', \'multiverseId\': 589201}, \'multiverseid\': 589201}, {\'name\': \'Progetto di Servomeccanismo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Progetto di Servomeccanismo entra nel campo di battaglia o viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il Consolato apprezza l\'innovazione quando è affidabile e riproducibile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b4a373-365f-4d48-891e-50c921ec6036\', \'multiverseId\': 589345}, \'multiverseid\': 589345}, {\'name\': \'霊気装置の設計図\', \'text\': \'霊気装置の設計図が戦場に出たか戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'信頼できる複製可能な発明を、領事府は報奨する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abdfa62b-3bae-4ac2-a8cf-b280bad9f9dd\', \'multiverseId\': 589489}, \'multiverseid\': 589489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sharuum, Sphinx-Hegemon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn Sharuum, Sphinx-Hegemon, ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Um eine Audienz beim Hegemonen zu erhalten, muss man ein Rätsel mitbringen, das dieser noch nicht kennt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588883&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc6e2fce-797a-41bc-b3b9-67f539fd5ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 588883}, \'multiverseid\': 588883}, {\'name\': \'Sharuum la Hegemón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando Sharuum la Hegemón entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Para obtener una audiencia con la hegemón, debes traerle un acertijo que no haya escuchado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34ac3f3e-1ba9-45e2-8f73-94fd6a335b23\', \'multiverseId\': 589027}, \'multiverseid\': 589027}, {\'name\': "Sharuûm l\'Hégémon", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand Sharuûm l\'Hégémon arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Pour obtenir audience avec l\'Hégémon, il faut pouvoir lui présenter une énigme qu\'elle n\'a jamais entendue auparavant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d84aa2b0-2d5a-44ff-bf4e-3d0db1626f05\', \'multiverseId\': 589171}, \'multiverseid\': 589171}, {\'name\': "Sharuum l\'Egemone", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando Sharuum l\'Egemone entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': "Perché l\'egemone dia udienza, si deve proporre un enigma che non abbia mai sentito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee5f8e0-6846-4044-ad4a-bc98c8473a31\', \'multiverseId\': 589315}, \'multiverseid\': 589315}, {\'name\': \'覇者シャルム\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n覇者シャルムが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'教義を授かるためには、彼女の知らない謎を聞かせなければならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429d59ef-0739-4e59-b0a0-d2dc41b2db7f\', \'multiverseId\': 589459}, \'multiverseid\': 589459}]', "[{'name': 'Sich entfaltende Wildnis', 'text': '{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Ohne den störenden Einfluss der Zivilisation wird sich die Natur immer nach dem eigenen Bedarf formen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588939&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5375d316-40ce-4e64-a5eb-446ee9eafb04', 'multiverseId': 588939}, 'multiverseid': 588939}]", '[{\'name\': \'Silas Renn, Meistersucher\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn Silas Renn, Meistersucher, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Du kannst die Karte in diesem Zug wirken.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'700abecd-bb0f-41a3-bc36-d1dcbff67cce\', \'multiverseId\': 588884}, \'multiverseid\': 588884}, {\'name\': \'Silas Renn, buscador experto\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que Silas Renn, buscador experto haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige la carta de artefacto objetivo en tu cementerio. Puedes lanzar esa carta este turno.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad938c8-7767-4bfd-a009-dec5d75426d4\', \'multiverseId\': 589028}, \'multiverseid\': 589028}, {\'name\': \'Silas Renn, expert chercheur\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que Silas Renn, expert chercheur inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez une carte d\'artefact ciblée dans votre cimetière. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte ce tour-ci.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac68b7bb-98f3-4921-9d54-a05e06d859d2\', \'multiverseId\': 589172}, \'multiverseid\': 589172}, {\'name\': \'Silas Renn, Esperto Cercatore\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta Silas Renn, Esperto Cercatore infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, scegli una carta artefatto bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Puoi lanciare quella carta in questo turno.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de44ca1-64c6-45f1-a9f3-c46ada801ab4\', \'multiverseId\': 589316}, \'multiverseid\': 589316}, {\'name\': \'求道の達人、サイラス・レン\', \'text\': \'接死\\n求道の達人、サイラス・レンがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。このターン、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは統率者２体を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b61fc1-93a3-4c12-a3fa-c6f388e32df3\', \'multiverseId\': 589460}, \'multiverseid\': 589460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silberkliffbrücke\', \'text\': \'Die Silberkliffbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUnzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Weg zum Genie wird in der Kreativität geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e32f22-58a3-486d-bfb5-b513698ebb38\', \'multiverseId\': 588955}, \'multiverseid\': 588955}, {\'name\': \'Puente riscosplateados\', \'text\': \'El Puente riscosplateados entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nIndestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El camino a la genialidad se forja con creatividad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ca0dce-edb1-4fe3-a330-18735ced16e0\', \'multiverseId\': 589099}, \'multiverseid\': 589099}, {\'name\': "Pont d\'Argefalaise", \'text\': "Le Pont d\'Argefalaise arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nIndestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Le chemin du génie est forgé dans la créativité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6386724a-7eb7-4e9c-beca-b15a09d29a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 589243}, \'multiverseid\': 589243}, {\'name\': \'Ponte di Scogliargento\', \'text\': \'Il Ponte di Scogliargento entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIndistruttibile\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il cammino verso il genio è forgiato nella creatività.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6e6ce8e-f240-4e7e-956b-77a12dacbfb6\', \'multiverseId\': 589387}, \'multiverseid\': 589387}, {\'name\': \'銀色険の橋\', \'text\': \'銀色険の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n破壊不能\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'異才へと至る道は独創によって築かれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db4a35e-d912-46a3-b4e6-2f6bf270b7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 589531}, \'multiverseid\': 589531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sitz der Synode\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die überragende Schönheit und Macht der Wasserfälle bei Orleason haben die größten Träumer des Reiches inspiriert."\\n—*Untergang der Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1aba0f-55f6-4ec9-a65c-66eb3ec50649\', \'multiverseId\': 588953}, \'multiverseid\': 588953}, {\'name\': \'Sede del sínodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Desbordantes de belleza y poder, las cascadas de Orlison inspiraron a los mayores soñadores del imperio".\\n—*Caída de los thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84ebc9ff-ca09-4e82-b216-a724b766adae\', \'multiverseId\': 589097}, \'multiverseid\': 589097}, {\'name\': \'Siège du Synode\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Majestueuses et puissantes, les chutes d\'Orleason ont inspiré les plus grands rêveurs de l\'empire. »\\n—*Chute de l\'empire thran*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589241&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4af18d1-7501-4f1f-ba8b-918f54f0a01e\', \'multiverseId\': 589241}, \'multiverseid\': 589241}, {\'name\': \'Sede del Sinodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'immensa bellezza e potenza delle cascate di Orleason sono fonte di ispirazione per i più grandi sognatori dell\\\'impero."\\n—*Caduta dei Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69571956-ebd9-4985-b386-3b90d0b70e03\', \'multiverseId\': 589385}, \'multiverseid\': 589385}, {\'name\': \'教議会の座席\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'「壮大なる美と力強さを湛えたオルレアソンの滝が、帝国の偉大なる空想家たちを掻き立てた。」\\n――*スランの崩落*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49a1f609-13c4-46fe-9963-2afaae267038\', \'multiverseId\': 589529}, \'multiverseid\': 589529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Slobad, Goblin-Kesselflicker\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Artefakt: Ein Artefakt deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich pflegte zu sagen, dass er verbannt wurde, weil er zu klug war. Jetzt weiß ich, warum er nie lachte."\\n—Glissa Sonnensucher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55eb8d62-c3f5-4b37-a82b-8cbe77241cea\', \'multiverseId\': 588873}, \'multiverseid\': 588873}, {\'name\': \'Slobad, chapucero trasgo\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un artefacto: El artefacto objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Solía bromear diciendo que lo habían exiliado por ser demasiado listo. Ahora sé por qué nunca le causó gracia".\\n—Glissa Buscasol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6702c5ce-1738-437a-bc03-0da9e241218c\', \'multiverseId\': 589017}, \'multiverseid\': 589017}, {\'name\': \'Slobad, rétameur gobelin\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez un artefact : Un artefact ciblé acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Je lui disais toujours, en plaisantant, qu\'il avait été exilé parce qu\'il était trop intelligent. Je sais maintenant pourquoi cela ne le faisait pas rire. »\\n—Glissa Cherchesoleil", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a23d9da-80ed-4ca0-bf88-b301966b9ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 589161}, \'multiverseid\': 589161}, {\'name\': \'Slobad, Riparatore Goblin\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica un artefatto: Un artefatto bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ho sempre preso in giro dicendo che lo avevano esiliato perché era troppo intelligente. Adesso capisco perché non ha mai riso."\\n—Glissa Sunseeker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad1dc38-8533-48d5-9f78-fa75c494b7ec\', \'multiverseId\': 589305}, \'multiverseid\': 589305}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの修繕屋スロバッド\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「以前は、彼が賢すぎたから追放されたんだなんて、冗談で言ってたわ。やっと彼が笑わなかった理由がわかったわね。」\\n――グリッサ・サンシーカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb2a6e03-52fa-43e5-a3fa-922df7ce4d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 589449}, \'multiverseid\': 589449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35adde16-44c9-45e0-85db-5e48a21a21be\', \'multiverseId\': 588915}, \'multiverseid\': 588915}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce854a6a-7bb6-4efb-9afa-1daaebed419d\', \'multiverseId\': 589059}, \'multiverseid\': 589059}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fc1c7a-6bc4-451b-a0ac-5a186d4f5ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 589203}, \'multiverseid\': 589203}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ade913-fa33-4923-89a9-852268fdfd35\', \'multiverseId\': 589347}, \'multiverseid\': 589347}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc729401-50f7-4fbe-bc05-931460a13f45\', \'multiverseId\': 589491}, \'multiverseid\': 589491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d058785-f279-4212-aa0a-412342fa47be\', \'multiverseId\': 588890}, \'multiverseid\': 588890}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bf10bff-952d-4a65-a4d8-ca01dcaaa2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 589034}, \'multiverseid\': 589034}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be345e08-4360-4829-8ddb-2f6f4b693b94\', \'multiverseId\': 589178}, \'multiverseid\': 589178}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b36ad2-464c-44b7-8ddc-06f245dfc6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 589322}, \'multiverseid\': 589322}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c841a5e-5781-4f2b-a84e-6e7b5ef34631\', \'multiverseId\': 589466}, \'multiverseid\': 589466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spiegelwerk\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderes Nichtspielsteinartefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des Artefakts ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gesichter von Geths Leichenzerrern ähneln sich verblüffend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89d68647-817c-47f8-98f7-682969c12228\', \'multiverseId\': 588904}, \'multiverseid\': 588904}, {\'name\': \'Espejería\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro artefacto que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha que es una copia de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los rostros de los dragadores de cuerpos de Geth son perturbadoramente similares.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5656617-7f31-42a7-899b-8e2f7724484c\', \'multiverseId\': 589048}, \'multiverseid\': 589048}, {\'name\': \'Chantier de miroirs\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre artefact non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les visages des dragueurs de cadavres de Geth sont étrangement familiers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70382f46-82e3-4763-987c-be08b2b96031\', \'multiverseId\': 589192}, \'multiverseid\': 589192}, {\'name\': \'Congegno Specchiante\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un altro artefatto non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Le facce dei draga-cadaveri di Geth presentano una somiglianza inquietante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a328d178-1d0e-4c85-b4c8-66c8c012ccc2\', \'multiverseId\': 589336}, \'multiverseid\': 589336}, {\'name\': \'鏡操り\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないアーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのアーティファクトのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ゲスの死体浚いの顔は気味悪いほど互いに似ている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54555be2-cd59-4d91-a7d5-1454eef9b181\', \'multiverseId\': 589480}, \'multiverseid\': 589480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Splitter-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du einen 1/1 blauen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Ob es mechanischen oder biologischen Ursprungs ist, das Leben findet immer ein Mittel, um sich fortzupflanzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7c5e33-aa35-4156-a051-b99e5341e533\', \'multiverseId\': 588849}, \'multiverseid\': 588849}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge fragmentadora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura artefacto que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes crear una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Ya sea mecánica o biológica, la vida encuentra maneras de autopropagarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55b84512-d828-43b4-8fd3-8623a718de00\', \'multiverseId\': 588993}, \'multiverseid\': 588993}, {\'name\': \'Sphinge écailleuse\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 bleue Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Mécanique ou biologique, la vie trouve toujours le moyen de se propager.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca493f25-7d88-45bd-932f-0c5db7e9929a\', \'multiverseId\': 589137}, \'multiverseid\': 589137}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Frammentata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura artefatto che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi creare una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Che sia meccanica o biologica, la vita trova sempre il modo di propagarsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fffcd05-9a55-400a-9f40-2c707d4b25a1\', \'multiverseId\': 589281}, \'multiverseid\': 589281}, {\'name\': \'破片撒きのスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは飛行を持つ青の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'機械だろうと生物だろうと、生命というものは増殖の道を見つけるものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8da6c51-e33b-4f14-9883-9ea654ac7f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 589425}, \'multiverseid\': 589425}]', "[{'name': 'Stab der Titania', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Wäldern ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Wald-Dryade-Landkreaturenspielstein. _(Er ist von Einsatzverzögerung betroffen.)_\\nAusrüsten {3}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588516&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa7deb2e-3d0e-4949-aa7b-090db76f26cd', 'multiverseId': 588516}, 'multiverseid': 588516}]", '[{\'name\': \'Stachel aus Ish Sah\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Stachel aus Ish Sah ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\\nWenn der Stachel aus Ish Sah aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Stachel aus Ish Sah auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588917&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21abb67-62f8-4f8e-b17b-4a206a88e67d\', \'multiverseId\': 588917}, \'multiverseid\': 588917}, {\'name\': \'Espina de Ish Sah\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Espina de Ish Sah entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo.\\nCuando la Espina de Ish Sah vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa la Espina de Ish Sah a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861d6d4e-10ac-4afb-8949-1fb5176d0686\', \'multiverseId\': 589061}, \'multiverseid\': 589061}, {\'name\': "Échine d\'Ish Sah", \'text\': "Quand l\'Échine d\'Ish Sah arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un permanent ciblé.\\nQuand l\'Échine d\'Ish Sah est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez l\'Échine d\'Ish Sah dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c093470-0d1c-45ce-874d-0034e702f5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 589205}, \'multiverseid\': 589205}, {\'name\': \'Spina di Ish Sah\', \'text\': \'Quando la Spina di Ish Sah entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\\nQuando la Spina di Ish Sah viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, falla tornare in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b746615-a7fd-4456-81e2-7a45ce0e1596\', \'multiverseId\': 589349}, \'multiverseid\': 589349}, {\'name\': \'イシュ・サーの背骨\', \'text\': \'イシュ・サーの背骨が戦場に出たとき、パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nイシュ・サーの背骨が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、イシュ・サーの背骨をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b079cfd-9ab3-43de-a6e8-ea334c891928\', \'multiverseId\': 589493}, \'multiverseid\': 589493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Streben nach Wissen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten. Wirf dann zwei Karten ab, es sei denn, du wirfst eine Artefaktkarte ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist die universelle Währung des Multiversums. Es ist Macht. Es ist Freiheit. Es ist der Inbegriff der Möglichkeit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5379778e-4388-4c21-b526-cc21686f946b\', \'multiverseId\': 588851}, \'multiverseid\': 588851}, {\'name\': \'Sed de conocimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas. Luego descarta dos cartas a menos que descartes una carta de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El conocimiento es la divisa universal del Multiverso. Es poder, libertad y una infinidad de posibilidades".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1082c5e4-8296-4457-866c-be00e57238dc\', \'multiverseId\': 588995}, \'multiverseid\': 588995}, {\'name\': \'Soif de connaissance\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes. Défaussez-vous ensuite de deux cartes à moins que vous ne vous défaussiez d\'une carte d\'artefact.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le savoir est la devise universelle du Multivers. C\'est le pouvoir. C\'est la liberté. C\'est la probabilité incarnée. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb67500-573f-4cc5-96c0-91c27c39211c\', \'multiverseId\': 589139}, \'multiverseid\': 589139}, {\'name\': \'Sete di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte. Poi scarta due carte a meno che non scarti una carta artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La conoscenza è la valuta universale del Multiverso. È potere. È libertà. È possibilità allo stato puro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06b7856e-31a4-43b2-b161-d5dc7b9de8f2\', \'multiverseId\': 589283}, \'multiverseid\': 589283}, {\'name\': \'知識の渇望\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。その後、あなたがアーティファクト・カード１枚を捨てないかぎり、カード２枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「知識こそが多元宇宙の共通の通貨である。それは力であり、自由でもある。そして、可能性そのものなのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3798906f-f767-4958-a218-fd2ab1b75c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 589427}, \'multiverseid\': 589427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Strionischer Resonator\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Kopiere eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. (Ausgelöste Fähigkeiten verwenden die Begriffe „wenn", „immer wenn" oder „zu Beginn".)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Niemand wusste, was das Relikt bewirkte, man bemerkte nur, dass es lauter wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63387c21-d668-4fc9-b55c-bfd2d3415703\', \'multiverseId\': 588920}, \'multiverseid\': 588920}, {\'name\': \'Resonador estriónico\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Copia la habilidad disparada objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia. (Una habilidad disparada usa las palabras "cuando", "siempre que" o "al".)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Nadie sabía para qué servía la reliquia, tan solo que el sonido que producía era cada vez mayor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bf75ed-d419-4183-87e5-deace8352b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 589064}, \'multiverseid\': 589064}, {\'name\': \'Résonateur strionique\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T} : Copiez une capacité déclenchée ciblée que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. (Une capacité déclenchée utilise les mots « quand », « à chaque fois » ou « au/à la »).\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Personne ne savait à quoi servait la relique, mais elle faisait de plus en plus de bruit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6100b02b-a266-42c0-8b05-fc559297d5a3\', \'multiverseId\': 589208}, \'multiverseid\': 589208}, {\'name\': \'Risonatore Strionico\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Copia un\\\'abilità innescata bersaglio che controlli. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia. (Un\\\'abilità innescata inizia con le parole "quando", "ogniqualvolta" o "all\\\'inizio di".)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Nessuno conosceva il funzionamento della reliquia, solo che il suo suono diventava sempre più forte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cea039e-c9c4-4655-b3c1-78e164d428db\', \'multiverseId\': 589352}, \'multiverseid\': 589352}, {\'name\': \'ストリオン共鳴体\', \'text\': \'{2},{T}：あなたがコントロールしている誘発型能力１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。（誘発型能力には「～とき」、「～たび」、「～時に」のいずれかが書かれている。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その遺物が何の役割をはたしているのかは誰も知らなかった。音が増幅していることを除いて。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'944b8479-6c3b-4ee9-b808-8d6a4ff42cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 589496}, \'multiverseid\': 589496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stählerner Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}: Der Stählerne Höllendrache erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{X}: Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag X, die kein Land ist und deren Beherrscher in diesem Zug vom Stählernen Höllendrachen Kampfschaden zugefügt wurde. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d33bf0e-09ce-459e-b4cc-7de627f51807\', \'multiverseId\': 588918}, \'multiverseid\': 588918}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de acero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}: El Engendro de acero obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{X}: Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de X cuyo controlador haya recibido daño de combate del Engendro de acero este turno. Activa esto solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccee93d-95e0-4705-868c-bacda626307d\', \'multiverseId\': 589062}, \'multiverseid\': 589062}, {\'name\': "Escouflenfer d\'acier", \'text\': "Vol\\n{2} : L\'Escouflenfer d\'acier gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{X} : Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain avec une valeur de mana de X dont le contrôleur a subi des blessures de combat par l\'Escouflenfer d\'acier ce tour-ci. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'835c7e89-746f-437e-8955-12ea32aaa606\', \'multiverseId\': 589206}, \'multiverseid\': 589206}, {\'name\': "Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio", \'text\': "Volare\\n{2}: Il Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{X}: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con valore di mana pari a X al cui controllore è stato inflitto danno da combattimento dal Nibbio Infernale d\'Acciaio in questo turno. Attiva solo una volta per turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53525d7-fee8-47d5-bbb2-8fca2f194559\', \'multiverseId\': 589350}, \'multiverseid\': 589350}, {\'name\': \'鋼のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、鋼のヘルカイトは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{X}：このターンに鋼のヘルカイトから戦闘ダメージを受けたプレイヤーがコントロールしていてマナ総量がＸであり土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f9bd8a0-c7e7-44ca-8af5-b2ea687e3e19\', \'multiverseId\': 589494}, \'multiverseid\': 589494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tawnos, erhabener Überlebender\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von bis zu einem Artefaktspielstein deiner Wahl ist, den du kontrollierst. Du millst zwei Karten.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, opfere zwei Artefaktspielsteine, schicke eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd10f841-fed9-49bc-9154-62368d6c0519\', \'multiverseId\': 588380}, \'multiverseid\': 588380}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, superviviente solemne\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de hasta una ficha de artefacto objetivo que controlas. Muele dos cartas.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrificar dos fichas de artefacto, exiliar una carta de artefacto o de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de la carta exiliada, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9132413c-caf8-4d8a-a4ac-176315f731ee\', \'multiverseId\': 588382}, \'multiverseid\': 588382}, {\'name\': \'Tavnos, survivant solennel\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de jusqu\'à un jeton d\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez. Meulez deux cartes.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez deux jetons d\'artefact, exilez une carte d\'artefact ou de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la carte exilée, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffedbce-7f82-4096-aa5a-46ff3f009a27\', \'multiverseId\': 588384}, \'multiverseid\': 588384}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, Sopravvissuto Solenne\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di fino a una pedina artefatto bersaglio che controlli. Macina due carte.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica due pedine artefatto, Esilia una carta artefatto o creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta esiliata, tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03bc266d-d533-4c86-b52a-55660d935bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 588386}, \'multiverseid\': 588386}, {\'name\': \'謹厳な生存者、タウノス\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・トークン最大１つを対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。カード２枚を切削する。\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, アーティファクト・トークン２つを生け贄に捧げる, あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を追放する：他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除き、その追放されたカードのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8139921-4907-4b6b-896c-acdd80106331\', \'multiverseId\': 588388}, \'multiverseid\': 588388}, {\'name\': \'Tawnos, Sobrevivente Soturno\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de até uma ficha de artefato alvo que você controla. Triture dois cards.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrifique duas fichas de artefato, exile um card de artefato ou criatura de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia do card exilado, exceto por ser um artefato além de seus outros tipos. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'064a7246-733b-4902-bd0e-089016893019\', \'multiverseId\': 588392}, \'multiverseid\': 588392}, {\'name\': \'肃穆幸存者达硌士\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为至多一个目标由你操控之衍生神器的复制品。磨两张牌。\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}，{T}，牺牲两个衍生神器，从你的坟墓场放逐一张神器或生物牌：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为所放逐之牌的复制品，但它额外具有神器此类别。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'995e6f5d-cfb6-4121-bc65-b54db0c3c9ba\', \'multiverseId\': 588396}, \'multiverseid\': 588396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tawnos, erhabener Überlebender\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von bis zu einem Artefaktspielstein deiner Wahl ist, den du kontrollierst. Du millst zwei Karten.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, opfere zwei Artefaktspielsteine, schicke eine Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ins Exil geschickten Karte ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen ein Artefakt ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e01b4c1-6c0f-47ca-877f-e4e2a5c5d348\', \'multiverseId\': 588508}, \'multiverseid\': 588508}, {\'name\': \'Tavnos, survivant solennel\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de jusqu\'à un jeton d\'artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez. Meulez deux cartes.\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez deux jetons d\'artefact, exilez une carte d\'artefact ou de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la carte exilée, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de59c96-35ba-4404-828c-ce21737d6a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 588519}, \'multiverseid\': 588519}, {\'name\': \'謹厳な生存者、タウノス\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・トークン最大１つを対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。カード２枚を切削する。\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}, {T}, アーティファクト・トークン２つを生け贄に捧げる, あなたの墓地にありアーティファクトやクリーチャーであるカード１枚を追放する：他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトであることを除き、その追放されたカードのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8a88ac-167d-4057-8f34-50703505e267\', \'multiverseId\': 588530}, \'multiverseid\': 588530}, {\'name\': \'肃穆幸存者达硌士\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为至多一个目标由你操控之衍生神器的复制品。磨两张牌。\\n{1}{W}{U}{B}，{T}，牺牲两个衍生神器，从你的坟墓场放逐一张神器或生物牌：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为所放逐之牌的复制品，但它额外具有神器此类别。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a190c5-1357-46a7-9739-4bd2877cf233\', \'multiverseId\': 588541}, \'multiverseid\': 588541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der Bosheit\', \'text\': \'Der Tempel der Bosheit kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Bosheit ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb5dcf5-014a-47c9-a7f9-ee1bcf7b2983\', \'multiverseId\': 588963}, \'multiverseid\': 588963}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la malicia\', \'text\': \'El Templo de la malicia entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la malicia entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e87559b0-161a-420f-8b60-0f4b0a536e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 589107}, \'multiverseid\': 589107}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la malice\', \'text\': \'Le Temple de la malice arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la malice arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589251&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ce414c-2bb3-4bae-b8c7-8b58abf14de8\', \'multiverseId\': 589251}, \'multiverseid\': 589251}, {\'name\': "Tempio dell\'Odio", \'text\': "Il Tempio dell\'Odio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio dell\'Odio entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c7ae37-7a74-4a04-894a-3a14fd356e64\', \'multiverseId\': 589395}, \'multiverseid\': 589395}, {\'name\': \'悪意の神殿\', \'text\': \'悪意の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n悪意の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf89f6b-06f9-426c-a1f8-882abbd4a9eb\', \'multiverseId\': 589539}, \'multiverseid\': 589539}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel der Eingebung', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Eingebung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Eingebung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588962&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb9cc178-acb0-454e-a163-bf8e615f6da5', 'multiverseId': 588962}, 'multiverseid': 588962}, {'name': 'Templo de la epifanía', 'text': 'El Templo de la epifanía entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la epifanía entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589106&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea431655-6045-4de1-9da9-23a9ffe0e18f', 'multiverseId': 589106}, 'multiverseid': 589106}, {'name': 'Temple de la révélation', 'text': 'Le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589250&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bec38226-00b7-4069-ad47-fc2203cf766d', 'multiverseId': 589250}, 'multiverseid': 589250}, {'name': 'Tempio della Rivelazione', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589394&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d2c723a-b4cc-4ebb-a450-2d9a5bc7f648', 'multiverseId': 589394}, 'multiverseid': 589394}, {'name': '天啓の神殿', 'text': '天啓の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n天啓の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589538&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5661823-9ff0-4bc7-8305-32f3f416c6f7', 'multiverseId': 589538}, 'multiverseid': 589538}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der Erleuchtung\', \'text\': \'Der Tempel der Erleuchtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Erleuchtung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2397dc1c-77d0-417f-b5c5-9bc97e3c4fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 588961}, \'multiverseid\': 588961}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la iluminación\', \'text\': \'El Templo de la iluminación entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la iluminación entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea24c5c-262f-4105-b873-82ffe780c6b9\', \'multiverseId\': 589105}, \'multiverseid\': 589105}, {\'name\': "Temple de l\'illumination", \'text\': "Le Temple de l\'illumination arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de l\'illumination arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9967979a-268f-4c71-8d88-85f5a2f6bdc4\', \'multiverseId\': 589249}, \'multiverseid\': 589249}, {\'name\': "Tempio dell\'Illuminazione", \'text\': "Il Tempio dell\'Illuminazione entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio dell\'Illuminazione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f980c1-47b6-4861-af00-3bb3b02c62ff\', \'multiverseId\': 589393}, \'multiverseid\': 589393}, {\'name\': \'啓蒙の神殿\', \'text\': \'啓蒙の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n啓蒙の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4ca715-2e66-4266-a4c8-ec4e4da1992e\', \'multiverseId\': 589537}, \'multiverseid\': 589537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der Täuschung\', \'text\': \'Der Tempel der Täuschung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Täuschung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b14063-8481-4b88-9b73-e783c6bcc098\', \'multiverseId\': 588960}, \'multiverseid\': 588960}, {\'name\': \'Templo del engaño\', \'text\': \'El Templo del engaño entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del engaño entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f881add3-002a-4e66-a27d-5c7206fe8755\', \'multiverseId\': 589104}, \'multiverseid\': 589104}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la tromperie\', \'text\': \'Le Temple de la tromperie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la tromperie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a27163-d3f4-47f5-82f3-8c256d9e324d\', \'multiverseId\': 589248}, \'multiverseid\': 589248}, {\'name\': "Tempio dell\'Inganno", \'text\': "Il Tempio dell\'Inganno entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio dell\'Inganno entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a5d4a4-046d-41a0-b2b8-e7a4100ae8d8\', \'multiverseId\': 589392}, \'multiverseid\': 589392}, {\'name\': \'欺瞞の神殿\', \'text\': \'欺瞞の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n欺瞞の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb108223-7f4c-448e-a4dd-dd336bdd6400\', \'multiverseId\': 589536}, \'multiverseid\': 589536}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel des Schweigens', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Schweigens kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588964&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '302cd8f0-ad81-4e4c-b5a6-bdf517e34bca', 'multiverseId': 588964}, 'multiverseid': 588964}, {'name': 'Templo del silencio', 'text': 'El Templo del silencio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del silencio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589108&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8b156e2-f85e-4cbe-b76d-b91c60d8c53a', 'multiverseId': 589108}, 'multiverseid': 589108}, {'name': 'Temple du silence', 'text': 'Le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589252&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43127ba4-dd62-4239-bd68-f5adfad1d3f6', 'multiverseId': 589252}, 'multiverseid': 589252}, {'name': 'Tempio del Silenzio', 'text': 'Il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio del Silenzio entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589396&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16d8450f-a6fe-44d0-b010-ea49624adcb9', 'multiverseId': 589396}, 'multiverseid': 589396}, {'name': '静寂の神殿', 'text': '静寂の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n静寂の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589540&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f229cbbc-a426-41e5-adb1-338798a64bfd', 'multiverseId': 589540}, 'multiverseid': 589540}]", '[{\'name\': \'Teshar, Apostel der Ahnfrau\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen historischen Zauberspruch wirkst, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ahnfrau hat uns nicht ohne Grund gerettet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588832&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da697cc-1191-4c29-be6c-a62cf0ca0ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 588832}, \'multiverseid\': 588832}, {\'name\': \'Teshar, apóstol de la Antepasada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo histórico, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': \'"La Antepasada nos salvó con un propósito".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edcb5134-1f05-46a4-8e36-b8c9fd34bf88\', \'multiverseId\': 588976}, \'multiverseid\': 588976}, {\'name\': "Teshar, apôtre de l\'Ancêtre", \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort historique, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques.)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« L\'Ancêtre nous a sauvés pour une raison. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fef6fa-24ce-448c-839e-0e6d941b9b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 589120}, \'multiverseid\': 589120}, {\'name\': "Teshar, Apostolo dell\'Antenata", \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia storica, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'Antenata ci salvò per uno scopo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16280c1b-c298-4cf7-a93f-0ec15272fc43\', \'multiverseId\': 589264}, \'multiverseid\': 589264}, {\'name\': \'祖神の使徒、テシャール\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが歴史的な呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。（歴史的とは、アーティファクトや伝説や英雄譚のことである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「祖神様が我らをお救いくださるのには理由がある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143a6099-1f52-40c7-87de-464a7d694d65\', \'multiverseId\': 589408}, \'multiverseid\': 589408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopter-Spionagenetz\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c33fc2e-a017-479d-96c2-aa606a95abbf\', \'multiverseId\': 588852}, \'multiverseid\': 588852}, {\'name\': \'Red de espionaje tóptera\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas un artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas artefacto que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df916414-853b-464e-bd5e-d7039daddaeb\', \'multiverseId\': 588996}, \'multiverseid\': 588996}, {\'name\': \'Réseau de mécanoptères espions\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez un artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec582a5-9b96-4e6f-8603-258e60039a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 589140}, \'multiverseid\': 589140}, {\'name\': \'Rete di Totteri Spia\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli un artefatto, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa950b68-b4b1-46a1-a28f-5e35beb23b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 589284}, \'multiverseid\': 589284}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械の諜報網\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad2b567-0623-4572-b7dc-a384e610f4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 589428}, \'multiverseid\': 589428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopterwerkstatt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, sterben, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Thopter wurde nach einer Eilreparatur in den Kampf zurückgeschickt — auf dem Sitz lag das noch warme Mittagessen des Mechanikers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588430&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0192d7c-4bcc-4501-b89d-dc5958c2aee3\', \'multiverseId\': 588430}, \'multiverseid\': 588430}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica de tópteros\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas artefacto que controlas mueran, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un día hubo una reparación tan urgente que se mandó un tóptero de vuelta al combate con el almuerzo caliente de un mecánico en el asiento del artillero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62798ad0-f35f-4035-9f02-7be2e135859b\', \'multiverseId\': 588446}, \'multiverseid\': 588446}, {\'name\': \'Atelier de mécanoptères\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez meurt, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\n{2}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Une fois, après des réparations précipitées, un mécanoptère fut renvoyé au front avec le repas encore chaud d\'un mécanicien sur le siège du canonnier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48843638-2685-4382-b1ad-ff097599ca1e\', \'multiverseId\': 588462}, \'multiverseid\': 588462}, {\'name\': \'Officina dei Totteri\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature artefatto che controlli muoiono, pesca una carta. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Una volta, dopo una riparazione frettolosa, un tottero tornò in battaglia con il pranzo del meccanico ancora caldo al posto del mitragliere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a6c176-8caa-4c38-85d5-8262935bf236\', \'multiverseId\': 588478}, \'multiverseid\': 588478}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械の整備場\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーが死亡するたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n{2}{W}, {T}：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'大急ぎの修理をした挙句、砲手の席にまだ温かい昼食を置いたまま飛行機械を戦場に送り返したことがあった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9d11f6-a28c-47c2-8517-ca6593273f41\', \'multiverseId\': 588494}, \'multiverseid\': 588494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thopterwerkstatt\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, sterben, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f86c762-f1fc-4992-b53d-c4c3abd0a75c\', \'multiverseId\': 588581}, \'multiverseid\': 588581}, {\'name\': \'Atelier de mécanoptères\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature-artefact que vous contrôlez meurt, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\n{2}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4779529f-80ed-4814-ac9b-801b1c922a34\', \'multiverseId\': 588597}, \'multiverseid\': 588597}, {\'name\': \'飛行機械の整備場\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のアーティファクト・クリーチャーが死亡するたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n{2}{W}, {T}：飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d18568a0-3a1c-4627-b0c1-357f95897d01\', \'multiverseId\': 588613}, \'multiverseid\': 588613}, {\'name\': \'振翼机工坊\', \'text\': \'每当由你操控的一个或数个神器生物死去时，抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\\n{2}{W}，{T}：派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32569744-1d09-4895-a23c-8ff78002d638\', \'multiverseId\': 588629}, \'multiverseid\': 588629}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thrandynamo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Urzas Metathran-Kinder wurden von einem komplexen System von Maschinen gezeugt, geboren und großgezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7218466a-4bb0-4642-82e1-23a78f3ab0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 588923}, \'multiverseid\': 588923}, {\'name\': \'Dínamo thran\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los hijos metathran de Urza fueron concebidos, alumbrados y alimentados por un sistema integrado de máquinas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8503d6f8-7f92-4f0a-9aeb-af7c5335bb09\', \'multiverseId\': 589067}, \'multiverseid\': 589067}, {\'name\': \'Dynamo thran\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les enfants métathrans d\'Urza furent conçus, produits et nourris par un étonnant ensemble de machines.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b274caac-bbb1-431b-923f-c74d41d72af9\', \'multiverseId\': 589211}, \'multiverseid\': 589211}, {\'name\': \'Dinamo Thran\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I metathran di Urza sono stati concepiti, partoriti e svezzati da un sistema integrato di macchine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e42ca47-e820-4382-aadd-28a958f989c3\', \'multiverseId\': 589355}, \'multiverseid\': 589355}, {\'name\': \'スランの発電機\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザのメタスランの子供たちは、効果的に連結された機械システムによって受精され、産み落とされ、養育されていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'052a0c81-e40f-4db5-a5fa-cc3301fbec17\', \'multiverseId\': 589499}, \'multiverseid\': 589499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titania, Kraft der Natur\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Wälder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nImmer wenn ein Wald unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/3 grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn ein Elementarwesen, das du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du drei Karten millen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586475&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf647eb1-f8d2-49b7-896b-bd973f7256e0\', \'multiverseId\': 586475}, \'multiverseid\': 586475}, {\'name\': \'Titania, Fuerza de la Naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar Bosques desde tu cementerio.\\nSiempre que un Bosque entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental verde 5/3.\\nSiempre que un Elemental que controlas muera, puedes moler tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a236e3d-5ffa-4f24-96a0-cf00d3027c23\', \'multiverseId\': 586483}, \'multiverseid\': 586483}, {\'name\': \'Titania, force de la nature\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez jouer des forêts depuis votre cimetière.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une forêt arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 5/3 verte Élémental.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un élémental que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez meuler trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f0ef37-7039-401e-bf34-d5dcc7a858bc\', \'multiverseId\': 586491}, \'multiverseid\': 586491}, {\'name\': \'Titania, Potenza della Natura\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare Foreste dal tuo cimitero.\\nOgniqualvolta una Foresta entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 5/3 verde.\\nOgniqualvolta un Elementale che controlli muore, puoi macinare tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b82d18a4-8f82-4569-bdb3-d9b6ceda73db\', \'multiverseId\': 586499}, \'multiverseid\': 586499}, {\'name\': \'自然の力、ティタニア\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの墓地から森をプレイしてもよい。\\n森１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の５/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているエレメンタル１体が死亡するたび、あなたはカード３枚を切削してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ae6e35-e33d-424b-8905-c07262ce6274\', \'multiverseId\': 586507}, \'multiverseid\': 586507}, {\'name\': \'Titânia, Força da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar Florestas de seu cemitério.\\nToda vez que uma Floresta entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha de criatura Elemental verde 5/3.\\nToda vez que um Elemental que você controla morre, você pode triturar três cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d052409-0fc2-4e0f-ae0b-142e4ec19d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 586523}, \'multiverseid\': 586523}, {\'name\': \'自然之力泰坦尼亚\', \'text\': \'你可以从你的坟墓场中使用树林。\\n每当一个树林在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个5/3绿色元素衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的元素死去时，你可以磨三张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f8a9d1-dadf-48a6-a855-5d4cc6e93ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 586539}, \'multiverseid\': 586539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titania, Kraft der Natur\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Wälder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nImmer wenn ein Wald unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/3 grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn ein Elementarwesen, das du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du drei Karten millen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147e20d3-0b87-48b5-8de2-38c43cb721ae\', \'multiverseId\': 588511}, \'multiverseid\': 588511}, {\'name\': \'Titania, force de la nature\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez jouer des forêts depuis votre cimetière.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une forêt arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 5/3 verte Élémental.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un élémental que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez meuler trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e7f923-9f25-4f36-adf0-196cd0ab4a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 588522}, \'multiverseid\': 588522}, {\'name\': \'自然の力、ティタニア\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの墓地から森をプレイしてもよい。\\n森１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の５/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているエレメンタル１体が死亡するたび、あなたはカード３枚を切削してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48bf46ac-1466-4f24-89f0-ff896070b33d\', \'multiverseId\': 588533}, \'multiverseid\': 588533}, {\'name\': \'自然之力泰坦尼亚\', \'text\': \'你可以从你的坟墓场中使用树林。\\n每当一个树林在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个5/3绿色元素衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的元素死去时，你可以磨三张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e00a1b6-8354-4f1d-ad25-1c2c99e02abc\', \'multiverseId\': 588544}, \'multiverseid\': 588544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todbringender Mechakoloss\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn der Todbringende Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl zerstören. Falls eine Kreatur auf diese Weise zerstört wird, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f023c1-a0f8-4a9a-8339-b1ae9dfbc415\', \'multiverseId\': 588865}, \'multiverseid\': 588865}, {\'name\': \'Mecatitán letal\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando el Mecatitán letal entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir otra criatura objetivo. Si una criatura es destruida de esta manera, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a su resistencia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfb8e05-de86-4449-bc30-e8ca52ec12e4\', \'multiverseId\': 589009}, \'multiverseid\': 589009}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse mécanique délétère\', \'text\': \'Menace\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique délétère arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire une autre créature ciblée. Si une créature est détruite de cette manière, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à son endurance.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5aa7bf-330f-4301-8e6c-5b76e592df4d\', \'multiverseId\': 589153}, \'multiverseid\': 589153}, {\'name\': \'Meccatitano Tossico\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nQuando il Meccatitano Tossico entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere un\'altra creatura bersaglio. Se una creatura viene distrutta in questo modo, guadagni punti vita pari alla sua costituzione.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'511313f4-9b4e-42dc-a6a5-c79f52bff48f\', \'multiverseId\': 589297}, \'multiverseid\': 589297}, {\'name\': \'害悪の機械巨人\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n害悪の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。これによりクリーチャーが破壊されたなら、あなたはそれのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2edcc3c4-c62d-40fd-bcee-8ec450750f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 589441}, \'multiverseid\': 589441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumstein-Polyeder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere das Traumstein-Polyeder: Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nur der Verstand der Eldrazi kann so verworren denken, wie es notwendig ist, um die Polyeder zu öffnen und an die in ihnen eingeschlossene Macht zu gelangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b6eebc2-1a15-4076-a9dc-08394b5ee40c\', \'multiverseId\': 588894}, \'multiverseid\': 588894}, {\'name\': \'Edro piedra del sueño\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro piedra del sueño: Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo la mente de los Eldrazi funciona de la retorcida forma que se requiere para abrir los edros y obtener el poder que hay dentro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d4056a4-13e9-498f-b09b-ebfe6f80de5f\', \'multiverseId\': 589038}, \'multiverseid\': 589038}, {\'name\': \'Hèdron pierre de rêve\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Hèdron pierre de rêve : Piochez trois cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Seul l\'esprit eldrazi est assez tordu pour ouvrir les hèdrons et puiser leur puissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2dac2c-716e-493e-b168-c0b76f6ae9b4\', \'multiverseId\': 589182}, \'multiverseid\': 589182}, {\'name\': \'Edro della Pietra Onirica\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Edro della Pietra Onirica: Pesca tre carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo la mente degli Eldrazi può seguire le linee contorte necessarie ad aprire gli edri e attingere il loro potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6afe8b45-c8d1-4a4d-b434-98b6ca603dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 589326}, \'multiverseid\': 589326}, {\'name\': \'夢石の面晶体\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}{C}を加える。\\n{3},{T},夢石の面晶体を生け贄に捧げる：カード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの精神のみが、面晶体を開きその力を自らの物にするための歪んだ道筋をたどることができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2678ad-183d-446e-828a-d0c902cfe38d\', \'multiverseId\': 589470}, \'multiverseid\': 589470}]', "[{'name': 'Traxos, Plage von Kroog', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nTraxos, Plage von Kroog, kommt getappt ins Spiel und enttappt nicht während deines Enttappsegments.\\nImmer wenn du einen historischen Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe Traxos. (Legenden, Artefakte und Sagen sind historisch.)', 'type': 'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588925&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a509d869-61fc-4bf2-92e6-345b621e76fd', 'multiverseId': 588925}, 'multiverseid': 588925}, {'name': 'Traxos, azote de Kroog', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nTraxos, azote de Kroog entra al campo de batalla girado y no se endereza durante tu paso de enderezar.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo histórico, endereza a Traxos. (Los artefactos, las Sagas y las cartas legendarias son cartas históricas.)', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589069&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18df4953-fe36-483f-aca8-48c59e8bf1f2', 'multiverseId': 589069}, 'multiverseid': 589069}, {'name': 'Traxos, fléau de Kroog', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nTraxos, fléau de Kroog arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé et ne se dégage pas pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort historique, dégagez Traxos. (Les artefacts, les légendaires et les sagas sont historiques.)', 'type': 'Créature-artefact légendaire : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589213&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cf0c94c-37fd-409d-a9f7-e0a3eb253bf4', 'multiverseId': 589213}, 'multiverseid': 589213}, {'name': 'Traxos, Flagello di Kroog', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nTraxos, Flagello di Kroog entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato e non STAPpa durante il tuo STAP.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia storica, STAPpa Traxos. (Artefatti, carte leggendarie e Saghe sono carte storiche.)', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589357&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eeba7b8d-ca2f-4d8d-bde9-36364ab44472', 'multiverseId': 589357}, 'multiverseid': 589357}, {'name': 'クルーグの災い魔、トラクソス', 'text': 'トランプル\\nクルーグの災い魔、トラクソスはタップ状態で戦場に出て、あなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\nあなたが歴史的な呪文を唱えるたび、クルーグの災い魔、トラクソスをアンタップする。（歴史的とは、アーティファクトや伝説や英雄譚のことである。）', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589501&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddfee4bd-c5f5-4a8d-839d-e0b07b41dd70', 'multiverseId': 589501}, 'multiverseid': 589501}]", "[{'name': 'Treuloses Plündern', 'text': 'Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab.\\nRückblende {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588871&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4792370-359c-466a-bfac-cc93a8060fe6', 'multiverseId': 588871}, 'multiverseid': 588871}, {'name': 'Saqueo infiel', 'text': 'Roba dos cartas, luego descarta dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589015&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47162915-b210-459d-bd51-803c865cef6c', 'multiverseId': 589015}, 'multiverseid': 589015}, {'name': 'Pillage sans foi', 'text': 'Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589159&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b604508-d0f7-497f-936c-9f4ca531f819', 'multiverseId': 589159}, 'multiverseid': 589159}, {'name': 'Saccheggio degli Infedeli', 'text': 'Pesca due carte, poi scarta due carte.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589303&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '779ae1e9-b376-4f16-bf9e-52bda49ccb02', 'multiverseId': 589303}, 'multiverseid': 589303}, {'name': '信仰無き物あさり', 'text': 'カード２枚を引く。その後カード２枚を捨てる。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589447&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94995799-4dde-41df-ba55-9570a50115a7', 'multiverseId': 589447}, 'multiverseid': 589447}]", '[{\'name\': \'Turm der Industrie\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du ein Artefakt kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Leuchtfeuer des Wohlstands für einige, ein Schatten der Unterdrückung für andere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815c73fa-a79b-420f-a989-d48fd518b676\', \'multiverseId\': 588958}, \'multiverseid\': 588958}, {\'name\': \'Chapitel de la industria\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Activa esto solo si controlas un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Un faro de prosperidad para algunos, una sombra de opresión para otros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846b0a58-e430-4fa1-bab5-d4adcf98513a\', \'multiverseId\': 589102}, \'multiverseid\': 589102}, {\'name\': "Tour de l\'industrie", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un artefact.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Modèle de prospérité pour certains, ombre de la répression pour d\'autres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589246&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8fe19f-8160-4ec7-a342-f7125f2a082e\', \'multiverseId\': 589246}, \'multiverseid\': 589246}, {\'name\': "Spirale dell\'Industria", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Attiva solo se controlli un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Un faro di prosperità per alcuni, un\'ombra di oppressione per altri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d50cc4-0354-45b2-bb4f-fda3c7384700\', \'multiverseId\': 589390}, \'multiverseid\': 589390}, {\'name\': \'産業の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T},１点のライフを支払う：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ある者には繁栄の灯、他の者には抑圧の影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ffff584-a7f0-4d07-96e9-1992401c1ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 589534}, \'multiverseid\': 589534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Turm des Reliquienschreins\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der einst von den Rittern des Reliquienschreins bewachte Turm wird nun nur durch seine entfernte Lage geschützt. Seine staubigen Schätze stehen jedem Plünderer offen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c9ca9b3-d221-487c-823d-f2567ff376a2\', \'multiverseId\': 588951}, \'multiverseid\': 588951}, {\'name\': \'Torre del relicario\', \'text\': \'Tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Custodiada en otros tiempos por los Caballeros del Relicario, la torre se alza ahora protegida solo por su propia lejanía y con sus polvorientos tesoros expuestos a cualquier saqueador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22829d71-ac59-43fa-af3e-80fe85d7d69d\', \'multiverseId\': 589095}, \'multiverseid\': 589095}, {\'name\': \'Tour du Reliquaire\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Autrefois gardée par les Chevaliers du Reliquaire, la tour n\'est plus protégée que par son isolement et ses trésors poussiéreux sont à la merci du premier pillard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baea9cc6-2a0b-48b0-b78b-a54de9e38fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 589239}, \'multiverseid\': 589239}, {\'name\': \'Torre del Reliquiario\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo difesa dai Cavalieri del Reliquiario, la torre è adesso protetta unicamente dalla propria inaccessibilità; chiunque potrà saccheggiarne i polverosi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d45497-f15b-403a-9bbc-fd701f480de0\', \'multiverseId\': 589383}, \'multiverseid\': 589383}, {\'name\': \'聖遺の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'昔は聖遺の騎士によって守られていたその塔だが、今は外界から隔絶しているという事実しか守るものはいない。埃をかぶった宝物の数々を誰でも我が物にできるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1565abf1-c82b-495c-990f-ffd726546e69\', \'multiverseId\': 589527}, \'multiverseid\': 589527}]', "[{'name': 'Unbeugsamer Erzengel', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nMetallkunst — Artefakte, die du kontrollierst, haben Verhülltheit, solange du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst. (Ein Artefakt mit Verhülltheit kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Engel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588827&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f163e9c-fd56-4acd-9927-1a0339914db4', 'multiverseId': 588827}, 'multiverseid': 588827}, {'name': 'Arcángel indomable', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nMetalurgia — Los artefactos que controlas tienen la habilidad de velo mientras controles tres o más artefactos. (Un artefacto con la habilidad de velo no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Ángel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588971&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff040179-675f-4797-a9c2-115ad144d8de', 'multiverseId': 588971}, 'multiverseid': 588971}, {'name': 'Archange indomptable', 'text': 'Vol\\nArt des métaux — Les artefacts que vous contrôlez ont le linceul tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts. (Un artefact avec le linceul ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)', 'type': 'Créature : ange', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589115&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '817b396d-ab5b-4c34-a8b1-11d94bb1a792', 'multiverseId': 589115}, 'multiverseid': 589115}, {'name': 'Arcangelo Indomabile', 'text': 'Volare\\nMetallurgia — Gli artefatti che controlli hanno velo fintanto che controlli tre o più artefatti. (Un artefatto con velo non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Angelo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589259&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2620360d-9901-4975-806e-f0846accfebc', 'multiverseId': 589259}, 'multiverseid': 589259}, {'name': '不退転の大天使', 'text': '飛行\\n金属術 ― あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトは被覆を持つ。（被覆を持つアーティファクトは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589403&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59253817-4378-4baf-9bee-8a098af8e16c', 'multiverseId': 589403}, 'multiverseid': 589403}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unheilskauz\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn der Unheilskauz ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Schnabel zerreißt Fleisch und Knochen, bis er das zarte Innere der Träume freilegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dfbabb4-3593-47f5-b5cc-8f20fe45f77e\', \'multiverseId\': 588875}, \'multiverseid\': 588875}, {\'name\': \'Strix maléfico\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal.\\nCuando el Strix maléfico entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Su pico rasga carne y hueso, exponiendo el suave tuétano del sueño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f698de0-c1e5-4bbb-9c88-e43a4005cd7b\', \'multiverseId\': 589019}, \'multiverseid\': 589019}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre strix\', \'text\': \'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand le Sinistre strix arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Son bec déchire la chair et taille l\'os exposant à l\'air libre la tendre moelle du rêve.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af30a295-455e-4d5d-a996-6e56afdd0f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 589163}, \'multiverseid\': 589163}, {\'name\': \'Strige Funesto\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando lo Strige Funesto entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo becco squarcia carne e ossa, mettendo allo scoperto la tenera essenza dei sogni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d9fe638-22eb-4611-8e0a-dacb56707a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 589307}, \'multiverseid\': 589307}, {\'name\': \'悪意の大梟\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死\\n悪意の大梟が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'その嘴は肉と骨を裂き、柔らかな夢の随を剥き出しにする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693fb11b-d610-438d-af47-7fa85e53aa7a\', \'multiverseId\': 589451}, \'multiverseid\': 589451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unzerstörbare Formation\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAddendum — Falls du diesen Zauberspruch während deiner Hauptphase gewirkt hast, lege auf jede der Kreaturen eine +1/+1-Marke und sie erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b9deef-d001-4594-a29b-a0a73598a273\', \'multiverseId\': 588833}, \'multiverseid\': 588833}, {\'name\': \'Formación inquebrantable\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nAdenda — Si lanzas este hechizo durante tu fase principal, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de esas criaturas y ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6ca731-0655-44c7-b54f-19bebc69fbad\', \'multiverseId\': 588977}, \'multiverseid\': 588977}, {\'name\': \'Formation inébranlable\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAddenda — Si vous avez lancé ce sort pendant votre phase principale, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune de ces créatures et elles acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76e2d222-d65c-49d2-9b76-f8cf08980177\', \'multiverseId\': 589121}, \'multiverseid\': 589121}, {\'name\': \'Formazione Indissolubile\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nAppendice — Se hai lanciato questa magia durante la tua fase principale, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ognuna di quelle creature e hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66814243-7f53-4aa2-87ca-7d7772c0fabd\', \'multiverseId\': 589265}, \'multiverseid\': 589265}, {\'name\': \'不敗の陣形\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\\n附則 ― あなたがこの呪文をあなたのメイン・フェイズ中に唱えたなら、それらのクリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf5790f-7091-4668-8278-5ba2dc9af52a\', \'multiverseId\': 589409}, \'multiverseid\': 589409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Uralte Höhle\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Halcyon, schwebende Hauptstadt der Thran. Die einst strahlende Stadt in den Wolken liegt jetzt als Ruinen auf dem Wüstenboden."\\n—*Untergang der Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08862720-bceb-4fe8-947a-b6b75f92e5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 588927}, \'multiverseid\': 588927}, {\'name\': \'Guarida antigua\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Halcyon, capital flotante de los thran. Una ciudad que antaño brillaba entre las nubes y cuyas ruinas ahora pueblan el desierto".\\n—*Caída de los thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c4ee0c-01f9-4ff4-9b0d-d9e190a337ae\', \'multiverseId\': 589071}, \'multiverseid\': 589071}, {\'name\': \'Ancienne tanière\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Alcyon, la capitale volante des Thrans. Autrefois rayonnante, la cité des nuages n\'est plus qu\'un tas de ruines en plein désert. »\\n—*Chute de l\'empire thran*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0215f9e-bec9-4caf-8ec9-6c23d3cff10b\', \'multiverseId\': 589215}, \'multiverseid\': 589215}, {\'name\': \'Antro Antico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcione, capitale fluttuante dei Thran. Un tempo lo splendore di questa città penetrava le nubi, ora giace in rovina tra le sabbie del deserto."\\n—*Caduta dei Thran*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f982c53d-292e-413b-bbd9-0691eadb71d6\', \'multiverseId\': 589359}, \'multiverseid\': 589359}, {\'name\': \'古えの居住地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'「スランの浮遊する首都、ハルシオン。かつては雲の上に輝く大都市であったこの街も今は砂上の遺跡と化した。」\\n――*スランの崩落*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f15b680b-a6f6-4404-a695-a19ac53bc8b8\', \'multiverseId\': 589503}, \'multiverseid\': 589503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urquell des Wundsekrets\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Urquell des Wundsekrets ins Spiel kommt oder aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere glorreiche Infektion hat sich verfestigt."\\n—Elesh Norn, Hohe Zönobitin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b22fe5-4f06-4964-96d0-2c5ce74ee6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 588898}, \'multiverseid\': 588898}, {\'name\': \'Manantial icórido\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Manantial icórido entre al campo de batalla o vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestra gloriosa infección se ha extendido".\\n—Elesh Norn, Gran Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e1e1d4-23f6-455f-a15c-9e48b754b010\', \'multiverseId\': 589042}, \'multiverseid\': 589042}, {\'name\': \'Source de sanie\', \'text\': "Quand la Source de sanie arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'elle est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Notre glorieuse infection a fait souche. »\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cénobite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589186&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65a89f13-e1a4-4541-90ef-966ffae123b4\', \'multiverseId\': 589186}, \'multiverseid\': 589186}, {\'name\': "Sorgente d\'Icore", \'text\': "Quando la Sorgente d\'Icore entra nel campo di battaglia o viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La nostra gloriosa infezione ha fatto presa."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grande Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19f780e-6541-4827-82fc-782800fdfeea\', \'multiverseId\': 589330}, \'multiverseid\': 589330}, {\'name\': \'胆液の水源\', \'text\': \'胆液の水源が戦場に出たか戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「我らが輝かしき感染は根付きつつある。」\\n――大修道士、エリシュ・ノーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c113a814-f324-4810-a51e-e83ffb89aab7\', \'multiverseId\': 589474}, \'multiverseid\': 589474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urza, oberster Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefaktkreaturen (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nArtefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588359&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ed8e9c-5942-46a4-b250-472bd48f5efd\', \'multiverseId\': 588359}, \'multiverseid\': 588359}, {\'name\': \'Urza, artífice líder\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por criaturas artefacto. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura artefacto que controlas.)\\nLas criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 0/0 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd0f8ad-65ed-4a43-a7dd-b4c7623501ff\', \'multiverseId\': 588361}, \'multiverseid\': 588361}, {\'name\': \'Urza, chef artificier\', \'text\': \'Affinité pour les créatures-artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nLes créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e457b71-9a87-4224-9c10-aae10ca11e72\', \'multiverseId\': 588363}, \'multiverseid\': 588363}, {\'name\': \'Urza, Artefice Capo\', \'text\': \'Affinità con le creature artefatto (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura artefatto che controlli.)\\nLe creature artefatto che controlli hanno minacciare.\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0 incolore con "Questa creatura prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3abd7fba-4876-4315-94cb-c9b99a925cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 588365}, \'multiverseid\': 588365}, {\'name\': \'工匠の主任、ウルザ\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト・クリーチャー）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは威迫を持つ。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、「このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。」を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb490ae-ccb2-4c16-8bb3-874f3152ae5a\', \'multiverseId\': 588367}, \'multiverseid\': 588367}, {\'name\': \'Urza, Artífice Chefe\', \'text\': \'Afinidade por criaturas artefato (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada criatura artefato que você controla.)\\nAs criaturas artefato que você controla têm ameaçar.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Constructo incolor 0/0 com "Esta criatura recebe +1/+1 para cada artefato que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc505f87-b819-4ee0-81b7-e8df2171d59c\', \'multiverseId\': 588371}, \'multiverseid\': 588371}, {\'name\': \'铸物卿克撒\', \'text\': \'神器生物共鸣（你每操控一个神器生物，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n由你操控的神器生物具有威慑异能。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，派出一个0/0无色组构体衍生神器生物，且具有「你每操控一个神器，此生物便得+1/+1。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f013f2d-8068-4b5d-b8f5-1ed695b8f603\', \'multiverseId\': 588375}, \'multiverseid\': 588375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urza, oberster Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefaktkreaturen (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.)\\nArtefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589546&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29eb91e-3574-4ce9-9089-8af2d5386744\', \'multiverseId\': 589546}, \'multiverseid\': 589546}, {\'name\': \'Urza, artífice líder\', \'text\': \'Afinidad por criaturas artefacto. (Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada criatura artefacto que controlas.)\\nLas criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo incolora 0/0 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 por cada artefacto que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d180e9f-bda4-49d0-9420-f17e0dcf43da\', \'multiverseId\': 589548}, \'multiverseid\': 589548}, {\'name\': \'Urza, chef artificier\', \'text\': \'Affinité pour les créatures-artefacts (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.)\\nLes créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10310548-5ce2-48a3-b84b-e7f2ab1b14b8\', \'multiverseId\': 589550}, \'multiverseid\': 589550}, {\'name\': \'Urza, Artefice Capo\', \'text\': \'Affinità con le creature artefatto (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura artefatto che controlli.)\\nLe creature artefatto che controlli hanno minacciare.\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 0/0 incolore con "Questa creatura prende +1/+1 per ogni artefatto che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26655475-757a-4c77-9260-d38c1fd07d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 589552}, \'multiverseid\': 589552}, {\'name\': \'工匠の主任、ウルザ\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト・クリーチャー）（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト・クリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは威迫を持つ。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、「このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。」を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c854fdf5-4754-4485-9c6a-c4554911c5f8\', \'multiverseId\': 589554}, \'multiverseid\': 589554}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urza, oberster Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Affinität zu Artefaktkreaturen\\nArtefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du einen 0/0 farblosen Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f0a879e-b467-4863-b61b-1d40d3d99a10\', \'multiverseId\': 588515}, \'multiverseid\': 588515}, {\'name\': \'Urza, chef artificier\', \'text\': \'Affinité pour les créatures-artefacts\\nLes créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/0 incolore Construction avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+1 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. »\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9219b2f8-67fa-4767-a6c0-1941469b7d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 588526}, \'multiverseid\': 588526}, {\'name\': \'工匠の主任、ウルザ\', \'text\': \'親和（アーティファクト・クリーチャー）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは威迫を持つ。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、「このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。」を持つ無色の０/０の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e23586b-f7ca-41b8-aad1-bd4f1d7ea63f\', \'multiverseId\': 588537}, \'multiverseid\': 588537}, {\'name\': \'铸物卿克撒\', \'text\': \'神器生物共鸣\\n由你操控的神器生物具有威慑异能。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，派出一个0/0无色组构体衍生神器生物，且具有「你每操控一个神器，此生物便得+1/+1。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a94579-f163-46ac-bb1c-621a7d6b1fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 588548}, \'multiverseid\': 588548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urzas Werkstatt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nMetallkunst — {T}: Erzeuge {C} für jedes Urzas-Land, das du kontrollierst. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Urzas\', \'flavor\': \'Urza verstand schließlich Tocasias Lektionen über klare Ziele. Perfektion wurde sein Ziel, und im Streben danach wurde alles andere unwichtig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd840e5b-435c-451f-b2de-ac1cac06d2ff\', \'multiverseId\': 586478}, \'multiverseid\': 586478}, {\'name\': \'Taller de Urza\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nMetalurgia — {T}: Agrega {C} por cada tierra de-Urza que controlas. Activa esto solo si controlas tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — De-Urza\', \'flavor\': \'Urza acabó entendiendo las lecciones de Tocasia sobre la importancia de definir tus propósitos. La perfección se convirtió en su objetivo y todo lo demás desapareció en su afán de alcanzarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b251d4-17ed-413a-96b8-aff890426d39\', \'multiverseId\': 586486}, \'multiverseid\': 586486}, {\'name\': "Atelier d\'Urza", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nArt des métaux — {T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque terrain d\'Urza que vous contrôlez. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.", \'type\': "Terrain : terrain d\'Urza", \'flavor\': "Urza en vint finalement à comprendre les leçons de Tocasia concernant la clarté des objectifs. La perfection devint son but, et toute autre question finit par s\'évaporer dans sa quête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f3d21a-2af2-47f2-b0f1-b808d6a1af07\', \'multiverseId\': 586494}, \'multiverseid\': 586494}, {\'name\': \'Laboratorio di Urza\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nMetallurgia — {T}: Aggiungi {C} per ogni terra di Urza che controlli. Attiva solo se controlli tre o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Terra — di Urza\', \'flavor\': \'Infine, Urza comprese le lezioni di Tocasia sulla chiarezza dello scopo. La perfezione divenne il suo obiettivo e tutte le altre questioni vennero meno nella ricerca di essa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b0487c6-7c08-4127-b60f-6d13b750388b\', \'multiverseId\': 586502}, \'multiverseid\': 586502}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの作業場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n金属術 ― {T}：あなたがコントロールしているウルザの・土地１つにつき{C}を加える。あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地 — ウルザの\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザはやがて、目的の明快さを説くトカシアの教えを理解するようになった。完全無欠が彼の目標となり、その追求の過程で他の事柄はこぼれ落ちていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f1eef8c-e49c-4d38-868b-fa6bec8ef8a5\', \'multiverseId\': 586510}, \'multiverseid\': 586510}, {\'name\': \'Oficina de Urza\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\nMaestria com metais — {T}: Adicione {C} para cada terreno de Urza que você controla. Ative somente se você controlar três ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — De Urza\', \'flavor\': \'Por fim Urza compreendeu as lições de Tocasia sobre a clareza de propósito. A perfeição tornou-se seu objetivo e tudo mais ficou de lado em sua busca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66479c76-dde4-449b-9bd6-5ca144af2820\', \'multiverseId\': 586526}, \'multiverseid\': 586526}, {\'name\': \'克撒的作坊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n金技～{T}：你每操控一个「克撒的」地，便加{C}。只能于你操控三个或更多神器时起动。\', \'type\': \'地 ～克撒的\', \'flavor\': \'托卡西雅曾反复强调要有明确目标，而克撒如今终于理解此般教诲的意义所在。他的眼中只剩完美二字，且为此目标他可以抛却一切。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416a2a57-0c13-4e30-877f-9d70d57a3efb\', \'multiverseId\': 586542}, \'multiverseid\': 586542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urzas Werkstatt\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nMetallkunst — {T}: Erzeuge {C} für jedes Urzas-Land, das du kontrollierst. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Urzas\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4457afdb-e407-4ddf-8bb0-d78f3f678396\', \'multiverseId\': 588517}, \'multiverseid\': 588517}, {\'name\': "Atelier d\'Urza", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nArt des métaux — {T} : Ajoutez {C} pour chaque terrain d\'Urza que vous contrôlez. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.", \'type\': "Terrain : terrain d\'Urza", \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588528&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a8a60a6-821a-4251-9e73-32612bf9774a\', \'multiverseId\': 588528}, \'multiverseid\': 588528}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの作業場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n金属術 ― {T}：あなたがコントロールしているウルザの・土地１つにつき{C}を加える。あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地 — ウルザの\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515170e2-b194-46b0-abfe-201020f689ef\', \'multiverseId\': 588539}, \'multiverseid\': 588539}, {\'name\': \'克撒的作坊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n金技～{T}：你每操控一个「克撒的」地，便加{C}。只能于你操控三个或更多神器时起动。\', \'type\': \'地 ～克撒的\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68af482b-897b-423f-874b-4c79f7c7f2f2\', \'multiverseId\': 588550}, \'multiverseid\': 588550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Urzas vernichtender Strahl\', \'text\': \'(Legendäre Hexereien kannst du nur wirken, falls du eine legendäre Kreatur oder einen legendären Planeswalker kontrollierst.)\\nSchicke alle nichtlegendären bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Urza schüttete seine Liebe, seinen Gram und seinen Hass in den Sylex, und das Multiversum bebte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd8a289-9497-4565-917f-adb33c985745\', \'multiverseId\': 588834}, \'multiverseid\': 588834}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga destructora de Urza\', \'text\': \'(Solo puedes lanzar un conjuro legendario si controlas una criatura o planeswalker legendario.)\\nExilia todos los permanentes que no sean tierra y que no sean legendarios.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Urza puso todo su amor, su pena y su odio en el sylex, y el Multiverso se estremeció.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093d8612-588c-49f8-b997-fbc49296cf45\', \'multiverseId\': 588978}, \'multiverseid\': 588978}, {\'name\': "Salve désastreuse d\'Urza", \'text\': \'(Vous ne pouvez lancer un rituel légendaire que si vous contrôlez une créature légendaire ou un planeswalker légendaire.)\\nExilez tous les permanents non-terrain qui ne sont pas légendaires.\', \'type\': \'Rituel légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Urza concentra tout son amour, son chagrin et sa haine dans le Sylex, et le Multivers trembla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51a703fe-d64a-49bd-b595-d90d77a21d96\', \'multiverseId\': 589122}, \'multiverseid\': 589122}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Devastante di Urza\', \'text\': \'(Puoi lanciare una stregoneria leggendaria solo se controlli una creatura o un planeswalker leggendari.)\\nEsilia tutti i permanenti non terra che non sono leggendari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'Urza riversò il suo amore, il suo dolore e il suo odio nel Sylex, e il Multiverso tremò.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9327ffd5-3c24-4887-ae51-e1739b9e076c\', \'multiverseId\': 589266}, \'multiverseid\': 589266}, {\'name\': \'ウルザの殲滅破\', \'text\': \'（伝説のソーサリーは、あなたが伝説のクリーチャーか伝説のプレインズウォーカーをコントロールしていなければ唱えられない。）\\n伝説でも土地でもないすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウルザは彼の愛情と無念と憎悪を酒杯に注ぎ込んだ。すると多元宇宙が揺れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'610f8df0-0017-4453-8a82-19063cb118a6\', \'multiverseId\': 589410}, \'multiverseid\': 589410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vedalken-Demütiger\', \'text\': \'Metallkunst — Immer wenn der Vedalken-Demütiger angreift und falls du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, verlieren alle Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, alle Fähigkeiten und haben Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Und wer will mich aufhalten? Du etwa?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31804d1a-c649-439c-9258-4cd383dbd5a9\', \'multiverseId\': 588855}, \'multiverseid\': 588855}, {\'name\': \'Humillador vedalken\', \'text\': \'Metalurgia — Siempre que el Humillador vedalken ataque, si controlas tres o más artefactos, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes pierden todas las habilidades y tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Y quién va a detenerme? ¿Tú?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0ffdf3-12ef-435a-993c-68cc95f90180\', \'multiverseId\': 588999}, \'multiverseid\': 588999}, {\'name\': \'Humiliateur vedalken\', \'text\': "Art des métaux — À chaque fois que l\'Humiliateur vedalken attaque, si vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent toutes leurs capacités et ont une force et une endurance de base de 1/1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Et qui va m\'en empêcher ? Toi ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98758878-bd4e-46e3-bb9f-4aa56c23f055\', \'multiverseId\': 589143}, \'multiverseid\': 589143}, {\'name\': \'Umiliatore Vedalken\', \'text\': "Metallurgia — Ogniqualvolta l\'Umiliatore Vedalken attacca, se controlli tre o più artefatti, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari perdono tutte le abilità e hanno forza e costituzione base 1/1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'"E chi potrà fermarmi? Tu?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea03f86d-2d82-4a69-8e5d-861e700c56e5\', \'multiverseId\': 589287}, \'multiverseid\': 589287}, {\'name\': \'ヴィダルケンの貶め屋\', \'text\': \'金属術 ― ヴィダルケンの貶め屋が攻撃するたび、あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしている場合、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはすべての能力を失い基本のパワーとタフネスが１/１になる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「誰が俺様を止める？貴様か？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1937c682-eabf-4963-bceb-a767241af4ef\', \'multiverseId\': 589431}, \'multiverseid\': 589431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verfluchter Spiegel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nSowie der Verfluchte Spiegel ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ihn bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel werden lassen, außer dass er Eile hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22bd2d84-c657-48d7-99b7-6a8ff8a9b809\', \'multiverseId\': 588870}, \'multiverseid\': 588870}, {\'name\': \'Espejo maldito\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nEn cuanto el Espejo maldito entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que se convierta en una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla hasta el final del turno, excepto que tiene la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546c4968-dc1f-4d40-9b07-807cea5b1544\', \'multiverseId\': 589014}, \'multiverseid\': 589014}, {\'name\': \'Miroir maudit\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nAu moment où le Miroir maudit arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'il devienne une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à la fin du tour, excepté qu\'elle a la célérité.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d347203-d159-48b8-bf00-4e4f3958538f\', \'multiverseId\': 589158}, \'multiverseid\': 589158}, {\'name\': \'Specchio Maledetto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nMentre lo Specchio Maledetto entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi farlo diventare una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia fino alla fine del turno, tranne che ha rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44cd8f0c-027a-4505-9c2f-9262bc34c71e\', \'multiverseId\': 589302}, \'multiverseid\': 589302}, {\'name\': \'呪われた鏡\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。\\n呪われた鏡が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは、「ターン終了時まで、これは、これが速攻を持つことを除き戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーになる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccca227-e3b6-4a96-80a3-d7b5acc2adcf\', \'multiverseId\': 589446}, \'multiverseid\': 589446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vergessenheitsstein\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Lege eine Schicksalsmarke auf eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\\n{5}, {T}, opfere den Vergessenheitsstein: Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte, die kein Land ist und auf der keine Schicksalsmarke liegt, und entferne dann alle Schicksalsmarken von allen bleibenden Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'facfec1e-a035-4be2-97be-00cbcdef6509\', \'multiverseId\': 588908}, \'multiverseid\': 588908}, {\'name\': \'Piedra del olvido\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Pon un contador de destino sobre el permanente objetivo.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra del olvido: Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra sin un contador de destino sobre él. Luego remueve todos los contadores de destino de todos los permanentes.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6aabc4-ae54-4d3e-9864-73f1aaf5f989\', \'multiverseId\': 589052}, \'multiverseid\': 589052}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « destin » sur un permanent ciblé.\\n{5}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'oubli : Détruisez tous les permanents non-terrain sans marqueur « destin », et retirez ensuite tous les marqueurs « destin » de tous les permanents.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1077e1f-0496-4be5-a4ac-3693053c4d56\', \'multiverseId\': 589196}, \'multiverseid\': 589196}, {\'name\': "Pietra dell\'Oblio", \'text\': "{4}, {T}: Metti un segnalino fato su un permanente bersaglio.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra dell\'Oblio: Distruggi ogni permanente non terra che non ha un segnalino fato, poi rimuovi tutti i segnalini fato da tutti i permanenti.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9434886-d52f-46ef-b77a-25171d6fee87\', \'multiverseId\': 589340}, \'multiverseid\': 589340}, {\'name\': \'忘却石\', \'text\': \'{4},{T}：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それの上に運命カウンター１個を置く。\\n{5},{T},忘却石を生け贄に捧げる：運命カウンターが置かれておらず土地でもないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。その後、すべてのパーマネントの上からすべての運命カウンターを取り除く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe6c36f-d340-40dd-b966-625a69e9913d\', \'multiverseId\': 589484}, \'multiverseid\': 589484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhüttungsbottich\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere ein anderes Artefakt: Decke die obersten acht Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bringe davon bis zu zwei Nichtkreatur-Artefaktkarten mit Gesamt-Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem Manabetrag des geopferten Artefakts ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588429&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e475838-4747-4da9-a431-25e6a3bdd03d\', \'multiverseId\': 588429}, \'multiverseid\': 588429}, {\'name\': \'Tanque de fundición\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar otro artefacto: Muestra las ocho primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon en el campo de batalla hasta dos cartas de artefacto que no sean criaturas con valor de maná total menor o igual que el valor de maná del artefacto sacrificado de entre ellas y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3da77bd-5a1a-4dba-9f0b-1b176044d3fc\', \'multiverseId\': 588445}, \'multiverseid\': 588445}, {\'name\': \'Cuve de fonderie\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un autre artefact : Révélez les huit cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez jusqu\'à deux cartes d\'artefact non-créature avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à la valeur de mana de l\'artefact sacrifié parmi elles sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524f4ebe-b602-433f-b860-1f8e9a8e8494\', \'multiverseId\': 588461}, \'multiverseid\': 588461}, {\'name\': \'Vasca di Fusione\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un altro artefatto: Rivela le prime otto carte del tuo grimorio. Metti sul campo di battaglia fino a due carte artefatto non creatura con valore di mana totale pari o inferiore al valore di mana dell\'artefatto sacrificato scelte tra esse e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71efa82f-854c-42c2-9859-bef7dedc8119\', \'multiverseId\': 588477}, \'multiverseid\': 588477}, {\'name\': \'溶鉄の大桶\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, これでないアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード８枚を公開する。その中から、クリーチャーでないアーティファクト・カード最大２枚をマナ総量の合計がその生け贄に捧げられたアーティファクトのマナ総量以下になるように選んで戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc34c020-d7fb-4797-b3ca-c00719092e44\', \'multiverseId\': 588493}, \'multiverseid\': 588493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verhüttungsbottich\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere ein anderes Artefakt: Decke die obersten acht Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bringe davon bis zu zwei Nichtkreatur-Artefaktkarten mit Gesamt-Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem Manabetrag des geopferten Artefakts ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4631f52-e95c-48ab-a72a-d33dd0241d35\', \'multiverseId\': 588580}, \'multiverseid\': 588580}, {\'name\': \'Cuve de fonderie\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez un autre artefact : Révélez les huit cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez jusqu\'à deux cartes d\'artefact non-créature avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à la valeur de mana de l\'artefact sacrifié parmi elles sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588596&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89c6851a-bd45-4985-92a4-96b18054484d\', \'multiverseId\': 588596}, \'multiverseid\': 588596}, {\'name\': \'溶鉄の大桶\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, これでないアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード８枚を公開する。その中から、クリーチャーでないアーティファクト・カード最大２枚をマナ総量の合計がその生け贄に捧げられたアーティファクトのマナ総量以下になるように選んで戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5b74e8e-c35b-4d14-a4df-837345824e89\', \'multiverseId\': 588612}, \'multiverseid\': 588612}, {\'name\': \'熔炼缸\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲另一个神器：展示你牌库顶的八张牌。将其中至多两张非生物的神器牌放进战场，且其法术力值加总须等于或小于所牺牲神器的法术力值，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e028387f-68c3-4879-952d-c9df34b5889b\', \'multiverseId\': 588628}, \'multiverseid\': 588628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vernichtung von Terisiare\', \'text\': \'Du verlierst X Lebenspunkte und erzeugst X getappte Kraftstein-Spielsteine. Dann erhält jede Kreatur für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Die Spielsteine sind Artefakte mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Am Ende hatte der Krieg keinen Gewinner.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c85bc4-a9fe-43e7-8645-d9dbe90e9950\', \'multiverseId\': 588420}, \'multiverseid\': 588420}, {\'name\': \'Asolación de Terisiare\', \'text\': \'Pierdes X vidas y creas X fichas de Piedra de poder giradas. Luego, todas las criaturas obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno por cada artefacto que controlas. (Las fichas son artefactos con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Al final, la guerra no tuvo ningún vencedor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc07ad2-1d52-4757-a9b6-a44faa0f7c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 588436}, \'multiverseid\': 588436}, {\'name\': \'Destruction de Terisiare\', \'text\': "Vous perdez X points de vie et créez X jetons Lithoforce engagés. Puis toutes les créatures gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez. (Les jetons sont des artefacts avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au final, la guerre n\'eut pas de vainqueur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcf4c7c7-3e2d-4c35-b687-15d787981ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 588452}, \'multiverseid\': 588452}, {\'name\': \'Devastazione di Terisiare\', \'text\': \'Perdi X punti vita e crei X pedine Pietra del Potere TAPpate. Poi tutte le creature prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni artefatto che controlli. (Le pedine sono artefatti con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Alla fine, la guerra non conobbe vincitori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6143207f-68e7-4f38-bec1-235966121e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 588468}, \'multiverseid\': 588468}, {\'name\': \'テリシアの終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたはＸ点のライフを失い、パワーストーン・トークンＸ個をタップ状態で生成する。その後、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき－１/－１の修整を受ける。（それらのトークンは「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最終的に、この戦争に勝者などいなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19865b84-6c8d-49ee-b205-78ef10555d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 588484}, \'multiverseid\': 588484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vernichtung von Terisiare\', \'text\': \'Du verlierst X Lebenspunkte und erzeugst X getappte Kraftstein-Spielsteine. Dann erhält jede Kreatur für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac06ee2f-bbf9-4032-8bd7-582c3a3df9b3\', \'multiverseId\': 588571}, \'multiverseid\': 588571}, {\'name\': \'Destruction de Terisiare\', \'text\': "Vous perdez X points de vie et créez X jetons Lithoforce engagés. Puis toutes les créatures gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a88aa4-08c0-4823-93e4-2373c99ca50c\', \'multiverseId\': 588587}, \'multiverseid\': 588587}, {\'name\': \'テリシアの終焉\', \'text\': \'あなたはＸ点のライフを失い、パワーストーン・トークンＸ個をタップ状態で生成する。その後、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98483960-1253-415f-8255-edc3c913821d\', \'multiverseId\': 588603}, \'multiverseid\': 588603}, {\'name\': \'泰瑞西亚崩灭\', \'text\': \'你失去X点生命并派出X个已横置的魔力石衍生物。然后你每操控一个神器，所有生物便得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48602112-1592-4e24-84b4-510dedb1fb2f\', \'multiverseId\': 588619}, \'multiverseid\': 588619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verschüttete Ruinen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Verschütteten Ruinen: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte hat ihre Schätze tief vergraben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d656c06-fa98-4930-84dd-bd638ce017e0\', \'multiverseId\': 588932}, \'multiverseid\': 588932}, {\'name\': \'Ruina enterrada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Ruina enterrada: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La historia ha enterrado sus tesoros profundamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f20d83-ad49-4709-84ca-5ca3b0e30825\', \'multiverseId\': 589076}, \'multiverseid\': 589076}, {\'name\': \'Ruine ensevelie\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Ruine ensevelie : Renvoyez dans votre main une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'histoire a profondément enfoui ses trésors.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'491dcdab-2965-4e53-aab4-58da0b636622\', \'multiverseId\': 589220}, \'multiverseid\': 589220}, {\'name\': \'Rovine Sepolte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica le Rovine Sepolte: Riprendi in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La storia ha sepolto in profondità i suoi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e40bf0-0f6a-411d-9990-ec5feca0ff4a\', \'multiverseId\': 589364}, \'multiverseid\': 589364}, {\'name\': \'埋没した廃墟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},埋没した廃墟を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は自身の価値を深く埋める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b8eeea-0e14-4fc1-9ef9-c80f45b6f0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 589508}, \'multiverseid\': 589508}]', "[{'name': 'Versunkener Talkessel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDer Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': 'Auf dem Kontinent Tazeem stürzen rauschende Ströme enge Schluchten hinab, in nebelverhangene Seen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588959&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '630fe5e6-a93a-40dc-b8fb-472674ddb4b3', 'multiverseId': 588959}, 'multiverseid': 588959}, {'name': 'Hondonada profunda', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Hondonada profunda entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla pantano', 'flavor': 'En el continente de Tazeem, los ríos se abren paso a través de estrechos cañones y terminan en lagos sumidos en la niebla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589103&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a839970-a255-456e-866c-d0b517d10995', 'multiverseId': 589103}, 'multiverseid': 589103}, {'name': 'Dépression engloutie', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLa Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : île et marais', 'flavor': 'Sur le continent de Tazeem, les eaux tumultueuses passent dans des gorges étroites et se jettent dans des lacs embrumés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589247&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f54f74cf-e361-476d-8ef8-a597601fd275', 'multiverseId': 589247}, 'multiverseid': 589247}, {'name': 'Conca Infossata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': 'Sul continente di Tazeem, acque impetuose si tuffano attraverso strette gole in laghi ammantati di nebbia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589391&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e0b8199-f055-4262-88b1-9d4b7bbdc6b4', 'multiverseId': 589391}, 'multiverseid': 589391}, {'name': '窪み渓谷', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': 'タジーム大陸の急流は、狭い渓谷を抜けると霧に覆われた湖へと流れ込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589535&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '505cb9ba-2bcf-493c-b487-d5e18a34c133', 'multiverseId': 589535}, 'multiverseid': 589535}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vorherbestimmen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann eine Karte. (Schaue dir für Hellsicht 2 die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecea1e2b-8a40-48dd-8074-ef851cc10fb1\', \'multiverseId\': 588847}, \'multiverseid\': 588847}, {\'name\': \'Preordinar\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2 y luego roba una carta. (Para adivinar 2, mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363bcb8b-afd9-46e6-9817-af4c9bc64649\', \'multiverseId\': 588991}, \'multiverseid\': 588991}, {\'name\': \'Prédestination\', \'text\': "Regard 2, puis piochez une carte. (Pour appliquer regard 2, regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez ensuite n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8793aef5-07bf-4649-8cf8-49c34cdcbb80\', \'multiverseId\': 589135}, \'multiverseid\': 589135}, {\'name\': \'Predestinare\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca una carta. (Per profetizzare 2, guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4639903c-2138-4eb0-9b0e-66b674be8559\', \'multiverseId\': 589279}, \'multiverseid\': 589279}, {\'name\': \'定業\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後、カード１枚を引く。（占術２とは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'158bbd9f-9d80-45bd-8612-be2d40606803\', \'multiverseId\': 589423}, \'multiverseid\': 589423}]', "[{'name': 'Vorsteher der Gießerei', 'text': 'Andere Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': 'Die Gießereien von Kaladesh laufen wie Uhrwerke unter der Kontrolle ihrer formidablen Aufseher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588889&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e501eb6e-6472-422c-94f5-170cc0855a16', 'multiverseId': 588889}, 'multiverseid': 588889}, {'name': 'Capataz de la fundición', 'text': 'Las otras criaturas artefacto que controlas obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': 'Las fundiciones de Kaladesh funcionan como un reloj bajo la supervisión de sus formidables supervisores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589033&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfb7049b-cbe1-4c5c-830e-9ee849239aec', 'multiverseId': 589033}, 'multiverseid': 589033}, {'name': 'Chef de la fonderie', 'text': 'Les autres créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': 'Les fonderies de Kaladesh fonctionnent impeccablement sous la supervision de leurs redoutables brigadiers.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589177&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9160cf9f-2a92-4f28-9db1-1c18e4883736', 'multiverseId': 589177}, 'multiverseid': 589177}, {'name': 'Capo della Fonderia', 'text': 'Le altre creature artefatto che controlli prendono +1/+1.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': 'Le fonderie di Kaladesh funzionano alla perfezione sotto la supervisione dei loro formidabili sovrintendenti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589321&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '594b9fa5-598b-487f-8402-1ec2fd1f5f92', 'multiverseId': 589321}, 'multiverseid': 589321}, {'name': '鋳造所の隊長', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': 'カラデシュの鋳造所は、その恐るべき監督者の管理の下で時計仕掛けのように規則正しく運営されている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589465&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daba8bf2-c659-4364-8493-746c7e4fca9e', 'multiverseId': 589465}, 'multiverseid': 589465}]", '[{\'name\': \'Werkstätten-Mütterchen\', \'text\': \'Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug kannst du ein Nichtkreatur-Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, zu einer 0/0 Artefaktkreatur werden lassen. Falls du dies tust, lege vier +1/+1-Marken darauf.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588857&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2465597-6325-41d1-a3cc-a6c037cc0d12\', \'multiverseId\': 588857}, \'multiverseid\': 588857}, {\'name\': \'Ancianas del taller\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas artefacto que controlas tienen la habilidad de volar.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, puedes hacer que el artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura que controlas se convierta en una criatura artefacto 0/0. Si lo haces, pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f78c6551-68e3-4251-8192-f2286fe3c957\', \'multiverseId\': 589001}, \'multiverseid\': 589001}, {\'name\': "Anciens de l\'atelier", \'text\': "Les créatures-artefacts que vous contrôlez ont le vol.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez faire qu\'un artefact non-créature ciblé que vous contrôlez devienne une créature-artefact 0/0. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ded32c7b-7d09-4a17-8831-e5e7787c1880\', \'multiverseId\': 589145}, \'multiverseid\': 589145}, {\'name\': \'Anziane del Laboratorio\', \'text\': "Le creature artefatto che controlli hanno volare.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, puoi far sì che un artefatto non creatura bersaglio che controlli diventi una creatura artefatto 0/0. Se lo fai, metti quattro segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eaa404a-c3d6-44c0-9125-cc0ff875cf09\', \'multiverseId\': 589289}, \'multiverseid\': 589289}, {\'name\': \'作業場の古老\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたは「それは０/０のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84fe8662-0993-4ed0-a260-297f339ab387\', \'multiverseId\': 589433}, \'multiverseid\': 589433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wiederverwerteter Kampfbot\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden, Lebensverknüpfung\\n{5}, schicke den Wiederverwerteten Kampfbot aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege vier +1/+1-Marken, eine Fliegend-Marke, eine Wachsamkeit-Marke, eine Trampelschaden-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf sie. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d161c0c9-5634-40d6-8e91-cdb248f75ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 588428}, \'multiverseid\': 588428}, {\'name\': \'Belicoso recuperado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, arrolla, vínculo vital.\\n{5}, exiliar el Belicoso recuperado de tu cementerio: Elige una criatura objetivo. Pon cuatro contadores +1/+1, un contador de volar, un contador de vigilancia, un contador de arrollar y un contador de vínculo vital sobre esa criatura. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76fef0df-2b3d-4ddd-91e4-d4a455fbea32\', \'multiverseId\': 588444}, \'multiverseid\': 588444}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreur de récupération\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, piétinement, lien de vie\\n{5}, exilez le Bagarreur de récupération depuis votre cimetière : Choisissez une créature ciblée. Mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1, un marqueur « vol », un marqueur « vigilance », un marqueur « piétinement » et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur cette créature. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53c0a68-2069-427f-880b-695d79121454\', \'multiverseId\': 588460}, \'multiverseid\': 588460}, {\'name\': \'Lottatore Mangicarogne\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, travolgere, legame vitale\\n{5}, Esilia il Lottatore Mangiacarogne dal tuo cimitero: Scegli una creatura bersaglio. Metti quattro segnalini +1/+1, un segnalino volare, un segnalino cautela, un segnalino travolgere e un segnalino legame vitale su quella creatura. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee2d710-22d0-4bc2-820e-2b4460463e9b\', \'multiverseId\': 588476}, \'multiverseid\': 588476}, {\'name\': \'廃物製の喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、トランプル、絆魂\\n{5}, あなたの墓地にある廃物製の喧嘩屋を追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個、飛行・カウンター１個、警戒・カウンター１個、トランプル・カウンター１個、絆魂・カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89712737-58ad-46f1-85b9-940f78fc0b34\', \'multiverseId\': 588492}, \'multiverseid\': 588492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wiederverwerteter Kampfbot\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden, Lebensverknüpfung\\n{5}, schicke den Wiederverwerteten Kampfbot aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege vier +1/+1-Marken, eine Fliegend-Marke, eine Wachsamkeit-Marke, eine Trampelschaden-Marke und eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf sie. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c494bb7d-11e1-4cd7-9858-55aa31cc4a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 588579}, \'multiverseid\': 588579}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreur de récupération\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, piétinement, lien de vie\\n{5}, exilez le Bagarreur de récupération depuis votre cimetière : Choisissez une créature ciblée. Mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1, un marqueur « vol », un marqueur « vigilance », un marqueur « piétinement » et un marqueur « lien de vie » sur cette créature. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28d26ba-2f23-4993-a0b6-58a2961a46fd\', \'multiverseId\': 588595}, \'multiverseid\': 588595}, {\'name\': \'廃物製の喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、トランプル、絆魂\\n{5}, あなたの墓地にある廃物製の喧嘩屋を追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個、飛行・カウンター１個、警戒・カウンター１個、トランプル・カウンター１個、絆魂・カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1eada1a-af5c-422f-a482-e09bb6bcc223\', \'multiverseId\': 588611}, \'multiverseid\': 588611}, {\'name\': \'拼装好斗械\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，践踏，系命\\n{5}，从你的坟墓场放逐拼装好斗械：选择目标生物。在该生物上放置四个+1/+1指示物，一个飞行指示物，一个警戒指示物，一个践踏指示物和一个系命指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0c720ad-a533-427e-97d6-4ebdf1dc2b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 588627}, \'multiverseid\': 588627}]', "[{'name': 'Wirbler-Räuberin', 'text': 'Wenn die Wirbler-Räuberin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 farblose Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Handwerker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588856&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5e973ac-eda9-4adf-96c3-bd321f9f97e0', 'multiverseId': 588856}, 'multiverseid': 588856}, {'name': 'Bribona de los zumbones', 'text': 'Cuando la Bribona de los zumbones entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero incoloras 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nGirar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Artífice bribón humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589000&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '622b5056-a92b-4937-ba80-b5ef48e329f8', 'multiverseId': 589000}, 'multiverseid': 589000}, {'name': 'Gredine à voltigeurs', 'text': 'Quand la Gredine à voltigeurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et gredin et artificier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589144&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebb4acfc-cbe1-4bc3-b47d-c4abf9391fb0', 'multiverseId': 589144}, 'multiverseid': 589144}, {'name': 'Canaglia dei Turbinanti', 'text': 'Quando la Canaglia dei Turbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolori con volare.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Artefice Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589288&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7833e78b-2b26-4250-b377-1e0a266ff87c', 'multiverseId': 589288}, 'multiverseid': 589288}, {'name': 'つむじ風のならず者', 'text': 'つむじ風のならず者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるアーティファクト２つをタップする：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589432&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '853fed4d-d557-4fcd-b45a-5e1b2f13e11b', 'multiverseId': 589432}, 'multiverseid': 589432}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wracksucherin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Wracksucherin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Du erzeugst für jede Nichtland-Karte in dessen Friedhof, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurde, einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}. Dieses Mana kann nicht ausgegeben werden, um einen Nichtartefakt-Zauberspruch zu wirken.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2c0c4e-e5bc-47ab-9239-d1bce373de42\', \'multiverseId\': 588422}, \'multiverseid\': 588422}, {\'name\': \'Cazarruinas\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Cazarruinas entre al campo de batalla, elige un jugador objetivo. Creas una ficha de Piedra de poder girada por cada carta que no sea tierra en el cementerio de ese jugador que haya ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno. (Es un artefacto con "{T}: Agrega {C}. Este maná no se puede usar para lanzar hechizos que no sean de artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3415a8-ae41-4ea8-ad79-ccb759b88b14\', \'multiverseId\': 588438}, \'multiverseid\': 588438}, {\'name\': "Chasseuse d\'épaves", \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Chasseuse d\'épaves arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un joueur ciblé. Vous créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé pour chaque carte non-terrain dans le cimetière de ce joueur qui y a été mise, ce tour-ci, depuis le champ de bataille. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C}. Ce mana ne peut pas être dépensé pour lancer un sort non-artefact. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b218b30-40c6-4159-9559-88551c91532c\', \'multiverseId\': 588454}, \'multiverseid\': 588454}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatrice di Rottami\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Cacciatrice di Rottami entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un giocatore bersaglio. Crei una pedina Pietra del Potere TAPpata per ogni carta non terra nel cimitero di quel giocatore che vi è stata messa dal campo di battaglia in questo turno. (È un artefatto con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}. Questo mana non può essere speso per lanciare una magia non artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf6ef76-fc1b-4e2c-a780-5bd8cb1517e5\', \'multiverseId\': 588470}, \'multiverseid\': 588470}, {\'name\': \'瓦礫捜し\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n瓦礫捜しが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは、このターンに戦場からそのプレイヤーの墓地に置かれてそこにあり土地でないカード１枚につき１つのパワーストーン・トークンをタップ状態で生成する。（それは、「{T}：{C}を加える。このマナはアーティファクトでない呪文を唱えるためには支払えない。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0ddec6-f395-469b-a589-a52bac784a83\', \'multiverseId\': 588486}, \'multiverseid\': 588486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wracksucherin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Wracksucherin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Du erzeugst für jede Nichtland-Karte in dessen Friedhof, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurde, einen getappten Kraftstein-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4a6fd7-ff88-4233-9596-b2db9d2b6d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 588573}, \'multiverseid\': 588573}, {\'name\': "Chasseuse d\'épaves", \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Chasseuse d\'épaves arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un joueur ciblé. Vous créez un jeton Lithoforce engagé pour chaque carte non-terrain dans le cimetière de ce joueur qui y a été mise, ce tour-ci, depuis le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'645dc23f-d40a-46c1-b276-17973f2c3f23\', \'multiverseId\': 588589}, \'multiverseid\': 588589}, {\'name\': \'瓦礫捜し\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n瓦礫捜しが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは、このターンに戦場からそのプレイヤーの墓地に置かれてそこにあり土地でないカード１枚につき１つのパワーストーン・トークンをタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ad3fec-1c8f-4d9e-8bf1-8a4c5eaee934\', \'multiverseId\': 588605}, \'multiverseid\': 588605}, {\'name\': \'残骸搜猎人\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当残骸搜猎人进战场时，选择目标牌手。该牌手的坟墓场中每有一张本回合从战场进入该处的非地牌，你便派出一个已横置的魔力石衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688962d5-ad82-456e-9bb5-aece39382f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 588621}, \'multiverseid\': 588621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wundersamer Schmelztiegel\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments millst du zwei Karten. Schicke dann eine per Zufall bestimmte Nichtland-Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere sie. Du kannst die Kopie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Ein auf diese Weise gewirkter Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruch wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588431&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6fac1c7-3ba6-4ed8-979a-522198316401\', \'multiverseId\': 588431}, \'multiverseid\': 588431}, {\'name\': \'Crisol magnífico\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {2}.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, muele dos cartas, luego exilia una carta que no sea tierra al azar de tu cementerio. Cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia sin pagar su coste de maná. (Un hechizo de permanente lanzado de esta manera se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127f414a-e92f-451a-897b-74181082fd86\', \'multiverseId\': 588447}, \'multiverseid\': 588447}, {\'name\': \'Creuset merveilleux\', \'text\': \'Les permanents que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, meulez deux cartes, puis exilez une carte non-terrain au hasard depuis votre cimetière. Copiez-la. Vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana. (Un sort de permanent lancé de cette manière devient un jeton.)\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf267b8-a8da-45d3-806d-3ac336cd6386\', \'multiverseId\': 588463}, \'multiverseid\': 588463}, {\'name\': \'Crogiolo Prodigioso\', \'text\': "I permanenti che controlli hanno egida {2}.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, macina due carte, poi esilia una carta non terra a caso dal tuo cimitero. Copia quella carta. Puoi lanciare la copia senza pagare il suo costo di mana. ((Una magia permanente lanciata in questo modo diventa una pedina.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62fb8b15-b1c3-481c-af96-0b70e5cf06de\', \'multiverseId\': 588479}, \'multiverseid\': 588479}, {\'name\': \'驚異のるつぼ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは護法{2}を持つ。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、カード２枚を切削し、その後、あなたの墓地にあり土地でないカード１枚を無作為に選んで追放し、コピーする。あなたはそのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。（これにより唱えたパーマネント・呪文はトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b3dd4d8-c584-4483-a0bb-6af8e5778383\', \'multiverseId\': 588495}, \'multiverseid\': 588495}]', "[{'name': 'Wundersamer Schmelztiegel', 'text': 'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {2}.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments millst du zwei Karten. Schicke dann eine per Zufall bestimmte Nichtland-Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere sie. Du kannst die Kopie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Ein auf diese Weise gewirkter Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruch wird zu einem Spielstein.)', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588582&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f44aacbd-c384-4408-be3f-faa0da5f7a23', 'multiverseId': 588582}, 'multiverseid': 588582}, {'name': 'Creuset merveilleux', 'text': 'Les permanents que vous contrôlez ont parade {2}.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, meulez deux cartes, puis exilez une carte non-terrain au hasard depuis votre cimetière. Copiez-la. Vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana. (Un sort de permanent lancé de cette manière devient un jeton.)', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588598&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4906e558-a752-44f6-9f83-3f9ac568f5b6', 'multiverseId': 588598}, 'multiverseid': 588598}, {'name': '驚異のるつぼ', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは護法{2}を持つ。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、カード２枚を切削し、その後、あなたの墓地にあり土地でないカード１枚を無作為に選んで追放し、コピーする。あなたはそのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。（これにより唱えたパーマネント・呪文はトークンになる。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588614&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4159a038-399f-44c6-b9b9-8b3160fe5365', 'multiverseId': 588614}, 'multiverseid': 588614}, {'name': '奇异炼炉', 'text': '由你操控的永久物具有守护{2}。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，磨两张牌，然后随机从你的坟墓场放逐一张非地牌。将其复制。你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。（以此法施放的永久物咒语会成为衍生物。）', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588630&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b67db896-bc22-4060-a0d7-6ebe86178dc1', 'multiverseId': 588630}, 'multiverseid': 588630}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelpfad-Läuterin\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, und Länderkarten in deiner Bibliothek sind Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Heiligkeit liegt nicht in den Worten eines Druiden oder in den Ritualen von Titanias Hof. Sie liegt hier, im Schlamm, wo Gaea ihre Seele offenbart, durch die Zeremonie entfesselt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586474&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872744ed-c5a8-45f7-b275-f7e2ec2aa556\', \'multiverseId\': 586474}, \'multiverseid\': 586474}, {\'name\': \'Purificadora de sendarraíz\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas y las cartas de tierra de tu biblioteca son básicas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo sagrado no está en las palabras de un druida ni en los rituales de la corte de Titania. Se encuentra aquí, en el barro en el que Gaia descubre su alma, libre de toda ceremonia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09035eb8-4bc0-4618-88d8-89df84df6d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 586482}, \'multiverseid\': 586482}, {\'name\': \'Purificatrice de la Voie des racines\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez et les cartes de terrain dans votre bibliothèque sont des terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Le sacré ne se trouve pas dans les paroles d\'un druide, ni même dans les rituels de la cour de Titania. Il est ici, dans la boue, où Gaia dénude son âme, libérée de toute cérémonie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de103016-bcc8-416d-958c-8a4bef7356c7\', \'multiverseId\': 586490}, \'multiverseid\': 586490}, {\'name\': \'Purificatrice del Radicammino\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli e le carte terra nel tuo grimorio sono base.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La sacralità non si trova nelle parole di un druido e neppure nei rituali della corte di Titania. Si trova qui, nel fango, dove Gea mette a nudo la sua anima, scevra di cerimonie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8373ab0d-2bdb-4ee7-81a3-c67f9d6d3763\', \'multiverseId\': 586498}, \'multiverseid\': 586498}, {\'name\': \'根の道の浄化師\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地と、あなたのライブラリーにあるすべての土地・カードは基本である。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「神聖はドルイドの言葉などには宿らない。ましてやティタニアの宮廷における儀礼に宿るはずがない。儀式に縛られることのない、ガイアの魂が垣間見えるこの泥の中にこそ宿るのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2391ce2e-6956-43d2-8d77-521d8fadae6a\', \'multiverseId\': 586506}, \'multiverseid\': 586506}, {\'name\': \'Purificadora da Via das Raízes\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla e os cards de terreno em seu grimório são básicos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O sagrado não está nas palavras do druida, tampouco nos rituais da corte de Titânia. Ele está é aqui, na lama, onde Gaia expõe a alma sem a restrição das cerimônias."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af708f25-22bf-44f7-8a1d-ec2be43df302\', \'multiverseId\': 586522}, \'multiverseid\': 586522}, {\'name\': \'根径涤净师\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地和你牌库中的地牌都是基本。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「圣恩并非存于德鲁伊的祷告之中，甚至不见于泰坦尼亚教廷仪式。它正蕴于此处，土地泥壤便是盖亚显灵之所：她随性而来，不受缛节束缚。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b53fa0-fdee-45af-89b7-52847a0d513b\', \'multiverseId\': 586538}, \'multiverseid\': 586538}]', "[{'name': 'Wurzelpfad-Läuterin', 'text': 'Länder, die du kontrollierst, und Länderkarten in deiner Bibliothek sind Standardländer.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588510&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '148e5eb9-5e07-4bb4-9516-ce8bd6d90f10', 'multiverseId': 588510}, 'multiverseid': 588510}, {'name': 'Purificatrice de la Voie des racines', 'text': 'Les terrains que vous contrôlez et les cartes de terrain dans votre bibliothèque sont des terrains de base.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588521&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e29cafa4-a6a8-4fba-bef9-4f184bd6df2e', 'multiverseId': 588521}, 'multiverseid': 588521}, {'name': '根の道の浄化師', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地と、あなたのライブラリーにあるすべての土地・カードは基本である。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588532&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f77a82cb-4d26-46db-b6a7-88d2f9a5f3eb', 'multiverseId': 588532}, 'multiverseid': 588532}, {'name': '根径涤净师', 'text': '由你操控的地和你牌库中的地牌都是基本。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588543&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7075d49e-9d7e-4403-9fa6-02b22ce8639c', 'multiverseId': 588543}, 'multiverseid': 588543}]", "[{'name': 'Zerfallende Nekropolis', 'text': 'Die Zerfallende Nekropolis kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}, {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Es heißt, dass die Geister der ertrunkenen Toten ihre Lichter an die zerbrochenen Galionsfiguren hängen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588934&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b62b6ea-2ba5-4797-84e8-4710568ed968', 'multiverseId': 588934}, 'multiverseid': 588934}, {'name': 'Necrópolis desmoronándose', 'text': 'La Necrópolis desmoronándose entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}, {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Dicen que los espíritus de quienes murieron ahogados cuelgan sus faroles de los mascarones destruidos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589078&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b319457-85a8-428f-a56e-3c84b7992caf', 'multiverseId': 589078}, 'multiverseid': 589078}, {'name': 'Nécropole croulante', 'text': 'La Nécropole croulante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}, {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'On raconte que les esprits des noyés suspendent leurs lumières aux figures de proue brisées.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589222&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c598d7f-c5c8-405d-8b08-c7afe8244691', 'multiverseId': 589222}, 'multiverseid': 589222}, {'name': 'Necropoli in Sfacelo', 'text': 'La Necropoli in Sfacelo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}, {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Dicono che gli spiriti degli annegati appendano le loro lanterne alle polene spezzate.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589366&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3506bba-b31e-42f2-95ab-01afee8c875e', 'multiverseId': 589366}, 'multiverseid': 589366}, {'name': '崩れゆく死滅都市', 'text': '崩れゆく死滅都市はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '水死体の霊魂は自身の灯を砕けた傀儡にくくりつけると言われている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589510&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89e38343-733a-44ca-923d-791878136984', 'multiverseId': 589510}, 'multiverseid': 589510}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zweizack der Thassa\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, greifen in diesem Zug an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Verzauberungsartefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nur Kiora würde es wagen, die Waffe einer Gottheit zu stehlen. Nur Kiora konnte dabei erfolgreich sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf427712-f45c-4724-9066-bd067b41c057\', \'multiverseId\': 588835}, \'multiverseid\': 588835}, {\'name\': \'Bidente de Tassa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar una carta.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes atacan este turno si pueden.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto encantamiento legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Kiora era la única que se hubiera atrevido a robarle el arma a una diosa... y la única que lo consiguió.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c65a631-c39c-48a7-a441-e5689e230408\', \'multiverseId\': 588979}, \'multiverseid\': 588979}, {\'name\': \'Bident de Thassa\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\\n{1}{U}, {T} : Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent attaquent ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Artefact-enchantement légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Seule Kiora aurait osé voler l\'arme d\'un dieu. Seule Kiora aurait pu réussir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d01120e-9856-4777-9739-3b289f6a4538\', \'multiverseId\': 589123}, \'multiverseid\': 589123}, {\'name\': \'Bidente di Thassa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare una carta.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari attaccano in questo turno, se possono farlo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Incantesimo Leggendario\', \'flavor\': "Solo Kiora avrebbe osato rubare l\'arma di una divinità. Solo Kiora poteva riuscirci.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff4a795e-9a96-49fc-a089-d76d84541a03\', \'multiverseId\': 589267}, \'multiverseid\': 589267}, {\'name\': \'タッサの二叉槍\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\\n{1}{U},{T}：このターン、対戦相手がコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'キオーラでなければ神から武器を奪おうなどと思わないだろう。キオーラでなければ成功するわけがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7cf645b-c9e9-4c05-beff-39677bcb1133\', \'multiverseId\': 589411}, \'multiverseid\': 589411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zündelnder Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\n{1}{R}: Der Zündelnde Höllendrache erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn er fliegt, brennt der Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c76fb33-f07d-497a-878b-20987ec8c7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 588872}, \'multiverseid\': 588872}, {\'name\': \'Engendro inflamador\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\n{1}{R}: El Engendro inflamador obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Su vuelo prende fuego a los cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653756d2-039b-4711-bd50-cb08cd3b7fef\', \'multiverseId\': 589016}, \'multiverseid\': 589016}, {\'name\': \'Embraseur escouflenfer\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\n{1}{R} : L\'Embraseur escouflenfer gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Son envol embrase le ciel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'681dc790-1ca5-4e1b-b811-24090c6a0a89\', \'multiverseId\': 589160}, \'multiverseid\': 589160}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale Incendiario\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\n{1}{R}: Il Nibbio Infernale Incendiario prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo volo dà fuoco al cielo stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eccc9212-b62b-41e2-8a50-e73545f1ebe0\', \'multiverseId\': 589304}, \'multiverseid\': 589304}, {\'name\': \'ヘルカイトの点火者\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、ヘルカイトの点火者は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'それが飛びたてば、空自身が燃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6501b3-75aa-4195-83fb-a49e353257cd\', \'multiverseId\': 589448}, \'multiverseid\': 589448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äthergläubiger Aburteiler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{W}{B}, {T}: Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n{2}{U}: Enttappe den Äthergläubigen Aburteiler.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vedalken, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Magier von Esper entwickelten Waffen, die solche Zerstörungskraft hatten, dass ein echter Krieg unnötig erschien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588838&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a050c1f6-ab63-4146-81f2-f4c8af4a4159\', \'multiverseId\': 588838}, \'multiverseid\': 588838}, {\'name\': \'Sentenciador etereado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{W}{B}, {T}: Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo.\\n{2}{U}: Endereza el Sentenciador etereado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Caballero vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos de Esper concibieron unas armas tan devastadoras que la guerra parecía innecesaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a8348e-19f0-4f0d-b4b8-3bd5c3789fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 588982}, \'multiverseid\': 588982}, {\'name\': \'Adjudicateur des Éthermentés\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{1}{W}{B}, {T} : Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement.\\n{2}{U} : Dégagez l\'Adjudicateur des Éthermentés.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : vedalken et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Les mages d\'Esper conçurent des armes si dévastatrices qu\'une guerre parut toujours futile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b5cf98-c6b5-4714-ac93-ff387e34b613\', \'multiverseId\': 589126}, \'multiverseid\': 589126}, {\'name\': \'Giudice Eterico\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{W}{B}, {T}: Distruggi una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n{2}{U}: STAPpa il Giudice Eterico.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Cavaliere Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi di Esper progettavano le loro armi in modo da renderle talmente devastanti che la guerra non sembrava più necessaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f065b2e0-0381-42d6-81cd-b188ab500643\', \'multiverseId\': 589270}, \'multiverseid\': 589270}, {\'name\': \'エーテル宣誓会の審判人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{W}{B},{T}：クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n{2}{U}：エーテル宣誓会の審判人をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'エスパーの魔道士は武器を改造し、戦争が不必要であると思わせるほど壊滅的なものに仕上げた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726a5acb-defe-469f-8299-f67b62c0d65a\', \'multiverseId\': 589414}, \'multiverseid\': 589414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätherium-Skulpteur\', \'text\': \'Artefaktzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vedalken, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die berühmtesten Künstler verzichten ganz auf Werkzeuge und formen das Metall nur mit Hand und Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdfb6257-2707-4017-af64-888753a7ca14\', \'multiverseId\': 588837}, \'multiverseid\': 588837}, {\'name\': \'Escultora de eterium\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Artífice vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Los más grandes maestros del arte abandonan todas sus herramientas, dando forma al metal solo con las manos y la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=588981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd6bea0-8761-4995-8f19-5ca95c6ef211\', \'multiverseId\': 588981}, \'multiverseid\': 588981}, {\'name\': "Sculpteur d\'étherium", \'text\': "Les sorts d\'artefact que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : vedalken et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les plus grands maîtres abandonnent les outils et façonnent le métal uniquement avec la main et l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe42000-3e12-4e64-985b-741909f322b6\', \'multiverseId\': 589125}, \'multiverseid\': 589125}, {\'name\': \'Scultrice di Eterium\', \'text\': \'Le magie artefatto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Artefice Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'I più grandi maestri artigiani abbandonano completamente gli attrezzi, modellando il metallo solo con le mani e la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93dc0d88-cb4d-454d-a582-63d46465e48e\', \'multiverseId\': 589269}, \'multiverseid\': 589269}, {\'name\': \'エーテリウムの彫刻家\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'最も偉大なる工芸の達人ともなれば、道具は全て投げ打ち、手と精神だけで金属を刻むものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62635f37-81d2-4d58-9951-cf3610aae51a\', \'multiverseId\': 589413}, \'multiverseid\': 589413}]']
